(2677960, 372188, 37430, '<td valign="top">I honestly do not find this photo "serene" or example of zen photography. The reason why I choose to comment on this one is the execution of photo. It is a superb photo and is very well composed. I love the way it communicates the feeling. Technically well executed and lighting is superb. But sorry- I cannot  see the relation to challenge theme (maybe due to my own limited knowledge on subject) and giving this just 6 for now. I''d have given this 9 or 10 any given day if this was for any other challenge where is fitted better.</td>', 'I honestly do not find this photo "serene" or example of zen photography. The reason why I choose to comment on this one is the execution of photo. It is a superb photo and is very well composed. I love the way it communicates the feeling. Technically well executed and lighting is superb. But sorry- I cannot  see the relation to challenge theme (maybe due to my own limited knowledge on subject) and giving this just 6 for now. I''d have given this 9 or 10 any given day if this was for any other challenge where is fitted better.', '2006-07-31 02:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2677965, 372548, 47968, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the focus and timing. I also like the spotlight emphasizing the marble. Only complaint is the oddly shaped lower light reflection in the marble, but that''s kinda unavoidable.</td>', 'Nice job with the focus and timing. I also like the spotlight emphasizing the marble. Only complaint is the oddly shaped lower light reflection in the marble, but that''s kinda unavoidable.', '2006-07-31 02:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2677977, 372516, 47968, '<td valign="top">Alittle torn with this one. I really like the background of trees and how you''ve tried to make the single fern stand out. But the base of the image is just too busy causing the fern to not stand out as much.</td>', 'Alittle torn with this one. I really like the background of trees and how you''ve tried to make the single fern stand out. But the base of the image is just too busy causing the fern to not stand out as much.', '2006-07-31 02:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2677981, 372398, 35545, '<td valign="top">This is just me, but if you were going to use a dead center placement, I think you would have been better off using a square format.  For me, if you were going to use a rectangular format, you should use the rile of thirds and have the pebble off-center.  Very zen feeling in the tones and use of depth of field.</td>', 'This is just me, but if you were going to use a dead center placement, I think you would have been better off using a square format.  For me, if you were going to use a rectangular format, you should use the rile of thirds and have the pebble off-center.  Very zen feeling in the tones and use of depth of field.', '2006-07-31 02:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2677990, 372269, 47968, '<td valign="top">Wow, great focus on the insect. love the detail and also the blured flower.</td>', 'Wow, great focus on the insect. love the detail and also the blured flower.', '2006-07-31 02:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2677994, 371812, 35545, '<td valign="top">Really good composition, but I wish your perspective were better with respect to the koi.  He''s just an orange line, not a fish.</td>', 'Really good composition, but I wish your perspective were better with respect to the koi.  He''s just an orange line, not a fish.', '2006-07-31 02:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2677995, 372468, 3214, '<td valign="top">Absolutely superb, lighting and texture and meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely superb, lighting and texture and meeting the challenge.', '2006-07-31 02:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2677999, 372037, 47968, '<td valign="top">Great idea and you''ve pulled it off pretty well. Kind of an ''everything is one'' type of zen. Did you have to wait long or just stumbled upon it?</td>', 'Great idea and you''ve pulled it off pretty well. Kind of an ''everything is one'' type of zen. Did you have to wait long or just stumbled upon it?', '2006-07-31 02:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
