(2678041, 371790, 60379, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, however, it appears to be a bit ''blurred'' togehter, not enough definition in each of the stones...</td>', 'I like the concept, however, it appears to be a bit ''blurred'' togehter, not enough definition in each of the stones...', '2006-07-31 02:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678045, 372151, 58430, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful location.</td>', 'What a beautiful location.', '2006-07-31 02:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678053, 372037, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective.  This is very quiet, if the only subject was the tree, however, the ground (although interesting), makes the eye very busy by looking at all the minute details within.  For that reason, I''m not scoring it as highly as I''d like.</td>', 'Very nice perspective.  This is very quiet, if the only subject was the tree, however, the ground (although interesting), makes the eye very busy by looking at all the minute details within.  For that reason, I''m not scoring it as highly as I''d like.', '2006-07-31 02:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678057, 372213, 60379, '<td valign="top">I really liked this photo, but not sure it speaks of ''Zen''.  The baby is precious though, and you did a great job of capturing his stillness.</td>', 'I really liked this photo, but not sure it speaks of ''Zen''.  The baby is precious though, and you did a great job of capturing his stillness.', '2006-07-31 02:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678058, 372510, 37430, '<td valign="top">I feel this would have been better without flowers on rocks. Just the rocks would have give more "natural" feeling. Still a well executed photo.6.</td>', 'I feel this would have been better without flowers on rocks. Just the rocks would have give more "natural" feeling. Still a well executed photo.6.', '2006-07-31 02:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678062, 371266, 58430, '<td valign="top">Great background.  Not crazy about the flower.</td>', 'Great background.  Not crazy about the flower.', '2006-07-31 02:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678063, 372121, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this is tonally very soft, it is too busy to be considered ''zen''...</td>', 'Although this is tonally very soft, it is too busy to be considered ''zen''...', '2006-07-31 02:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678065, 371445, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo, but there is alot of noise in the sky, taking away from it''s sense of zen.</td>', 'A very nice photo, but there is alot of noise in the sky, taking away from it''s sense of zen.', '2006-07-31 02:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
