(2678107, 372142, 75713, '<td valign="top">top mark (8) so far...... this photo is simple, the shapes in it are simple and calming - your composition is perfect - a viewing pleasure and added to my favs.</td>', 'top mark (8) so far...... this photo is simple, the shapes in it are simple and calming - your composition is perfect - a viewing pleasure and added to my favs.', '2006-07-31 02:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
