(2678114, 370306, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very pretty shot, definately displays some calm, but there is just too much going on here, the land, the building, the trees, the mountains, the clouds, the rock in the middle of the water, all just makes it overall too busy.</td>', 'A very pretty shot, definately displays some calm, but there is just too much going on here, the land, the building, the trees, the mountains, the clouds, the rock in the middle of the water, all just makes it overall too busy.', '2006-07-31 02:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678117, 369602, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of minimal color, I like the way that it starts at the top in a brighter blue sky, moving downward into tones of grays, with the blue picked up in the float.  If the water had appeared a little more calm, I would have scored this higher.</td>', 'Very nice use of minimal color, I like the way that it starts at the top in a brighter blue sky, moving downward into tones of grays, with the blue picked up in the float.  If the water had appeared a little more calm, I would have scored this higher.', '2006-07-31 02:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678124, 369603, 60379, '<td valign="top">A nice concept, but it''s calmness appears to be interrupted by the movement of the water.</td>', 'A nice concept, but it''s calmness appears to be interrupted by the movement of the water.', '2006-07-31 02:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678131, 372307, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although the minimal tonal qualities of this is an excellant attempt at meeting the challenge, I found the business of the leaf to disturb it''s calmness.  Just a bit, but enough that I didn''t vote this as high as I''d like.</td>', 'Although the minimal tonal qualities of this is an excellant attempt at meeting the challenge, I found the business of the leaf to disturb it''s calmness.  Just a bit, but enough that I didn''t vote this as high as I''d like.', '2006-07-31 02:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678140, 372537, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice tone in this one, although I don''t get a sense of serenity when I look at it.  At least, not to a great degree.  It is a nice shot though!</td>', 'Very nice tone in this one, although I don''t get a sense of serenity when I look at it.  At least, not to a great degree.  It is a nice shot though!', '2006-07-31 02:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678146, 370946, 60379, '<td valign="top">I think this is a very nice shot, however, to my eye, although the water is calm and still, there is too much going on here that distracts my eye from the calm parts.  The rocks are craggy, teh small dirt mound in the middle distracts, as does the grass to the left side of the photo.  A nice photo, but just not quite there.</td>', 'I think this is a very nice shot, however, to my eye, although the water is calm and still, there is too much going on here that distracts my eye from the calm parts.  The rocks are craggy, teh small dirt mound in the middle distracts, as does the grass to the left side of the photo.  A nice photo, but just not quite there.', '2006-07-31 02:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678151, 371621, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this photo is simple, the subject is minimal overall, the movement of the water is a bit distracting to the overall attempt at stillness.</td>', 'Although this photo is simple, the subject is minimal overall, the movement of the water is a bit distracting to the overall attempt at stillness.', '2006-07-31 02:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678161, 371590, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although the subject is at rest, and the subject is minimal in the overall photo, the business that the light creates in the water disturbs the overall attempt at a quiet photo.</td>', 'Although the subject is at rest, and the subject is minimal in the overall photo, the business that the light creates in the water disturbs the overall attempt at a quiet photo.', '2006-07-31 02:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678169, 372316, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very pretty photo, and the subject matter is very minimal.  However, there is just too much there, too many leaves, too much graininess in the boards, for it to be truely a quiet photo.  It is very pretty though!</td>', 'A very pretty photo, and the subject matter is very minimal.  However, there is just too much there, too many leaves, too much graininess in the boards, for it to be truely a quiet photo.  It is very pretty though!', '2006-07-31 02:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678173, 370151, 60379, '<td valign="top">A little too much movement in the ocean to truly be a quiet photo.  Very pretty, however.</td>', 'A little too much movement in the ocean to truly be a quiet photo.  Very pretty, however.', '2006-07-31 03:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678179, 372532, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is very still, yet, it is still busy, as the eye is drawn into the details of the person, and the lines interrupt it''s serenity.</td>', 'This is very still, yet, it is still busy, as the eye is drawn into the details of the person, and the lines interrupt it''s serenity.', '2006-07-31 03:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678187, 370707, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo, minimal subject and minimal color makes this one meet the challenge very nicely.</td>', 'A very nice photo, minimal subject and minimal color makes this one meet the challenge very nicely.', '2006-07-31 03:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678196, 369659, 60379, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, but it is not as calm to the eye as I''d like.  It is simply too busy, although I know the water is still, and the lillypads are unmoving, just visually, it is distracting.  It causes the eye to search this photo for all of the details contained there-in, meaning that it is visually not calm.</td>', 'I really like this photo, but it is not as calm to the eye as I''d like.  It is simply too busy, although I know the water is still, and the lillypads are unmoving, just visually, it is distracting.  It causes the eye to search this photo for all of the details contained there-in, meaning that it is visually not calm.', '2006-07-31 03:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678199, 371438, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this photo has minimal color, there is alot of interest that draws the eye all over the photo...  The movement of the two subjects, the movement of the waves, just makes it overall busy to the eye.</td>', 'Although this photo has minimal color, there is alot of interest that draws the eye all over the photo...  The movement of the two subjects, the movement of the waves, just makes it overall busy to the eye.', '2006-07-31 03:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678205, 372514, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very nice photo.  Great use of tone and color, however, the eye is drawn into this details of this photo, disturbing it''s quiet atmosphere.  Too many trees, too many leaves, my eye wants to roam over all of it.  Still, a gorgeous shot!</td>', 'A very nice photo.  Great use of tone and color, however, the eye is drawn into this details of this photo, disturbing it''s quiet atmosphere.  Too many trees, too many leaves, my eye wants to roam over all of it.  Still, a gorgeous shot!', '2006-07-31 03:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678207, 372402, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very nice, soft, quiet, simple photo.  Definately meets the challenge.  I think I''d like it more in focus, but I can see what your intention is.</td>', 'A very nice, soft, quiet, simple photo.  Definately meets the challenge.  I think I''d like it more in focus, but I can see what your intention is.', '2006-07-31 03:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678211, 372393, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is very nice, simple and calm.  I really am not feeling for the color, I think a softer more natural color would have worked better in this.  The color really stands out too harshly against the white background, which disrupts the overall attempt at serenity.</td>', 'This is very nice, simple and calm.  I really am not feeling for the color, I think a softer more natural color would have worked better in this.  The color really stands out too harshly against the white background, which disrupts the overall attempt at serenity.', '2006-07-31 03:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678214, 372536, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although I can tell that the day here is quiet, and the deer is at rest, the photo itself is too busy to really create any zen.</td>', 'Although I can tell that the day here is quiet, and the deer is at rest, the photo itself is too busy to really create any zen.', '2006-07-31 03:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678218, 372118, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this is very subtle in the use of color, and an overall pretty pic, I just feel that the clouds, being the subjects, are too busy, and causes the eye to search the photo for all of their details, disrupting any attempt at stillness.</td>', 'Although this is very subtle in the use of color, and an overall pretty pic, I just feel that the clouds, being the subjects, are too busy, and causes the eye to search the photo for all of their details, disrupting any attempt at stillness.', '2006-07-31 03:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678226, 370790, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very pretty photo, although it would have been nicer against a more solid color background.  The background is too busy, that it takes away from the simplicity of the subjects.</td>', 'A very pretty photo, although it would have been nicer against a more solid color background.  The background is too busy, that it takes away from the simplicity of the subjects.', '2006-07-31 03:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678231, 371982, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this photo does create an air of serenity, the eye is drawn into all of the details of the sky and rays of light, making it visually a little too busy.</td>', 'Although this photo does create an air of serenity, the eye is drawn into all of the details of the sky and rays of light, making it visually a little too busy.', '2006-07-31 03:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678243, 371010, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, nice use of color, great feeling of serenity.</td>', 'Very pretty, nice use of color, great feeling of serenity.', '2006-07-31 03:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678244, 372154, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty picture, and although I can sense the quiet along this path, the photo itself is very busy to the eye.  The slope of the path, the light along it, the leaves, the trees, all make it a bit busier to the eye than I''d like to see in a zen challenge.</td>', 'This is a pretty picture, and although I can sense the quiet along this path, the photo itself is very busy to the eye.  The slope of the path, the light along it, the leaves, the trees, all make it a bit busier to the eye than I''d like to see in a zen challenge.', '2006-07-31 03:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678247, 372396, 60379, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, just that it is a bit busier than I''d like to see in a Zen challenge.</td>', 'A nice photo, just that it is a bit busier than I''d like to see in a Zen challenge.', '2006-07-31 03:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678251, 370993, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great tonal qualities in this pretty photo.  There is just a bit too much going on here for it to truly give me a sense of serenity.  If only the boats weren''t in the background, it would be about perfect.</td>', 'Great tonal qualities in this pretty photo.  There is just a bit too much going on here for it to truly give me a sense of serenity.  If only the boats weren''t in the background, it would be about perfect.', '2006-07-31 03:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678265, 372495, 27164, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, love the hyper-saturated colors and the composition.</td>', 'Beautiful, love the hyper-saturated colors and the composition.', '2006-07-31 03:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678270, 372217, 27164, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is...simply breathtaking.  Looks like a ribbon-winner to me.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wow, this is...simply breathtaking.  Looks like a ribbon-winner to me.  Good luck.', '2006-07-31 03:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678273, 372491, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very nice pic, but a bit too distracted away from the simple subject.  My eye is drawn away from the subject and into the details of the background. To me, that interrupts the serenity that you are trying to create.  Pretty though!</td>', 'A very nice pic, but a bit too distracted away from the simple subject.  My eye is drawn away from the subject and into the details of the background. To me, that interrupts the serenity that you are trying to create.  Pretty though!', '2006-07-31 03:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678275, 372145, 27164, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is one amazing landscape.  Going in my faves.</td>', 'Wow, this is one amazing landscape.  Going in my faves.', '2006-07-31 03:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678277, 372522, 27164, '<td valign="top">Great lighting here.</td>', 'Great lighting here.', '2006-07-31 03:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678280, 372449, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although the tonal qualities of this make it an unimposing photo, there is just too much action going on here for it to meet my standards of zen.  Pretty use of color and light though!</td>', 'Although the tonal qualities of this make it an unimposing photo, there is just too much action going on here for it to meet my standards of zen.  Pretty use of color and light though!', '2006-07-31 03:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678287, 369348, 60379, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I''m just not feeling any serenity in this photo, not in subject, color, tone, or lighting.</td>', 'Sorry, but I''m just not feeling any serenity in this photo, not in subject, color, tone, or lighting.', '2006-07-31 03:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678291, 372495, 44453, '<td valign="top">a very nice "zen" image, simple and quiet.  I''m not sure I would have cut off the boats shadow at the bottom - and I like saturated landscapes but this seems a bit over the top.</td>', 'a very nice "zen" image, simple and quiet.  I''m not sure I would have cut off the boats shadow at the bottom - and I like saturated landscapes but this seems a bit over the top.', '2006-07-31 03:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678292, 371532, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although you did a great job creating an atmosphere that is easiy sensed as being ''quiet'', the photo itself has too much going on in it to be truly ''quiet''.  My eye is drawn into all of the details in this photo, the stones, the reeds, the path, the trees.  All of this disrupts the atmosphere that you tried to create.  Very pretty shot though!</td>', 'Although you did a great job creating an atmosphere that is easiy sensed as being ''quiet'', the photo itself has too much going on in it to be truly ''quiet''.  My eye is drawn into all of the details in this photo, the stones, the reeds, the path, the trees.  All of this disrupts the atmosphere that you tried to create.  Very pretty shot though!', '2006-07-31 03:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678302, 372193, 40718, '<td valign="top">Crap, I almost named my shot exactly the same! Phew...  This is nicely zen. 7</td>', 'Crap, I almost named my shot exactly the same! Phew...  This is nicely zen. 7', '2006-07-31 03:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678303, 372517, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this generates a sense of calm, there is too much detail here for my eye to be at rest.  I''m drawn into the colors, the trees, those small details make it a bit busy in my opinion.</td>', 'Although this generates a sense of calm, there is too much detail here for my eye to be at rest.  I''m drawn into the colors, the trees, those small details make it a bit busy in my opinion.', '2006-07-31 03:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678311, 372168, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although using black and white to minimalize visual distractions in this photo is a nice touch, it is just too busy to be ''zen''.  I know what you are trying to realy in the vision of oposite (yin yang) of this photo, just to me, a highway, even empty, means movement, not calm.  My eye is too distracted by the overall business of this photo.</td>', 'Although using black and white to minimalize visual distractions in this photo is a nice touch, it is just too busy to be ''zen''.  I know what you are trying to realy in the vision of oposite (yin yang) of this photo, just to me, a highway, even empty, means movement, not calm.  My eye is too distracted by the overall business of this photo.', '2006-07-31 03:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678341, 371898, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great example of zen, very still and composed.  I like the contrast of the dark sticks to the powder blue/soft pinks as well but the image feels like there''s a haze to it, like the colors could be richer/deeper somehow.  Not sure if that''s the result of how the light is hitting the water or what.  Still I gave a 7.</td>', 'I think this is a great example of zen, very still and composed.  I like the contrast of the dark sticks to the powder blue/soft pinks as well but the image feels like there''s a haze to it, like the colors could be richer/deeper somehow.  Not sure if that''s the result of how the light is hitting the water or what.  Still I gave a 7.', '2006-07-31 03:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678346, 370708, 10867, '<td valign="top">I find this image very pleasing, but to my eye, the red and black combination just doesn''t convey the idea of silence.</td>', 'I find this image very pleasing, but to my eye, the red and black combination just doesn''t convey the idea of silence.', '2006-07-31 03:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678347, 370523, 11923, '<td valign="top">There''s a wonderful feeling of order to this.  It has a lot of different elements and yet it does not feel noisy or overly busy.  The clean lines and shapes work very well together, the contrast between sharp corners and rounded edges is nicely balanced which helps this feel zen to me.  I gave a 7</td>', 'There''s a wonderful feeling of order to this.  It has a lot of different elements and yet it does not feel noisy or overly busy.  The clean lines and shapes work very well together, the contrast between sharp corners and rounded edges is nicely balanced which helps this feel zen to me.  I gave a 7', '2006-07-31 03:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678349, 371495, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very delicate.  I like the choice you picked for your subject.  It has a great organic feel and a lot of interest with the textures.  I do think it feels zennish as there is a bit of a pattern to the texture that helps calm things down.  The lighting is good but I wish there were a a bit more shadows to help add to the feeling of depth.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Very delicate.  I like the choice you picked for your subject.  It has a great organic feel and a lot of interest with the textures.  I do think it feels zennish as there is a bit of a pattern to the texture that helps calm things down.  The lighting is good but I wish there were a a bit more shadows to help add to the feeling of depth.  I gave a 7', '2006-07-31 03:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678351, 371870, 11923, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  I love the color contrast.  I like the drops of water.  I like the contrast between the silky smooth petal and the rough rocks.  I think this does have a zennish feel though I wish the petal were a bit more cornered rather than edging so close to be centered.  I do like the way you left that corner that drops off in the image, it helps break up the large stone mass and saves it from being just a boring petal on a rock.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Excellent.  I love the color contrast.  I like the drops of water.  I like the contrast between the silky smooth petal and the rough rocks.  I think this does have a zennish feel though I wish the petal were a bit more cornered rather than edging so close to be centered.  I do like the way you left that corner that drops off in the image, it helps break up the large stone mass and saves it from being just a boring petal on a rock.  I gave a 7', '2006-07-31 03:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678356, 372135, 11923, '<td valign="top">While this wouldn''t qualify as completely still, I think the rhythm of the ripples is very zen-like.  Brings to mind the chanting that many associate with meditation.  I thik the flower is lovely though some of the detail seems muted in its redness.  The background makes for a nice contrast to the pop of color and I''m glad that you left some of the still water on the outskirts of the ripples.  It helps center the image and IMO gives it an even greater tie to Zen.  I gave a 7</td>', 'While this wouldn''t qualify as completely still, I think the rhythm of the ripples is very zen-like.  Brings to mind the chanting that many associate with meditation.  I thik the flower is lovely though some of the detail seems muted in its redness.  The background makes for a nice contrast to the pop of color and I''m glad that you left some of the still water on the outskirts of the ripples.  It helps center the image and IMO gives it an even greater tie to Zen.  I gave a 7', '2006-07-31 03:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678362, 372502, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the left-centric composition.  The long lines of the reeds is great, especially how they contrast to the more jagged or curvy sticks above it.  The still-ish water helps bring a feeling of peace to the image and the bobber thingie helps save the image from being a complete wash of grey and brown boringness.  It really helps emphasize the rest of the image.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the left-centric composition.  The long lines of the reeds is great, especially how they contrast to the more jagged or curvy sticks above it.  The still-ish water helps bring a feeling of peace to the image and the bobber thingie helps save the image from being a complete wash of grey and brown boringness.  It really helps emphasize the rest of the image.  I gave a 7', '2006-07-31 03:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678368, 371675, 11923, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  The colors are gorgeous and the shapes are excellent.  I think this might feel a bit more zennish for me if there were only the one boat, particularly that one in the upper left-hand corner, but still the pattern of the shapes makes for a long line to look out which can be calming.  The calm water also helps speak to stillness and serenity and the shapes in general have a simple nature to them.  I gave a 7</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  The colors are gorgeous and the shapes are excellent.  I think this might feel a bit more zennish for me if there were only the one boat, particularly that one in the upper left-hand corner, but still the pattern of the shapes makes for a long line to look out which can be calming.  The calm water also helps speak to stillness and serenity and the shapes in general have a simple nature to them.  I gave a 7', '2006-07-31 03:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678372, 372495, 10867, '<td valign="top">This image is beautiful and simple and has lots of impact, but the colours definitely do not suggest silence to me.  They are too strong and vibrant to do so.</td>', 'This image is beautiful and simple and has lots of impact, but the colours definitely do not suggest silence to me.  They are too strong and vibrant to do so.', '2006-07-31 03:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678378, 372552, 11923, '<td valign="top">A nice simple composition that has a calmness to it with how the frog nearly melts into the background.  I like the large negative space given and the color is very vibrant.  I wish the lighting were a bit brighter on the frog to give it just a smidge more oomph.  The focus looks okay but a bit soft on the backend of the frog.  Over all I think its a good Zen representation.  I gave a 6</td>', 'A nice simple composition that has a calmness to it with how the frog nearly melts into the background.  I like the large negative space given and the color is very vibrant.  I wish the lighting were a bit brighter on the frog to give it just a smidge more oomph.  The focus looks okay but a bit soft on the backend of the frog.  Over all I think its a good Zen representation.  I gave a 6', '2006-07-31 04:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678385, 370761, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think this is beautiful.  I love how it glows out of the background.  There is a lot of shape detail here which some might find too busy, but I think the way its been composed - to the center of the image and surrounded by black - makes the way the different shapes of plants play off one another a zennish experience.  I do wish the image itself were bigger though.  I think for an even stronger "zen" feel having just the floating leaves (leave out the ferns) in a sea of black would really push it higher.  I gave a 6</td>', 'I think this is beautiful.  I love how it glows out of the background.  There is a lot of shape detail here which some might find too busy, but I think the way its been composed - to the center of the image and surrounded by black - makes the way the different shapes of plants play off one another a zennish experience.  I do wish the image itself were bigger though.  I think for an even stronger "zen" feel having just the floating leaves (leave out the ferns) in a sea of black would really push it higher.  I gave a 6', '2006-07-31 04:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678389, 370865, 11923, '<td valign="top">I love the balance of this.  I don''t even think the drop is necessary, but that''s just me.  It does well in its ability to bring the eye to the leaves and bouncing the attention down to the little leaf spikes at the bottom though.  I think the softer focus is perfect, it engenders a tranquil feeling for me and I do admit the drop gives me an impression of stillness.. the pause just before it falls.  Excellent zen capture.  I gave a 7.</td>', 'I love the balance of this.  I don''t even think the drop is necessary, but that''s just me.  It does well in its ability to bring the eye to the leaves and bouncing the attention down to the little leaf spikes at the bottom though.  I think the softer focus is perfect, it engenders a tranquil feeling for me and I do admit the drop gives me an impression of stillness.. the pause just before it falls.  Excellent zen capture.  I gave a 7.', '2006-07-31 04:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678398, 372172, 11923, '<td valign="top">Typically I don''t necessarily find all land/seascapes inherently zen-like.  I do like this one because of the mellow colors and how they smoothly meld together and the fact that the lake is nearly completely still.  There are some ripples but not so much that I lose the feeling of utter calm.  That said I think cropping off the bottom where the rocks or whatever those two whitish-grey things are would help the composition a bit.  This would help make the balance between above the horizon and below a bit more even in my mind.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Typically I don''t necessarily find all land/seascapes inherently zen-like.  I do like this one because of the mellow colors and how they smoothly meld together and the fact that the lake is nearly completely still.  There are some ripples but not so much that I lose the feeling of utter calm.  That said I think cropping off the bottom where the rocks or whatever those two whitish-grey things are would help the composition a bit.  This would help make the balance between above the horizon and below a bit more even in my mind.  I gave a 6', '2006-07-31 04:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678405, 372223, 34938, '<td valign="top">This is a 10 for me...cannot fault it at all...good luck.</td>', 'This is a 10 for me...cannot fault it at all...good luck.', '2006-07-31 04:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678408, 372106, 34938, '<td valign="top">superb...the colours in this and the composition is amazing</td>', 'superb...the colours in this and the composition is amazing', '2006-07-31 04:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678410, 371758, 11923, '<td valign="top">Interesting still life.  Would be very nice in the B&amp;W in color challenge as well.  I like the alternating cup handles, I think that adds balance to the image, I think the lighting is great too.  Focus looks dead on and the composition is nice but I think I''d rather it was shifted just a bit more off-center and in a zen-sense I find the flower distracting.  You have some great lines and curves andthe white and black is working wonderfully together and then eeeeeerrrrt!  Bright yellow!  It really interrupts the visual calm my eyes were enjoying and jolts them out of zen-mode.  Still a very nice image.  I gave a 6</td>', 'Interesting still life.  Would be very nice in the B&W in color challenge as well.  I like the alternating cup handles, I think that adds balance to the image, I think the lighting is great too.  Focus looks dead on and the composition is nice but I think I''d rather it was shifted just a bit more off-center and in a zen-sense I find the flower distracting.  You have some great lines and curves andthe white and black is working wonderfully together and then eeeeeerrrrt!  Bright yellow!  It really interrupts the visual calm my eyes were enjoying and jolts them out of zen-mode.  Still a very nice image.  I gave a 6', '2006-07-31 04:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678419, 372435, 34938, '<td valign="top">this is amazing...how did you do this? My only neg would be the weedy background which is a little distracting, other than that, awesome...love the backlight...I wonder how this would be with a tiny,weeny bit of fill in flash</td>', 'this is amazing...how did you do this? My only neg would be the weedy background which is a little distracting, other than that, awesome...love the backlight...I wonder how this would be with a tiny,weeny bit of fill in flash', '2006-07-31 04:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678420, 372217, 34938, '<td valign="top">this looks amazing! awesome colour and saturation...I love the wide angle and the peacefulness conveyed in the shot...10</td>', 'this looks amazing! awesome colour and saturation...I love the wide angle and the peacefulness conveyed in the shot...10', '2006-07-31 04:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678421, 371505, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely model and a great picture.  I''m having a tough time feeling zen about it as a viewer though.   I think the lighting is great and the composition is very nice for a portrait.  The focus seems a skosh soft in some areas and some detail is lost in that respect.  From a zen standpoint I find the image VERY busy precisely because of the elaborateness of the girl''s outfit.  I don''t feel at peace or serene looking at the image as a whole simply because there''s so much detail in the feathers and the mottled background.   That said I think a closeup of the girl''s face, blowing the feather would be fairly zen to me.  The stillness of the feather floating in the air and the removal of all the extreneous outfit details would simplify the image and that I think would go a long way to giving it more zen.  That is of course just my opinion.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'Lovely model and a great picture.  I''m having a tough time feeling zen about it as a viewer though.   I think the lighting is great and the composition is very nice for a portrait.  The focus seems a skosh soft in some areas and some detail is lost in that respect.  From a zen standpoint I find the image VERY busy precisely because of the elaborateness of the girl''s outfit.  I don''t feel at peace or serene looking at the image as a whole simply because there''s so much detail in the feathers and the mottled background.   That said I think a closeup of the girl''s face, blowing the feather would be fairly zen to me.  The stillness of the feather floating in the air and the removal of all the extreneous outfit details would simplify the image and that I think would go a long way to giving it more zen.  That is of course just my opinion.  I gave a 6.', '2006-07-31 04:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678424, 372267, 34938, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this...amazing colour and composition. The reflected sky is a little grainy and may have been fixed a little, but that''s just me...superb 9</td>', 'I LOVE this...amazing colour and composition. The reflected sky is a little grainy and may have been fixed a little, but that''s just me...superb 9', '2006-07-31 04:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
