(2678595, 372126, 37430, '<td valign="top">Would there be any stillness if there were no ripples to highlight it?! This is perfect example of Zen art and it highlights the "whole" with help of minor subject. I love the sheer simplicity of the composition and I "know" that it needs the mind at rest to see such a beauty. Goodluck.10.</td>', 'Would there be any stillness if there were no ripples to highlight it?! This is perfect example of Zen art and it highlights the "whole" with help of minor subject. I love the sheer simplicity of the composition and I "know" that it needs the mind at rest to see such a beauty. Goodluck.10.', '2006-07-31 05:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678607, 372142, 37430, '<td valign="top">Simple and Zen. The little bit of light from the door could not have been there to see if there was not darkness around. A good combination of Yin and Yang unspoilt by simplicity and creativity. My only crib (a small crib) is that the setup looks a little artificial (is it?). Still a great photo and I hope it does well.8.</td>', 'Simple and Zen. The little bit of light from the door could not have been there to see if there was not darkness around. A good combination of Yin and Yang unspoilt by simplicity and creativity. My only crib (a small crib) is that the setup looks a little artificial (is it?). Still a great photo and I hope it does well.8.', '2006-07-31 05:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678624, 370693, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this meets the challenge as it was described but I sure do like this image. Gets an 8 and a fav from me. Good luck!</td>', 'I''m not sure this meets the challenge as it was described but I sure do like this image. Gets an 8 and a fav from me. Good luck!', '2006-07-31 06:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
