(2678648, 371314, 56400, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how ''zenful'' getting screwed is but I like the shot. You gotta do a ''How It Was Done'' afterward. Great shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure how ''zenful'' getting screwed is but I like the shot. You gotta do a ''How It Was Done'' afterward. Great shot.', '2006-07-31 06:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678653, 372223, 41337, '<td valign="top">Striking image. However for this challenge I''m not sure it''s a perfect fit. For starters you''re trying to convey sound, which you did a great job doing with this image. I can sense the field weaving back in forth in the wind and the sounds it makes. In a challenge that called for "making a photo as silent as can be" you did the opposite. However with that said, this is very zen like and is one of my favorites.</td>', 'Striking image. However for this challenge I''m not sure it''s a perfect fit. For starters you''re trying to convey sound, which you did a great job doing with this image. I can sense the field weaving back in forth in the wind and the sounds it makes. In a challenge that called for "making a photo as silent as can be" you did the opposite. However with that said, this is very zen like and is one of my favorites.', '2006-07-31 06:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2678655, 372034, 62171, '<td valign="top">omg its like a dream come true hangin out with a coat on with a hot cup of tea just lookin out at the water would be like the most relaxing spot ever</td>', 'omg its like a dream come true hangin out with a coat on with a hot cup of tea just lookin out at the water would be like the most relaxing spot ever', '2006-07-31 06:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
