(2679874, 371618, 54843, '<td valign="top">I would like to see more in the foreground as opposed to just the water.  I am not sure what you had to work with, but typically a landscape is more pleasing with both a foreground and background subjects.  This is something I am just learning! So take my advice with a grain of salt.  Great concept though.</td>', 'I would like to see more in the foreground as opposed to just the water.  I am not sure what you had to work with, but typically a landscape is more pleasing with both a foreground and background subjects.  This is something I am just learning! So take my advice with a grain of salt.  Great concept though.', '2006-07-31 13:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
