(2680327, 372495, 51538, '<td valign="top">the way the boat''s shadow is attached to the dark border gives this photo the appearance of a symbol, perhaps a Q.  It is a pleasing effect and unites all the elements within. 9.</td>', 'the way the boat''s shadow is attached to the dark border gives this photo the appearance of a symbol, perhaps a Q.  It is a pleasing effect and unites all the elements within. 9.', '2006-07-31 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
