(2680342, 370286, 58728, '<td valign="top">If this does not get the blue ribbon, I will be totally shocked.  WONDERFUL shot.  10!!!</td>', 'If this does not get the blue ribbon, I will be totally shocked.  WONDERFUL shot.  10!!!', '2006-07-31 15:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680343, 372126, 61818, '<td valign="top">This shot will do well, I''m sure.  Not the most original, but certainly well executed.  I''ve been going back and forth on this debating wether or not the ripples detract from the sense of calm or add to it.  I''m going to go with detracts.  This image as a mirror effect over that gray gradient would have epitomized the challenge description of harmony, stillness, etc. 6.</td>', 'This shot will do well, I''m sure.  Not the most original, but certainly well executed.  I''ve been going back and forth on this debating wether or not the ripples detract from the sense of calm or add to it.  I''m going to go with detracts.  This image as a mirror effect over that gray gradient would have epitomized the challenge description of harmony, stillness, etc. 6.', '2006-07-31 15:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680351, 370772, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  To me, and I find myself saying this often, the bystander detracts from the image.  This shot of nature perfectly meets the challenge of presenting a still, serene scene.  The guy in there adds nothing and distracts the eye.  Would also have liked to see a bit more blur on the waterfalls to really nail the dreamy feeling already established by the light coming through that fog.  Composition is great, nature gave you some perfect lights.  Very nice.  5.</td>', 'Nice photo.  To me, and I find myself saying this often, the bystander detracts from the image.  This shot of nature perfectly meets the challenge of presenting a still, serene scene.  The guy in there adds nothing and distracts the eye.  Would also have liked to see a bit more blur on the waterfalls to really nail the dreamy feeling already established by the light coming through that fog.  Composition is great, nature gave you some perfect lights.  Very nice.  5.', '2006-07-31 15:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680353, 370354, 58728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I just wish it was a bit bigger becuase there''s so much to look at.  Nice work.  9!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I just wish it was a bit bigger becuase there''s so much to look at.  Nice work.  9!', '2006-07-31 15:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680359, 370925, 37525, '<td valign="top">Needs a better title</td>', 'Needs a better title', '2006-07-31 15:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
