(2680370, 371989, 61818, '<td valign="top">Nice to see some rocks that aren''t stacked on top of each other.  This is a very original shot and it meets the challenge well.  Serene in nature, balanced, etc.  Think it would benefit greatly from some additional saturation of the sky and particularly the orange/reds from the sun.  A different angle on the stones to present a more even spacing between them would also help.  Overall a nice photo, good job. 5.</td>', 'Nice to see some rocks that aren''t stacked on top of each other.  This is a very original shot and it meets the challenge well.  Serene in nature, balanced, etc.  Think it would benefit greatly from some additional saturation of the sky and particularly the orange/reds from the sun.  A different angle on the stones to present a more even spacing between them would also help.  Overall a nice photo, good job. 5.', '2006-07-31 15:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680372, 372495, 37525, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen the entire boat shadow, not cut off.</td>', 'I would like to have seen the entire boat shadow, not cut off.', '2006-07-31 15:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680373, 369777, 51538, '<td valign="top">Out into the water above the merest ripple.  A very pleaceful feeling.  I spend many a day on such a jetty in Vermont in the summer. 9.</td>', 'Out into the water above the merest ripple.  A very pleaceful feeling.  I spend many a day on such a jetty in Vermont in the summer. 9.', '2006-07-31 15:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
