(2680469, 371955, 37525, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the zen in killing !</td>', 'I don''t see the zen in killing !', '2006-07-31 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680472, 372328, 61818, '<td valign="top">Like the colors and the placement of the rocks make for an interesting composition, if a little centered.  Seems to suffer from some focus issues as nothing appears sharp.  Perhaps this was your intent.  It does meet the challenge scope well as it is is very serne and gives a good sense of harmony within nature. Shifting everything to the left would benefit the way the eye is drawn through the shot and, in my opinion, getting at least one thing in sharp focus would actually add to the sense of dreaminess as everything else would seem to fade away.  Nice work.  5.</td>', 'Like the colors and the placement of the rocks make for an interesting composition, if a little centered.  Seems to suffer from some focus issues as nothing appears sharp.  Perhaps this was your intent.  It does meet the challenge scope well as it is is very serne and gives a good sense of harmony within nature. Shifting everything to the left would benefit the way the eye is drawn through the shot and, in my opinion, getting at least one thing in sharp focus would actually add to the sense of dreaminess as everything else would seem to fade away.  Nice work.  5.', '2006-07-31 15:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680474, 372106, 61818, '<td valign="top">Either a typo or a really ignorant title.  Great picture but what an irritation.</td>', 'Either a typo or a really ignorant title.  Great picture but what an irritation.', '2006-07-31 15:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680482, 372328, 37525, '<td valign="top">I wish I could like this and I do for some reason, however it looks like an oil slick as well.</td>', 'I wish I could like this and I do for some reason, however it looks like an oil slick as well.', '2006-07-31 15:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680483, 371981, 61818, '<td valign="top">There is serene and there is boring.  This shot tends more towards the boring, I''m sorry to say.  The lack of contrast throughout the picture and the predominance of that dull gray is what creates this effect.  The waves on the water don''t contribute to a serne feeling for me.  Overall I think this might have been a nice idea but needs work to better meet the challenge. 4.</td>', 'There is serene and there is boring.  This shot tends more towards the boring, I''m sorry to say.  The lack of contrast throughout the picture and the predominance of that dull gray is what creates this effect.  The waves on the water don''t contribute to a serne feeling for me.  Overall I think this might have been a nice idea but needs work to better meet the challenge. 4.', '2006-07-31 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680487, 369795, 37525, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a few less blades of green.</td>', 'Perhaps a few less blades of green.', '2006-07-31 15:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680499, 370232, 61818, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot, but I don''t like it in this challenge.  Colors (or lack of) are great, but the wheat (I assume it is wheat) is so noisy as to make for a very chaotic image in a challenge that asks for serenity and harmony.  A shallower dof might have helped a bit with this by knocking out some of the details as the image recedes into the background.  The dark areas at the top left of the image and to a lesser extent the top right detract from the continuity of the image.  Like I said, I like this shot but it''s just not meeting the challenge descs as well as I would hope. 4.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot, but I don''t like it in this challenge.  Colors (or lack of) are great, but the wheat (I assume it is wheat) is so noisy as to make for a very chaotic image in a challenge that asks for serenity and harmony.  A shallower dof might have helped a bit with this by knocking out some of the details as the image recedes into the background.  The dark areas at the top left of the image and to a lesser extent the top right detract from the continuity of the image.  Like I said, I like this shot but it''s just not meeting the challenge descs as well as I would hope. 4.', '2006-07-31 15:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680508, 372435, 46601, '<td valign="top">ok I would love to know how you did this without some serious photoshop cut and pasting!</td>', 'ok I would love to know how you did this without some serious photoshop cut and pasting!', '2006-07-31 15:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680513, 372217, 46601, '<td valign="top">really cool shot .. very well taken</td>', 'really cool shot .. very well taken', '2006-07-31 15:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680527, 369802, 37525, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred '' Sunset ''</td>', 'I would have preferred '' Sunset ''', '2006-07-31 15:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680539, 372151, 37525, '<td valign="top">The water here doesn''t work of me personally.</td>', 'The water here doesn''t work of me personally.', '2006-07-31 15:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680544, 370997, 61818, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge in every regard certainly.  So over processed as to appear to be a painting rather than a photograph.  That said, and precisely for that reason, this shot will probably rank very high, but for me the computer enhanced imagery actually detracts from the sense of harmony and serenity.  I also think the composition would have benefited greatly by moving the bird off center.  Nice shot overall. 6.</td>', 'Meets the challenge in every regard certainly.  So over processed as to appear to be a painting rather than a photograph.  That said, and precisely for that reason, this shot will probably rank very high, but for me the computer enhanced imagery actually detracts from the sense of harmony and serenity.  I also think the composition would have benefited greatly by moving the bird off center.  Nice shot overall. 6.', '2006-07-31 15:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680546, 372237, 37525, '<td valign="top">nice color and balance</td>', 'nice color and balance', '2006-07-31 15:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680549, 372189, 30049, '<td valign="top">Subtle, peaceful.  I like the way the edge of the hill/cliff fades out to the left.  You can get just a hint of what lies beyond in the vast space.</td>', 'Subtle, peaceful.  I like the way the edge of the hill/cliff fades out to the left.  You can get just a hint of what lies beyond in the vast space.', '2006-07-31 15:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680555, 372406, 37525, '<td valign="top">would have preferred to see the back of the stature in the sun</td>', 'would have preferred to see the back of the stature in the sun', '2006-07-31 15:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680556, 372495, 61818, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea, poorly executed.  On its own, before the LSD inspired post processing there is a composition here which really nails the challenge - sereneity, harmony, etc.  Then the sky is saturated wayyyy too much flaring up those deep reds.  Red is anything but a calming color.  Add to it that the massive red sky somehow manages to defy physics and not reflect in all of the water it is covering and the sense of realism is shattered beyond repair.  The horizon is tilted which always detracts.  The reflection of the canoe is cropped off which is also disappointing.  Less of the red sky, less red in the sky, turn up those nice blues in the calm water and this shot would have fared much better. 4.</td>', 'This is a nice idea, poorly executed.  On its own, before the LSD inspired post processing there is a composition here which really nails the challenge - sereneity, harmony, etc.  Then the sky is saturated wayyyy too much flaring up those deep reds.  Red is anything but a calming color.  Add to it that the massive red sky somehow manages to defy physics and not reflect in all of the water it is covering and the sense of realism is shattered beyond repair.  The horizon is tilted which always detracts.  The reflection of the canoe is cropped off which is also disappointing.  Less of the red sky, less red in the sky, turn up those nice blues in the calm water and this shot would have fared much better. 4.', '2006-07-31 15:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680559, 371566, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good eye to see this image.  I like the opposing "grasses" and how they create a sense of rhythm in the photo.</td>', 'Good eye to see this image.  I like the opposing "grasses" and how they create a sense of rhythm in the photo.', '2006-07-31 15:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680563, 371973, 37525, '<td valign="top">The darkening sky dilutes the peace</td>', 'The darkening sky dilutes the peace', '2006-07-31 15:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680568, 371532, 37525, '<td valign="top">I feel his pain</td>', 'I feel his pain', '2006-07-31 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2680573, 372126, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like what you''ve done with this overall.  I''m wondering if the ripples aren''t disturbing the "silence and serenity" a little?  I agree without them the image might be too quiet...hmmm.  Must have been tough to decide.  ;^)  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like what you''ve done with this overall.  I''m wondering if the ripples aren''t disturbing the "silence and serenity" a little?  I agree without them the image might be too quiet...hmmm.  Must have been tough to decide.  ;^)  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-31 15:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
