(2680601, 372519, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the connection here I think...and what does the title mean?  Is the Lion the evergreen branch?  From the thumbnail I thought the blue was moving water (the wrinkles look like water ripples at thumb size).  Probably don''t have enough negative space (subjects are filling the frame) for the Zen group.  Anyway...best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m missing the connection here I think...and what does the title mean?  Is the Lion the evergreen branch?  From the thumbnail I thought the blue was moving water (the wrinkles look like water ripples at thumb size).  Probably don''t have enough negative space (subjects are filling the frame) for the Zen group.  Anyway...best of luck in the challenge.', '2006-07-31 16:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
