(2681005, 372193, 24454, '<td valign="top">As little as I know about zen. . .this photo does "speak" it to me.  It has harmony, peace, simplicity.  I really love it.  This one would make a great framed print for an office or home.</td>', 'As little as I know about zen. . .this photo does "speak" it to me.  It has harmony, peace, simplicity.  I really love it.  This one would make a great framed print for an office or home.', '2006-07-31 17:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
