(2681041, 371621, 62006, '<td valign="top">Great capture for the title</td>', 'Great capture for the title', '2006-07-31 18:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681043, 372307, 61818, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors and subject.  DOF wrecks this photo though. 3.</td>', 'Interesting colors and subject.  DOF wrecks this photo though. 3.', '2006-07-31 18:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681044, 370997, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this photo!!!   It is exactly what I imagined when I thought of zen photography. . .but I was sick last week and couldn''t go out and capture it myself -- I''m glad I didn''t even try because I never could have captured it like this!  This is absolutely my favorite photo in this challenge, and this is going straight to my favorites folder!  I hope to see this with a ribbon matching that beautiful water color!!!  :)   10</td>', 'Oh this photo!!!   It is exactly what I imagined when I thought of zen photography. . .but I was sick last week and couldn''t go out and capture it myself -- I''m glad I didn''t even try because I never could have captured it like this!  This is absolutely my favorite photo in this challenge, and this is going straight to my favorites folder!  I hope to see this with a ribbon matching that beautiful water color!!!  :)   10', '2006-07-31 18:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681047, 372438, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!   I was out yesterday trying to capture the perfect butterfly photo, so I have much more of an appreciation for the perfection of this photo than I had before yesterday  :)   The focus and detail on that butterfly is exquisite and flawless!  10</td>', 'Beautiful!   I was out yesterday trying to capture the perfect butterfly photo, so I have much more of an appreciation for the perfection of this photo than I had before yesterday  :)   The focus and detail on that butterfly is exquisite and flawless!  10', '2006-07-31 18:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681050, 371844, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is such a beautiful photo!   I love the softness of the whites and the colors.  I don''t know much about zen photogtaphy, but this one most certainly speaks peace, simplicity, beauty.  Great job.</td>', 'This is such a beautiful photo!   I love the softness of the whites and the colors.  I don''t know much about zen photogtaphy, but this one most certainly speaks peace, simplicity, beauty.  Great job.', '2006-07-31 18:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681056, 371898, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very much like I imagine "zen" to look like.  Beautiful photo!</td>', 'Very much like I imagine "zen" to look like.  Beautiful photo!', '2006-07-31 18:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681063, 372151, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really love the processing on this.  I''m normally a photo-purist, but lately, I''ve loved the added glow of the rich colors that certain processing techniques give photos.  This is beautiful, and very much looks like zen to me.</td>', 'I really love the processing on this.  I''m normally a photo-purist, but lately, I''ve loved the added glow of the rich colors that certain processing techniques give photos.  This is beautiful, and very much looks like zen to me.', '2006-07-31 18:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681072, 372145, 24454, '<td valign="top">Is that Dream Lake in Rocky Mountain National Park?   My favorite place on the planet!   Very well done!!</td>', 'Is that Dream Lake in Rocky Mountain National Park?   My favorite place on the planet!   Very well done!!', '2006-07-31 18:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681101, 372219, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a striking composition of a beautiful plant.   As little as I know about "zen photography", this looks like something that very much would fit.   Nice job.</td>', 'This is a striking composition of a beautiful plant.   As little as I know about "zen photography", this looks like something that very much would fit.   Nice job.', '2006-07-31 18:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681106, 372500, 24454, '<td valign="top">This will probably be a fairly controversial photo as far as the voting goes.  People will either love it or hate it.  I personally like it alot!  I wish there were a few more stars in the sky, but I think it really is a beautiful depiction of silence. . .peace. . .harmony.  Good luck.</td>', 'This will probably be a fairly controversial photo as far as the voting goes.  People will either love it or hate it.  I personally like it alot!  I wish there were a few more stars in the sky, but I think it really is a beautiful depiction of silence. . .peace. . .harmony.  Good luck.', '2006-07-31 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681110, 371110, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  If ever a photo spoke silence. . .peace. . .harmony, this is it!   Beautiful job!  10</td>', 'I love this photo.  If ever a photo spoke silence. . .peace. . .harmony, this is it!   Beautiful job!  10', '2006-07-31 18:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681133, 372144, 24454, '<td valign="top">This very much looks like "zen photography" to me. . .and executed to perfection.  Clean, sharp, composed perfectly. . .as well as harmonious, simple, peaceful.   Way to go!</td>', 'This very much looks like "zen photography" to me. . .and executed to perfection.  Clean, sharp, composed perfectly. . .as well as harmonious, simple, peaceful.   Way to go!', '2006-07-31 18:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681142, 371812, 24454, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition!  I love the black on black without losing a trace of detail.  Beautifully done!</td>', 'Stunning composition!  I love the black on black without losing a trace of detail.  Beautifully done!', '2006-07-31 18:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681147, 372030, 62095, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the colouring here, plus I find it a little dark</td>', 'I don''t like the colouring here, plus I find it a little dark', '2006-07-31 18:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681185, 371623, 46782, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot - high on my list.</td>', 'Beautiful shot - high on my list.', '2006-07-31 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681251, 370032, 47205, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. (8)</td>', 'Nice capture. (8)', '2006-07-31 19:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681255, 371812, 47205, '<td valign="top">Love this shot. Very fitting for the challenge. The reflection is spot on as well as the mood. Nice Job! (9)</td>', 'Love this shot. Very fitting for the challenge. The reflection is spot on as well as the mood. Nice Job! (9)', '2006-07-31 19:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681262, 372126, 47205, '<td valign="top">Very Nice and very fitting for the challenge. One of the best I have seen yet. Great capture and great job (9)</td>', 'Very Nice and very fitting for the challenge. One of the best I have seen yet. Great capture and great job (9)', '2006-07-31 19:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681266, 371097, 47205, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of colors. Feels very quiet to me. Nice Job</td>', 'Nice contrast of colors. Feels very quiet to me. Nice Job', '2006-07-31 19:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681276, 372217, 47205, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, love the hue. (8)</td>', 'Beautiful colors, love the hue. (8)', '2006-07-31 19:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681280, 372131, 47205, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Seems very fitting for the challenge. Good Job!</td>', 'Nice shot. Seems very fitting for the challenge. Good Job!', '2006-07-31 19:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681289, 370998, 47205, '<td valign="top">Love the blue tones in this. I would have liked to see the white of the stork a bit brighter I think to make it stand out a touch more, but all in all, nice and very fitting for the challenge.</td>', 'Love the blue tones in this. I would have liked to see the white of the stork a bit brighter I think to make it stand out a touch more, but all in all, nice and very fitting for the challenge.', '2006-07-31 19:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681299, 372479, 47205, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, I like it.</td>', 'Interesting shot, I like it.', '2006-07-31 19:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681304, 369178, 3087, '<td valign="top">Ooh, this is great! Really quite quirky - I like the way it is both what it is and also a metaphor for something else. Love it!</td>', 'Ooh, this is great! Really quite quirky - I like the way it is both what it is and also a metaphor for something else. Love it!', '2006-07-31 19:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681308, 372456, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely scene. Beautiful lighting definitely conveys a sense of somewhere one would feel peaceful and uplifted.</td>', 'Lovely scene. Beautiful lighting definitely conveys a sense of somewhere one would feel peaceful and uplifted.', '2006-07-31 19:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681311, 370544, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simplicity, nature, peace, beauty... works for me.</td>', 'Simplicity, nature, peace, beauty... works for me.', '2006-07-31 19:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681316, 369988, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simplicity is key here. I love the lack od detail along the horizon, the extremely limited colour palette and the way the tree is the single sharp focal point.</td>', 'Simplicity is key here. I love the lack od detail along the horizon, the extremely limited colour palette and the way the tree is the single sharp focal point.', '2006-07-31 19:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681319, 371757, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of shallow DOF to isolate the natural subject.</td>', 'Lovely use of shallow DOF to isolate the natural subject.', '2006-07-31 19:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681322, 372144, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautifully lit and presented. However, for me, this is more of a visual presentation of items associated with Japanese culture than an image that actually conveys serenity, simplicity etc. That''s just my perception of it. Still a great image though.</td>', 'Beautifully lit and presented. However, for me, this is more of a visual presentation of items associated with Japanese culture than an image that actually conveys serenity, simplicity etc. That''s just my perception of it. Still a great image though.', '2006-07-31 19:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681326, 372479, 3087, '<td valign="top">Reduced to the very essence by such high contrast and posterisation. Intriguing  in it''s minimalism. Almost too stark for my preference - so stark that it doesn''t convey "serenity" or "harmony" to me but that''s just my perception.</td>', 'Reduced to the very essence by such high contrast and posterisation. Intriguing  in it''s minimalism. Almost too stark for my preference - so stark that it doesn''t convey "serenity" or "harmony" to me but that''s just my perception.', '2006-07-31 19:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681328, 370997, 3087, '<td valign="top">The mist and wonderful quality of the diffused light is just beautiful and does indeed convey a sense of serenity and harmony. Beautiful!</td>', 'The mist and wonderful quality of the diffused light is just beautiful and does indeed convey a sense of serenity and harmony. Beautiful!', '2006-07-31 19:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681333, 372223, 3087, '<td valign="top">Gosh this image looks so familiar, I think it reminds of an image I have perhaps seen in a book or gallery. (Note: that''s not an accusation of plagiarism). I like the sense of the simplicity and beauty of nature - that kind of beauty (so beautifully presented) cannot fail to uplift.</td>', 'Gosh this image looks so familiar, I think it reminds of an image I have perhaps seen in a book or gallery. (Note: that''s not an accusation of plagiarism). I like the sense of the simplicity and beauty of nature - that kind of beauty (so beautifully presented) cannot fail to uplift.', '2006-07-31 19:54:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2681334, 372309, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a charming idea!</td>', 'What a charming idea!', '2006-07-31 19:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681337, 372422, 47541, '<td valign="top">4: titlted horizon, both "star" and sun confuses me where to look, a bit busy for the challenge</td>', '4: titlted horizon, both "star" and sun confuses me where to look, a bit busy for the challenge', '2006-07-31 19:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681338, 372526, 3087, '<td valign="top">Diffusion of light and limited blue/ black colour palette certainly does convey a simplicity and one can almost feel how serene, peaceful and quiet this scene is.</td>', 'Diffusion of light and limited blue/ black colour palette certainly does convey a simplicity and one can almost feel how serene, peaceful and quiet this scene is.', '2006-07-31 19:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681339, 371314, 3087, '<td valign="top">Intriguing!</td>', 'Intriguing!', '2006-07-31 19:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681343, 371565, 24764, '<td valign="top">Belongs to the gallery of fine arts. The grainy atmoshphere is remarkable. Nice imagination.</td>', 'Belongs to the gallery of fine arts. The grainy atmoshphere is remarkable. Nice imagination.', '2006-07-31 19:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681344, 372504, 47541, '<td valign="top">4: the idea is good but the background is too dark and doesnt make the boat look "alone" enough for the challenge</td>', '4: the idea is good but the background is too dark and doesnt make the boat look "alone" enough for the challenge', '2006-07-31 19:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681345, 372267, 3087, '<td valign="top">That wonderful surface tension around the edge of the leaf is just wonderful and lifts this shot into something a little more interesting.</td>', 'That wonderful surface tension around the edge of the leaf is just wonderful and lifts this shot into something a little more interesting.', '2006-07-31 19:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681347, 372534, 3087, '<td valign="top">A well-exectuted image of a fairly stereotypical interpretation of zen. Note I''m not saying wrong/ inaccurate.</td>', 'A well-exectuted image of a fairly stereotypical interpretation of zen. Note I''m not saying wrong/ inaccurate.', '2006-07-31 19:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681350, 372272, 47541, '<td valign="top">I''d have moved the leaf away</td>', 'I''d have moved the leaf away', '2006-07-31 19:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681351, 371587, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the simplicity, the composition and the limited colour palette.</td>', 'Love the simplicity, the composition and the limited colour palette.', '2006-07-31 19:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681354, 372480, 47541, '<td valign="top">7: One of the few that captures zen for me.  I''d like to see a bit more of the rock at the right side though</td>', '7: One of the few that captures zen for me.  I''d like to see a bit more of the rock at the right side though', '2006-07-31 19:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681355, 372534, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a very zen feeling picture.  I gave it a 9 probably would have gone 10 but to me it wasn''t as relaxing enough.</td>', 'This is a very zen feeling picture.  I gave it a 9 probably would have gone 10 but to me it wasn''t as relaxing enough.', '2006-07-31 19:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681356, 372495, 3087, '<td valign="top">Colours far too vivid to convey much sense of serenity to me, personally though  I''m sure others will feel differently. The image itself, ignoring the highly saturated nature of it is interesting though the way the boat shadow is clipping the edge of the frame and the slightly tilted horizon both contribute to the off-kilter feeling it gives me.</td>', 'Colours far too vivid to convey much sense of serenity to me, personally though  I''m sure others will feel differently. The image itself, ignoring the highly saturated nature of it is interesting though the way the boat shadow is clipping the edge of the frame and the slightly tilted horizon both contribute to the off-kilter feeling it gives me.', '2006-07-31 19:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681358, 372307, 3087, '<td valign="top">Oh, how beautiful!</td>', 'Oh, how beautiful!', '2006-07-31 19:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681359, 371505, 47541, '<td valign="top">5: good idea but I think having the girl AND the feather is too much for zen - or perhaps crop so we have her face blowing the feather only?</td>', '5: good idea but I think having the girl AND the feather is too much for zen - or perhaps crop so we have her face blowing the feather only?', '2006-07-31 19:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681360, 372445, 59415, '<td valign="top">Great Zen image.  Also probably a money maker in the stock photo bus.!?</td>', 'Great Zen image.  Also probably a money maker in the stock photo bus.!?', '2006-07-31 20:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681361, 371778, 59415, '<td valign="top">I can look at this image and actually get Zen without knowing what the challenge is.  Great job.</td>', 'I can look at this image and actually get Zen without knowing what the challenge is.  Great job.', '2006-07-31 20:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681362, 372445, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: nice and simple</td>', '6: nice and simple', '2006-07-31 20:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681364, 370523, 59415, '<td valign="top">The greenery in this shot is what did it for me.  I think it is very nice. 8</td>', 'The greenery in this shot is what did it for me.  I think it is very nice. 8', '2006-07-31 20:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681365, 372540, 47541, '<td valign="top">4: a bit busy (esp with the "scarf") for me given what I''m looking for in Zen - nice dog though</td>', '4: a bit busy (esp with the "scarf") for me given what I''m looking for in Zen - nice dog though', '2006-07-31 20:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681369, 372026, 59415, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  Normally not a fan of something this sunnatural, but this one works. 8</td>', 'I really like this.  Normally not a fan of something this sunnatural, but this one works. 8', '2006-07-31 20:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681370, 371308, 47541, '<td valign="top">5: good idea, maybe crop out a lot of the grass to make it a "simpler" image</td>', '5: good idea, maybe crop out a lot of the grass to make it a "simpler" image', '2006-07-31 20:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681371, 372223, 59415, '<td valign="top">This one is soft enough to work.  It is a bit somber, and I am not sure if zen is happy or not.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'This one is soft enough to work.  It is a bit somber, and I am not sure if zen is happy or not.  I gave it an 8.', '2006-07-31 20:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681373, 371663, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: nice colours and the subject doesnt say too much</td>', '6: nice colours and the subject doesnt say too much', '2006-07-31 20:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681374, 372397, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity.  I gave it an 8.</td>', 'I like the simplicity.  I gave it an 8.', '2006-07-31 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681375, 369988, 62678, '<td valign="top">I love the color, and the desolation makes the scene very peaceful, but the foreground and the tree look a little too under exposed for for my taste.</td>', 'I love the color, and the desolation makes the scene very peaceful, but the foreground and the tree look a little too under exposed for for my taste.', '2006-07-31 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681376, 372080, 47541, '<td valign="top">8: nicely done and great colours</td>', '8: nicely done and great colours', '2006-07-31 20:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681378, 371303, 59415, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of this is what made it a good photo for me.  I gave it an 8.  To me zen is simple because a simple life is the good life!</td>', 'The simplicity of this is what made it a good photo for me.  I gave it an 8.  To me zen is simple because a simple life is the good life!', '2006-07-31 20:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681381, 370083, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: I''d prefer not to have the shadow in the back as it makes the image too busy</td>', '6: I''d prefer not to have the shadow in the back as it makes the image too busy', '2006-07-31 20:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681385, 371338, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: good idea but I think there is too much bust at the left</td>', '6: good idea but I think there is too much bust at the left', '2006-07-31 20:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681388, 372550, 59415, '<td valign="top">Again I have said this before, the simplicity of the image is what made this one good for me . Great photo, nice detail.  I gave it an 8, probably would have gone higher if there was a little bit more subject to keep my attention longer.</td>', 'Again I have said this before, the simplicity of the image is what made this one good for me . Great photo, nice detail.  I gave it an 8, probably would have gone higher if there was a little bit more subject to keep my attention longer.', '2006-07-31 20:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2681391, 372538, 47541, '<td valign="top">6: nice - more sand in the frame would have made this better</td>', '6: nice - more sand in the frame would have made this better', '2006-07-31 20:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
