(2682067, 372106, 59415, '<td valign="top">This seems very japanese to me.  I really like the use of the slow shutter to add softness to the moving water.  I think that is what makes the image Zen.</td>', 'This seems very japanese to me.  I really like the use of the slow shutter to add softness to the moving water.  I think that is what makes the image Zen.', '2006-07-31 23:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
