(2682169, 369348, 60698, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Sure there is only coffee in those cups?</td>', 'Interesting shot. Sure there is only coffee in those cups?', '2006-07-31 23:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682179, 372168, 60698, '<td valign="top">Great idea!</td>', 'Great idea!', '2006-08-01 00:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682187, 370879, 30982, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely quiet, but for a photograph, it''s a little flat.  The blue background looks a little blotchy and the feather doesn''t really stand out.  Maybe a bit better light on the feather itself or some adjustments to make it whiter would bring it out better.</td>', 'It''s definitely quiet, but for a photograph, it''s a little flat.  The blue background looks a little blotchy and the feather doesn''t really stand out.  Maybe a bit better light on the feather itself or some adjustments to make it whiter would bring it out better.', '2006-08-01 00:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
