(2682203, 370403, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little too simplistic - doesn''t strike me as a photograph.</td>', 'Perhaps a little too simplistic - doesn''t strike me as a photograph.', '2006-08-01 00:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682206, 371102, 30982, '<td valign="top">While the water is calm, the overall impression is one of "busy" to me.</td>', 'While the water is calm, the overall impression is one of "busy" to me.', '2006-08-01 00:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682215, 371675, 42100, '<td valign="top">Hey I don''t see the one that looks like a cow dragon here! ;)</td>', 'Hey I don''t see the one that looks like a cow dragon here! ;)', '2006-08-01 00:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682221, 370995, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice elements - moon, cloud wisps, water, sailing vessel, color - all quite harmonious.</td>', 'Very nice elements - moon, cloud wisps, water, sailing vessel, color - all quite harmonious.', '2006-08-01 00:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682222, 372126, 60477, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2006-08-01 00:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682223, 372227, 30982, '<td valign="top">On the sensual side of zen...</td>', 'On the sensual side of zen...', '2006-08-01 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682401, 371796, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot.  It is just that I''m not really sure that it emits the serenity that I''d like to see in a zen shot.  In another challenge, maybe I''d score this higher.  I love the creativity of this, however.</td>', 'A very interesting shot.  It is just that I''m not really sure that it emits the serenity that I''d like to see in a zen shot.  In another challenge, maybe I''d score this higher.  I love the creativity of this, however.', '2006-08-01 01:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682403, 372247, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot, I feel the solitude, nature and serenity of this shot.  Good job meeting the challenge.</td>', 'A very nice shot, I feel the solitude, nature and serenity of this shot.  Good job meeting the challenge.', '2006-08-01 01:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682412, 372188, 60379, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, great use of minimal tones, but I don''t sense a calmness here, in fact, it''s a bit turmultuous for me to look at.</td>', 'A nice shot, great use of minimal tones, but I don''t sense a calmness here, in fact, it''s a bit turmultuous for me to look at.', '2006-08-01 01:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682416, 371840, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although I sense some solitude in this shot, there is just too much going on here for me to be drawn into any type of serenity and peace.  The multiple subject matter - the girl, the tree, just has too much interest that my mind is not calm when looking at this.  It demands too much attention.</td>', 'Although I sense some solitude in this shot, there is just too much going on here for me to be drawn into any type of serenity and peace.  The multiple subject matter - the girl, the tree, just has too much interest that my mind is not calm when looking at this.  It demands too much attention.', '2006-08-01 01:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682420, 372244, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although I understand that you are trying to relay a sense of peace that a church would provide, there is just too much here for me to look at, that I am visually distracted from the peace that it is trying to emit.</td>', 'Although I understand that you are trying to relay a sense of peace that a church would provide, there is just too much here for me to look at, that I am visually distracted from the peace that it is trying to emit.', '2006-08-01 01:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682421, 372223, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very nice sense of quiet movement, forces unseen.  A great use of minimal tone, keeping this a serene shot to the viewer''s eye.  I love the softness of the foreground.</td>', 'A very nice sense of quiet movement, forces unseen.  A great use of minimal tone, keeping this a serene shot to the viewer''s eye.  I love the softness of the foreground.', '2006-08-01 01:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682422, 372175, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this is a pretty shot, I do not sense any peace or serenity when I look at it.  There is too much visual distraction for me to feel any zen.</td>', 'Although this is a pretty shot, I do not sense any peace or serenity when I look at it.  There is too much visual distraction for me to feel any zen.', '2006-08-01 01:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682427, 372052, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although minimal in the color, lighting and subjet matter, there just isn''t anything here that whispers any sense of zen to me.</td>', 'Although minimal in the color, lighting and subjet matter, there just isn''t anything here that whispers any sense of zen to me.', '2006-08-01 01:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682428, 372328, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty shot, nice use of tone and minimal color.  It emits a great sense of solitude and stillness.</td>', 'This is a very pretty shot, nice use of tone and minimal color.  It emits a great sense of solitude and stillness.', '2006-08-01 01:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682434, 370354, 60379, '<td valign="top">A pretty shot, but I think there is too much going on here that I don''t get a sense of peace or serenity when I look at it.  It begs me to discover each and every corner, because there is so much to offer.  NOT a bad thing in another challenge, but in this one, it doesn''t work well.</td>', 'A pretty shot, but I think there is too much going on here that I don''t get a sense of peace or serenity when I look at it.  It begs me to discover each and every corner, because there is so much to offer.  NOT a bad thing in another challenge, but in this one, it doesn''t work well.', '2006-08-01 01:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682445, 372309, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although I like this photo and the concept, for me, the background letters and the foreground works against each other.  I find that this causes me to want to look at each element individually, instead of as a whole.  I guess just not enough simplicity, it makes me ''work'' too much to see the whole interesting photo.</td>', 'Although I like this photo and the concept, for me, the background letters and the foreground works against each other.  I find that this causes me to want to look at each element individually, instead of as a whole.  I guess just not enough simplicity, it makes me ''work'' too much to see the whole interesting photo.', '2006-08-01 01:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682451, 371714, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although Zen would give the illusion that an Asian-inspired theme would be the ultimate example, for me, this is just too busy.  It demands too much of my interest, wanting to view it from corner to corner.  The leaves on the trees are very busy for my eye to focus on the overall serenity of this photo.</td>', 'Although Zen would give the illusion that an Asian-inspired theme would be the ultimate example, for me, this is just too busy.  It demands too much of my interest, wanting to view it from corner to corner.  The leaves on the trees are very busy for my eye to focus on the overall serenity of this photo.', '2006-08-01 01:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682459, 372435, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot, she seems very much at peace and at one with the nature around her.  Unfortunately for ME, the viewer, the photo demands too much interest in this photo, from the girl, the sky, the lighting, the grass and weeds, the ground.  There is just TOO much here to look at for it to really ''blend'' and give me the feeling of it being a serene photo.  Great photo, in other circumstances.</td>', 'A very nice shot, she seems very much at peace and at one with the nature around her.  Unfortunately for ME, the viewer, the photo demands too much interest in this photo, from the girl, the sky, the lighting, the grass and weeds, the ground.  There is just TOO much here to look at for it to really ''blend'' and give me the feeling of it being a serene photo.  Great photo, in other circumstances.', '2006-08-01 01:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682461, 372431, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this is a meant to give the illusion of stillness and quiet, in contrast, it has too much happening here for me to get a sense of that.  It is demanding of my senses, of my interest.</td>', 'Although this is a meant to give the illusion of stillness and quiet, in contrast, it has too much happening here for me to get a sense of that.  It is demanding of my senses, of my interest.', '2006-08-01 01:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682468, 372016, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although the woods here may be quiet, it just has too much going on for me to feel the quiet.  Great job though!</td>', 'Although the woods here may be quiet, it just has too much going on for me to feel the quiet.  Great job though!', '2006-08-01 01:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682471, 372540, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this dog is at rest, I do not feel the zen in this photo, as the subject matter itself is too busy, too many details that forces my eye to be drawn into all of the details rather than being at ease with the photo.</td>', 'Although this dog is at rest, I do not feel the zen in this photo, as the subject matter itself is too busy, too many details that forces my eye to be drawn into all of the details rather than being at ease with the photo.', '2006-08-01 01:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682478, 372151, 59415, '<td valign="top">I really like the yellow flowers, and the red roof.</td>', 'I really like the yellow flowers, and the red roof.', '2006-08-01 01:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682479, 372274, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although the scenery itself here is very lovely, I find all of the details to work against the overall serenity.  The clouds, the mountains, the trees, even the chaffs of wheat themselves, all have too much interest individually to work in harmony together for this challenge.  In another challenge, this would score much higher.</td>', 'Although the scenery itself here is very lovely, I find all of the details to work against the overall serenity.  The clouds, the mountains, the trees, even the chaffs of wheat themselves, all have too much interest individually to work in harmony together for this challenge.  In another challenge, this would score much higher.', '2006-08-01 01:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682485, 372505, 59415, '<td valign="top">Man for a valentines challenge this would ribbon!  I am not feeling the Zen in it, (the color I think might be the cause) but it is a good photo and I give it a 7.</td>', 'Man for a valentines challenge this would ribbon!  I am not feeling the Zen in it, (the color I think might be the cause) but it is a good photo and I give it a 7.', '2006-08-01 01:51:25.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2682486, 372551, 60379, '<td valign="top">Yes, I can feel the tranquility of the ocean here.  But I do not sense very much one-ness with the environment that I am looking at.  Still, a pretty photo, fairly minimal, but just a little too much displayed movement, I think.</td>', 'Yes, I can feel the tranquility of the ocean here.  But I do not sense very much one-ness with the environment that I am looking at.  Still, a pretty photo, fairly minimal, but just a little too much displayed movement, I think.', '2006-08-01 01:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682490, 370408, 61863, '<td valign="top">Perhaps cropping the lady on the left would have helped but like the idea or good opportunity spotted....</td>', 'Perhaps cropping the lady on the left would have helped but like the idea or good opportunity spotted....', '2006-08-01 01:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682491, 371714, 59415, '<td valign="top">Good DOF</td>', 'Good DOF', '2006-08-01 01:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682492, 371993, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very pretty colors in this.  I think though, that between the subject of the tree, the foreground green grass, and the multiple colors in the sky and background, it just is a bit overwhelming to the solitude and peace that you are trying to create.  Maybe if this was in black and white?  I think it is actually the beauty of the color that is distracting to the sense of zen.</td>', 'Very pretty colors in this.  I think though, that between the subject of the tree, the foreground green grass, and the multiple colors in the sky and background, it just is a bit overwhelming to the solitude and peace that you are trying to create.  Maybe if this was in black and white?  I think it is actually the beauty of the color that is distracting to the sense of zen.', '2006-08-01 01:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682494, 369385, 59415, '<td valign="top">I really like what you have done here.  I think I personaly would have liked the rocks without the water droplets.  It is great however. 7</td>', 'I really like what you have done here.  I think I personaly would have liked the rocks without the water droplets.  It is great however. 7', '2006-08-01 01:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682496, 372423, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although I can sense some solitude here, I do not sense any zen, I think it''s just a bit too busy to blend in and harmonize with any one element in this photo.  Great job though!</td>', 'Although I can sense some solitude here, I do not sense any zen, I think it''s just a bit too busy to blend in and harmonize with any one element in this photo.  Great job though!', '2006-08-01 01:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682497, 372193, 59415, '<td valign="top">These trees do have a Zen quality about them, although Zen is not the first thing I think of when I see them.  For some reason I get Friendship out of this picture.  That seems weird!  Great job. 8</td>', 'These trees do have a Zen quality about them, although Zen is not the first thing I think of when I see them.  For some reason I get Friendship out of this picture.  That seems weird!  Great job. 8', '2006-08-01 01:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682498, 372517, 59415, '<td valign="top">Now that is color!</td>', 'Now that is color!', '2006-08-01 01:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682504, 372548, 59415, '<td valign="top">Wow that is a great freeze.  This would do well in the stop motion challenge that you didn''t know about until this was already entered!</td>', 'Wow that is a great freeze.  This would do well in the stop motion challenge that you didn''t know about until this was already entered!', '2006-08-01 01:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682505, 372394, 60379, '<td valign="top">I love the subtleness of the background color in this one.  However, even with the soft tones here, the background is busy.  That with the business of the pattern on the butterfly, it just doesn''t allow me to feel any sense of harmony and blending.</td>', 'I love the subtleness of the background color in this one.  However, even with the soft tones here, the background is busy.  That with the business of the pattern on the butterfly, it just doesn''t allow me to feel any sense of harmony and blending.', '2006-08-01 01:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682506, 372466, 59415, '<td valign="top">I like the stillness and the peaceful ness of the photo.</td>', 'I like the stillness and the peaceful ness of the photo.', '2006-08-01 01:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682510, 371993, 59415, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great color shot.</td>', 'I think this is a great color shot.', '2006-08-01 01:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682513, 371587, 59415, '<td valign="top">A wonderful still shot that really captures peace and tranquility.</td>', 'A wonderful still shot that really captures peace and tranquility.', '2006-08-01 01:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682516, 371974, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very nice color for this image.</td>', 'Very nice color for this image.', '2006-08-01 01:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682518, 372537, 59415, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel the Zen from this image.  If I were to just see this picture and not know the challenge was zen I probably would not have guessed.  I think that is because of the darkness that the image.  It actually speaks sadness, decay and age or end of life to me...IMO 6</td>', 'I don''t feel the Zen from this image.  If I were to just see this picture and not know the challenge was zen I probably would not have guessed.  I think that is because of the darkness that the image.  It actually speaks sadness, decay and age or end of life to me...IMO 6', '2006-08-01 01:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682519, 370948, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although this atmosphere appears to be quiet at the moment, the photo overall has too much going on, so that my eye is drawn into all the minute details, rather than allowing me to feel a sense of peace and serenity when I look at it.</td>', 'Although this atmosphere appears to be quiet at the moment, the photo overall has too much going on, so that my eye is drawn into all the minute details, rather than allowing me to feel a sense of peace and serenity when I look at it.', '2006-08-01 02:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682520, 372237, 59415, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photo.  I really like it, because it is diffrent.  I  think of Zen when I see this right away, but it is very nice. 7</td>', 'This is a very interesting photo.  I really like it, because it is diffrent.  I  think of Zen when I see this right away, but it is very nice. 7', '2006-08-01 02:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682526, 372419, 59415, '<td valign="top">Something about the colors in this that don''t work for me.  The blue is just sort of an odd color to contrast with the sand and tree.  Just my opinion. 6</td>', 'Something about the colors in this that don''t work for me.  The blue is just sort of an odd color to contrast with the sand and tree.  Just my opinion. 6', '2006-08-01 02:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682528, 372309, 59415, '<td valign="top">Very cute little flower.  Now glue a dragon fly to that sucker and you have a winner.</td>', 'Very cute little flower.  Now glue a dragon fly to that sucker and you have a winner.', '2006-08-01 02:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682535, 372523, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very pretty floral shot, great use of minimal color and lighting, and very soft tonal quality.  However the pattern in the flower itself actually works against this, as there is just too much going on in the flower.  It just draws my eye from the overall harmony of the photo as a whole, and forces me to LOOK at the subject, making it stand alone rather than blend and become harmonious with the background.</td>', 'A very pretty floral shot, great use of minimal color and lighting, and very soft tonal quality.  However the pattern in the flower itself actually works against this, as there is just too much going on in the flower.  It just draws my eye from the overall harmony of the photo as a whole, and forces me to LOOK at the subject, making it stand alone rather than blend and become harmonious with the background.', '2006-08-01 02:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682550, 372093, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although a beautiful shot, it seems to be lacking any true sense of zen.</td>', 'Although a beautiful shot, it seems to be lacking any true sense of zen.', '2006-08-01 02:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682555, 370995, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very pretty shot, but for another challenge, it would do much better.  Just too much going on here, my eye is distracted by the bright opposing colors, and the business of the waves.  Pretty colors, though, but they work against each other here.  If the water had been a darker tone, and more ''quiet'', maybe this would have worked better.  Or maybe even in black and white, or a darker sky.  Just something isn''t screaming zen to me here.</td>', 'A very pretty shot, but for another challenge, it would do much better.  Just too much going on here, my eye is distracted by the bright opposing colors, and the business of the waves.  Pretty colors, though, but they work against each other here.  If the water had been a darker tone, and more ''quiet'', maybe this would have worked better.  Or maybe even in black and white, or a darker sky.  Just something isn''t screaming zen to me here.', '2006-08-01 02:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682590, 372500, 50289, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Is that the moon or a fingernail clipping on a black tile floor?</td>', 'Wow!  Is that the moon or a fingernail clipping on a black tile floor?', '2006-08-01 02:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682595, 372096, 50289, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot!  The only negative I see is the rock at the bottom. The rest of the picture has a hazy / dreamy quality and then there is that rock.  The sharpness and slight overexposure sticks out and ruins the mood.  Maybe a little blurring of the rock would have helped.  Otherwise, nice job.</td>', 'Interesting shot!  The only negative I see is the rock at the bottom. The rest of the picture has a hazy / dreamy quality and then there is that rock.  The sharpness and slight overexposure sticks out and ruins the mood.  Maybe a little blurring of the rock would have helped.  Otherwise, nice job.', '2006-08-01 02:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682600, 372155, 50289, '<td valign="top">Nice!!!  How long did you have to wait for the clouds and bird to line up?</td>', 'Nice!!!  How long did you have to wait for the clouds and bird to line up?', '2006-08-01 02:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682619, 370184, 37430, '<td valign="top">Its an art in itself to see the beauty in ordinary things. This is true Zen. Love the selection of subject, choice of colors and overall composition. I gave this 7 at first pass but bumping it to 9 while commenting. This is awesome. Hope it does well for you.</td>', 'Its an art in itself to see the beauty in ordinary things. This is true Zen. Love the selection of subject, choice of colors and overall composition. I gave this 7 at first pass but bumping it to 9 while commenting. This is awesome. Hope it does well for you.', '2006-08-01 03:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682622, 372515, 61705, '<td valign="top">Wondefully Zen. Almost appears as though the bubbles have an outer glow. Good work, 10.</td>', 'Wondefully Zen. Almost appears as though the bubbles have an outer glow. Good work, 10.', '2006-08-01 03:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682626, 372548, 37430, '<td valign="top">Love the dash of green on overall white background. The float and shadow add to drama. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Love the dash of green on overall white background. The float and shadow add to drama. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-01 03:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682627, 370748, 61705, '<td valign="top">Classic simplicity and perfect serene-ness. The colour and composition is outstanding, 10 and fav.</td>', 'Classic simplicity and perfect serene-ness. The colour and composition is outstanding, 10 and fav.', '2006-08-01 03:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682628, 370997, 61705, '<td valign="top">This has to be the most beautiful image I have ever seen. No words can describe. Simply, 10... and fav.</td>', 'This has to be the most beautiful image I have ever seen. No words can describe. Simply, 10... and fav.', '2006-08-01 03:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682629, 371898, 61705, '<td valign="top">The pink hues add much serenity to this already peaceful, minimalist scene. Cleverly done, 10.</td>', 'The pink hues add much serenity to this already peaceful, minimalist scene. Cleverly done, 10.', '2006-08-01 03:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682636, 372397, 37430, '<td valign="top">Different, Simple and Zen. I like the idea but I feel just one strand would have been even better. Still a wonderful picture.8.</td>', 'Different, Simple and Zen. I like the idea but I feel just one strand would have been even better. Still a wonderful picture.8.', '2006-08-01 03:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682637, 372548, 61705, '<td valign="top">Excellent stop motion. I like the simplicity and light. In this regard, I believe it is very close to a Zen-like composition. Can I ponder deep thoughts when I look at this? Possibly. Is this quiet and serene imagery? I guess so, since you have ''stopped'' any imminent sound and there are no glaring colours or busy lines. <br/> <br/>What I mean to say is, imo, for an image to be truly Zen, it would be a scene in which I was able to rest my mind ''visually''. To a certain degree, you have achieved this and that''s as good as a 10 for me.</td>', 'Excellent stop motion. I like the simplicity and light. In this regard, I believe it is very close to a Zen-like composition. Can I ponder deep thoughts when I look at this? Possibly. Is this quiet and serene imagery? I guess so, since you have ''stopped'' any imminent sound and there are no glaring colours or busy lines.  What I mean to say is, imo, for an image to be truly Zen, it would be a scene in which I was able to rest my mind ''visually''. To a certain degree, you have achieved this and that''s as good as a 10 for me.', '2006-08-01 03:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682638, 372451, 61705, '<td valign="top">Simplicity and fine detail. Cleverly set up and taken. Congrats, 10 and fav.</td>', 'Simplicity and fine detail. Cleverly set up and taken. Congrats, 10 and fav.', '2006-08-01 03:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682640, 370925, 61705, '<td valign="top">Classic Zen imagery, imo. Well spotted and taken. I wonder if this would benefit from a conversion to B&amp;W...? Nonetheless, 10.</td>', 'Classic Zen imagery, imo. Well spotted and taken. I wonder if this would benefit from a conversion to B&W...? Nonetheless, 10.', '2006-08-01 03:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682641, 372168, 35669, '<td valign="top">i cant believe you got away with humour in a Zen challenge!<br/>i love it, you can imagine the grin on the drivers face.<br/>well done <br/>nick</td>', 'i cant believe you got away with humour in a Zen challenge!i love it, you can imagine the grin on the drivers face.well done nick', '2006-08-01 03:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682642, 372468, 37430, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful. I like the play of light and shadows.7.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful. I like the play of light and shadows.7.', '2006-08-01 03:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682643, 372489, 61705, '<td valign="top">Excellent minimalism. DoF is superb. My eyes need the tip to be lower even though my brain is saying the composition is fine. However, good solid photography that shows skill, 10.</td>', 'Excellent minimalism. DoF is superb. My eyes need the tip to be lower even though my brain is saying the composition is fine. However, good solid photography that shows skill, 10.', '2006-08-01 03:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682645, 371663, 61705, '<td valign="top">How can something this haunting, tragic, full of lines and patterns, be Zen? Well, it just is. Here my eyes can rest (unbelievable as that sounds) and I can be lost in thought. I think your very clever trick was the use of colour and light. It has created magic. A perfect 10 and fav.</td>', 'How can something this haunting, tragic, full of lines and patterns, be Zen? Well, it just is. Here my eyes can rest (unbelievable as that sounds) and I can be lost in thought. I think your very clever trick was the use of colour and light. It has created magic. A perfect 10 and fav.', '2006-08-01 03:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682647, 372126, 61705, '<td valign="top">Simple and serene. Perfection, 10.</td>', 'Simple and serene. Perfection, 10.', '2006-08-01 03:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682652, 372223, 61705, '<td valign="top">Ahhh... vast serenity. I can hear the wind through the grass, but it is still peaceful to me, 9.</td>', 'Ahhh... vast serenity. I can hear the wind through the grass, but it is still peaceful to me, 9.', '2006-08-01 03:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682653, 372525, 61705, '<td valign="top">This is a skillfully taken image. Strong lines and detail. The shadows within the ashtray have clipped, but nonetheless, 9.</td>', 'This is a skillfully taken image. Strong lines and detail. The shadows within the ashtray have clipped, but nonetheless, 9.', '2006-08-01 03:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682654, 371593, 61705, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful... 9.</td>', 'Simply beautiful... 9.', '2006-08-01 03:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682655, 372531, 61705, '<td valign="top">Excellent stock imagery. Good set up and execution, 9.</td>', 'Excellent stock imagery. Good set up and execution, 9.', '2006-08-01 03:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
