(2682673, 372145, 50289, '<td valign="top">I love mountain lake pictures.  I do have two comments on your shot.  The sky is just a bit too dark at the top.  It doesn''t look natural.  Also, the log in the forground is a bit distracting.  There probably isn''t much you could do about the log unless you could have repositioned yourself more to the left (but you probably didn''t want to swim out there with your camera, right?)</td>', 'I love mountain lake pictures.  I do have two comments on your shot.  The sky is just a bit too dark at the top.  It doesn''t look natural.  Also, the log in the forground is a bit distracting.  There probably isn''t much you could do about the log unless you could have repositioned yourself more to the left (but you probably didn''t want to swim out there with your camera, right?)', '2006-08-01 03:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682678, 372309, 37430, '<td valign="top">How much I wish this was photo of just some soil/mixture and the plant/flower on white background. I like the idea but I find it too busy for the theme. Even without the hands and background text this would have worked fine (or maybe even better IMO). Still a great composition which is technically well executed.8.</td>', 'How much I wish this was photo of just some soil/mixture and the plant/flower on white background. I like the idea but I find it too busy for the theme. Even without the hands and background text this would have worked fine (or maybe even better IMO). Still a great composition which is technically well executed.8.', '2006-08-01 03:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682685, 372237, 37430, '<td valign="top">Surely Zen. I love your choice of bright small subject and large colorless background. I just wish the lighting was a little better on teapot ...maybe a little warme. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Surely Zen. I love your choice of bright small subject and large colorless background. I just wish the lighting was a little better on teapot ...maybe a little warme. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-01 03:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682691, 372522, 37430, '<td valign="top">Cliche...and yet it works :) I like your choice of lighting from top. It makes the texture of stones to be well highlighted. Goodluck.8.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-07 10:53:46.</i></td>', 'Cliche...and yet it works :) I like your choice of lighting from top. It makes the texture of stones to be well highlighted. Goodluck.8.', '2006-08-01 03:10:58.000000', '2006-08-07 11:53:46.000000', 1),
(2682715, 372103, 37430, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I don''t know if this is Zen "style" or not but this very well (maybe abstractly) communicates the idea behind the theme. Getting illuminated from the light within (guessing thats what it represents) is so much Zen. Technically is this well executed. Lighting is just "wow". Maybe the only one thing which I would have liked more is more of negative space around to give more profound idea of ''illumination'' (smaller subject compared to background). Goodluck.9.</td>', 'Awesome! I don''t know if this is Zen "style" or not but this very well (maybe abstractly) communicates the idea behind the theme. Getting illuminated from the light within (guessing thats what it represents) is so much Zen. Technically is this well executed. Lighting is just "wow". Maybe the only one thing which I would have liked more is more of negative space around to give more profound idea of ''illumination'' (smaller subject compared to background). Goodluck.9.', '2006-08-01 03:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682716, 371844, 37430, '<td valign="top">This is another of those pictures where I can say that I don''t know if this is Zen "style" of photography or not, BUT I don''t even care about the style for this one. I''m simply stunned by the beauty of this photo. The soft focus, the soft feelings and soft (not harsh) colors are so much in harmony. Whichever resort puts this on brochure would surely gats lots of families in season :) Hope this does well for you. Adding to my favorites.10.</td>', 'This is another of those pictures where I can say that I don''t know if this is Zen "style" of photography or not, BUT I don''t even care about the style for this one. I''m simply stunned by the beauty of this photo. The soft focus, the soft feelings and soft (not harsh) colors are so much in harmony. Whichever resort puts this on brochure would surely gats lots of families in season :) Hope this does well for you. Adding to my favorites.10.', '2006-08-01 03:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682717, 370403, 37430, '<td valign="top">This is the simplest of the submissions and is certainly an example of Zen art. I really like the idea of highlighting "Yang" by throwing in bit of "Yin". Wonder if there would be any yang without yin?! The simplicity of the photo is profound and deserves nothing less than 10. Goodluck.</td>', 'This is the simplest of the submissions and is certainly an example of Zen art. I really like the idea of highlighting "Yang" by throwing in bit of "Yin". Wonder if there would be any yang without yin?! The simplicity of the photo is profound and deserves nothing less than 10. Goodluck.', '2006-08-01 03:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682718, 370997, 37430, '<td valign="top">Superb. It surely is serene and very Zen. A dash of white and ripples really helps in highlighting the serenity of the blue environment. I''d have personally liked to see a bit more of background (water/blue) and an off-centered placement of the swan. Still a lovely photo coming straight out of heaven. Goodluck. 9.</td>', 'Superb. It surely is serene and very Zen. A dash of white and ripples really helps in highlighting the serenity of the blue environment. I''d have personally liked to see a bit more of background (water/blue) and an off-centered placement of the swan. Still a lovely photo coming straight out of heaven. Goodluck. 9.', '2006-08-01 03:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682720, 372479, 37430, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture and perfect title. This is really an example of zen art. Simple and yet so profound. I really liked the "mostly" silhoutte picture with just a little bit of light passing through wings. Just few lines and you have a piece of art... thats very zen :)Hope this does well for you.9.</td>', 'Lovely picture and perfect title. This is really an example of zen art. Simple and yet so profound. I really liked the "mostly" silhoutte picture with just a little bit of light passing through wings. Just few lines and you have a piece of art... thats very zen :)Hope this does well for you.9.', '2006-08-01 03:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682722, 371812, 37430, '<td valign="top">O yes...its smooth. I love the still waiter and koi. The reflections are just perfect. I find the picture a little dark though (or is it my monitor?). This is surely serene. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'O yes...its smooth. I love the still waiter and koi. The reflections are just perfect. I find the picture a little dark though (or is it my monitor?). This is surely serene. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-01 03:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682723, 372139, 37430, '<td valign="top">Love it. A dash of red is enough to higlight the cool background. The size and placement of subject is just perfect. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Love it. A dash of red is enough to higlight the cool background. The size and placement of subject is just perfect. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-01 03:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682724, 371413, 37430, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. I love the dash of pink in mostly green background. The reflections just add to bit more drama. I wonder how it would be to just capture (or crop) the reflections and water/leaves. I''m sure that would also add to drama. Neat poster picture. Hope this does well for you.9.</td>', 'This is awesome. I love the dash of pink in mostly green background. The reflections just add to bit more drama. I wonder how it would be to just capture (or crop) the reflections and water/leaves. I''m sure that would also add to drama. Neat poster picture. Hope this does well for you.9.', '2006-08-01 03:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682725, 372550, 37430, '<td valign="top">Simple, Zen and Beautiful. My only small crib is that the flower looks like artificially pressed to background (I might be grossly wrong). A little more lift would have added extra punch. I still like the picture and I hope it does well for you.8.</td>', 'Simple, Zen and Beautiful. My only small crib is that the flower looks like artificially pressed to background (I might be grossly wrong). A little more lift would have added extra punch. I still like the picture and I hope it does well for you.8.', '2006-08-01 03:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682726, 372459, 37430, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Simple and lovely. I like the shallow DoF and how everything else in background and foreground is blurred. Choosing the bud over flower is the right choice. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Great capture. Simple and lovely. I like the shallow DoF and how everything else in background and foreground is blurred. Choosing the bud over flower is the right choice. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-01 03:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682732, 372399, 37430, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is Zen "style" or not, and I don''t really care for the "style" for this photo. This is simply amazing capture of beauty complimented by great post-processing. I love the idea of partial face hidden as it leave some part to see and other to imagination. A dash of metal highlighes the softness of rest of the image (is this Zen?). Hope this does well for you. Adding to my favs.9.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is Zen "style" or not, and I don''t really care for the "style" for this photo. This is simply amazing capture of beauty complimented by great post-processing. I love the idea of partial face hidden as it leave some part to see and other to imagination. A dash of metal highlighes the softness of rest of the image (is this Zen?). Hope this does well for you. Adding to my favs.9.', '2006-08-01 03:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682790, 371618, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice calming colors in this image.  I think the natural light looks good and the focus looks nice too though not completely tack sharp.  Though this does depict what I consider a zen-like scene, there is so much going on in the image that I am not getting that still or harmonious inner ''zen'' feel from it.  It does have a good number of points of interest for the eye to view but there are so many its hard to center on one and become invested in it.  Perhaps if the image was cropped down to explore the balance between the rock and the little statuary?  Or the rock piercing the pond with the background blurred to a simple mass of green?  Something that would take one of the many elements and break it down to something simplistic would feel more zen to me.    I gave a 5</td>', 'Very nice calming colors in this image.  I think the natural light looks good and the focus looks nice too though not completely tack sharp.  Though this does depict what I consider a zen-like scene, there is so much going on in the image that I am not getting that still or harmonious inner ''zen'' feel from it.  It does have a good number of points of interest for the eye to view but there are so many its hard to center on one and become invested in it.  Perhaps if the image was cropped down to explore the balance between the rock and the little statuary?  Or the rock piercing the pond with the background blurred to a simple mass of green?  Something that would take one of the many elements and break it down to something simplistic would feel more zen to me.    I gave a 5', '2006-08-01 04:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682804, 372402, 11923, '<td valign="top">Powdery purple haze envelops the white cloud of orchid, what could be more serene and still?  I really like your take on this image.  I love the soft focus and I think it works very well here.  It immediately gave me a calming effect.  The color choices were spot on, the purple contrasts nicely with the yellowy-orange in the flower but they are both so pale that it isn''t an overwhelming display of contrasts.  I like the off-center composition and I think the one thing I''d prefer more is to have an even greater sense of negative space, perhaps having the stem more aligned diagonally with the upper left-hand corner and then having a large expanse of the soft purple background.   That said some detail of the flower would be lost if it wasn''t as close up so its a toss-up.  Very well done.  I gave a 7 and favorite.</td>', 'Powdery purple haze envelops the white cloud of orchid, what could be more serene and still?  I really like your take on this image.  I love the soft focus and I think it works very well here.  It immediately gave me a calming effect.  The color choices were spot on, the purple contrasts nicely with the yellowy-orange in the flower but they are both so pale that it isn''t an overwhelming display of contrasts.  I like the off-center composition and I think the one thing I''d prefer more is to have an even greater sense of negative space, perhaps having the stem more aligned diagonally with the upper left-hand corner and then having a large expanse of the soft purple background.   That said some detail of the flower would be lost if it wasn''t as close up so its a toss-up.  Very well done.  I gave a 7 and favorite.', '2006-08-01 04:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682807, 371864, 11923, '<td valign="top">I find the writing and detailing of how delicate the writing on these pieces of material(?) to be very intriguing.  There is a nice balance between to the two subjects and I like the subtle coloring.  I find the white in the corner to be a bit harsh though.  Focus is lovely, not exceptionally tack-sharp but it does the job and some may have been compromised by that bright-white area.  I don''t get a particularly zen vibe from this as a viewer but I think its technically very well done.  I gave a 6.</td>', 'I find the writing and detailing of how delicate the writing on these pieces of material(?) to be very intriguing.  There is a nice balance between to the two subjects and I like the subtle coloring.  I find the white in the corner to be a bit harsh though.  Focus is lovely, not exceptionally tack-sharp but it does the job and some may have been compromised by that bright-white area.  I don''t get a particularly zen vibe from this as a viewer but I think its technically very well done.  I gave a 6.', '2006-08-01 04:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682824, 372045, 40430, '<td valign="top">wow and wow, impeccable image-10-</td>', 'wow and wow, impeccable image-10-', '2006-08-01 04:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682825, 371993, 40430, '<td valign="top">great color and sharpness</td>', 'great color and sharpness', '2006-08-01 04:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682842, 370772, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very lovely image.  I like the emphasis on scale here and I think there is a nice zen to the photo.  The way you handled the natural lighting is superb.  I like the tone and colors as well.  Focus seems good but a little soft and yet I think that works.  Though I think the image as is works just great, I do think if you were to actually crop out the entire bottom portion to just below that rock outcropping on the right side, I''d love the image even more.  There is a soft, ethereal feel to that portion of the image that I think is absolutely gorgeous.  But that''s just me and maybe it would be worth exploring at the end of the challenge.  Great entry.  I gave a 7 and a favorite for that top portion.  :D</td>', 'Very lovely image.  I like the emphasis on scale here and I think there is a nice zen to the photo.  The way you handled the natural lighting is superb.  I like the tone and colors as well.  Focus seems good but a little soft and yet I think that works.  Though I think the image as is works just great, I do think if you were to actually crop out the entire bottom portion to just below that rock outcropping on the right side, I''d love the image even more.  There is a soft, ethereal feel to that portion of the image that I think is absolutely gorgeous.  But that''s just me and maybe it would be worth exploring at the end of the challenge.  Great entry.  I gave a 7 and a favorite for that top portion.  :D', '2006-08-01 05:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682844, 370032, 11923, '<td valign="top">This is a simply breathtaking landscape that has some very fine elements that depict a sense of zen and some fabulous contrasts.  Most particularly of interest to me is the contrast of the stillness of the lake against the rough rocks and the earthy colors of the lake/grass versus the coolness of the sky.  There are a lot of points of interest here and each one of them have been rendered exceptionally well technically.  The low light really helps set the mood and there is a nice stillness and sense of calm.  I don''t however get that inner zen feeling from viewing the image but I think its exquisite all the same.  I gave a 7.</td>', 'This is a simply breathtaking landscape that has some very fine elements that depict a sense of zen and some fabulous contrasts.  Most particularly of interest to me is the contrast of the stillness of the lake against the rough rocks and the earthy colors of the lake/grass versus the coolness of the sky.  There are a lot of points of interest here and each one of them have been rendered exceptionally well technically.  The low light really helps set the mood and there is a nice stillness and sense of calm.  I don''t however get that inner zen feeling from viewing the image but I think its exquisite all the same.  I gave a 7.', '2006-08-01 05:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2682868, 372272, 61318, '<td valign="top">very nice detail in the leaf...good light...the top of the top rock is a bit soft, but not so much that I''d hold it against you...nicely done overall.</td>', 'very nice detail in the leaf...good light...the top of the top rock is a bit soft, but not so much that I''d hold it against you...nicely done overall.', '2006-08-01 05:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
