(2683358, 372259, 35545, '<td valign="top">Zen and the Art of Automotive Maintenance?  What an eye to pick out this combination of elements.  Great black and white.  This really stands out from the crowd.</td>', 'Zen and the Art of Automotive Maintenance?  What an eye to pick out this combination of elements.  Great black and white.  This really stands out from the crowd.', '2006-08-01 10:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
