(2683367, 371535, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the slight contrasting curves of the boat and bridge... they sort of fit together like the symbol for yin/yang, supporting and balancing each other in the frame.</td>', 'Love the slight contrasting curves of the boat and bridge... they sort of fit together like the symbol for yin/yang, supporting and balancing each other in the frame.', '2006-08-01 11:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
