(2683377, 370997, 57278, '<td valign="top">im living in the wrong place. This is too beautiful!</td>', 'im living in the wrong place. This is too beautiful!', '2006-08-01 11:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683379, 369378, 51538, '<td valign="top">The lush green foliage is a nice setting.  But the model looks a little plastic in texture.  I think for a Zen subject, holding a single leaf and looking with a single eye might have been better.  Something which removes the majority of the background but ends up giving a richer viewing experience.</td>', 'The lush green foliage is a nice setting.  But the model looks a little plastic in texture.  I think for a Zen subject, holding a single leaf and looking with a single eye might have been better.  Something which removes the majority of the background but ends up giving a richer viewing experience.', '2006-08-01 11:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683381, 371469, 57278, '<td valign="top">Great comp, nice light, good feel. 10 minus 1 (the feather looks a little out of focus)</td>', 'Great comp, nice light, good feel. 10 minus 1 (the feather looks a little out of focus)', '2006-08-01 11:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683383, 371778, 57278, '<td valign="top">bamboo or sugar cane? oh well it doesnt matter, 9.</td>', 'bamboo or sugar cane? oh well it doesnt matter, 9.', '2006-08-01 11:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683384, 371533, 51538, '<td valign="top">I can see the petal - but the brown object is not, to me, immediately discernable as a petal.  Immediacy is important.  The background text while oriental Chinese and exotic is a little distracting.  It is a difficult subject to compose but I think you could make it a little better by removing some of the elements.</td>', 'I can see the petal - but the brown object is not, to me, immediately discernable as a petal.  Immediacy is important.  The background text while oriental Chinese and exotic is a little distracting.  It is a difficult subject to compose but I think you could make it a little better by removing some of the elements.', '2006-08-01 11:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683387, 371989, 51538, '<td valign="top">Not Avebury.  I wonder where.  The silhouettes are fairly pleasing and the sky certainly helps you out.</td>', 'Not Avebury.  I wonder where.  The silhouettes are fairly pleasing and the sky certainly helps you out.', '2006-08-01 11:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683388, 371993, 47852, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors... I like the hint of green in the bottom that keeps the entire foreground from being a total silhouette.  My first thought was that it looked like the escarpment in Thatcher Park in NY.  I''ll be back after voting to see where this was taken! :)</td>', 'Lovely colors... I like the hint of green in the bottom that keeps the entire foreground from being a total silhouette.  My first thought was that it looked like the escarpment in Thatcher Park in NY.  I''ll be back after voting to see where this was taken! :)', '2006-08-01 11:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683391, 370286, 51538, '<td valign="top">It''s a remarkable capture - but the framing is a little odd.  No flower and too much to the back of the bird.  I would have been incined to crop much of the background out.</td>', 'It''s a remarkable capture - but the framing is a little odd.  No flower and too much to the back of the bird.  I would have been incined to crop much of the background out.', '2006-08-01 11:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683393, 370232, 57278, '<td valign="top">stunning, 9</td>', 'stunning, 9', '2006-08-01 11:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683395, 371960, 51538, '<td valign="top">I could swim in that - being 100 degrees in NYC today.  The simplicity lends itself to a Zen subject - but not a rich experience of enlightenment or viewing.  Something is missing.</td>', 'I could swim in that - being 100 degrees in NYC today.  The simplicity lends itself to a Zen subject - but not a rich experience of enlightenment or viewing.  Something is missing.', '2006-08-01 11:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2683397, 370375, 57278, '<td valign="top">10/10</td>', '10/10', '2006-08-01 11:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
