(2683721, 369178, 42100, '<td valign="top">A very witty and humurous photo.  Some of the brick tones seem a tad on the harsh side to me, but still an excellent photo.</td>', 'A very witty and humurous photo.  Some of the brick tones seem a tad on the harsh side to me, but still an excellent photo.', '2006-08-01 13:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
