(2684032, 372523, 30049, '<td valign="top">This image is going to have a polarized voting scale I''ll bet.  Some are going to like the soft, muted colors, while many (I think) are going to say it''s a bit flat and toned down, lacking contrast.  It''s a wonderful floral image.  I would prefer an adjustment to levels I think and bring up the brightness a little with just a touch of contrast boost.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This image is going to have a polarized voting scale I''ll bet.  Some are going to like the soft, muted colors, while many (I think) are going to say it''s a bit flat and toned down, lacking contrast.  It''s a wonderful floral image.  I would prefer an adjustment to levels I think and bring up the brightness a little with just a touch of contrast boost.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-08-01 15:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
