(2684955, 372223, 11800, '<td valign="top">first impression: Serene. I like the pp and the dark corners. <br/>Technicals: Good exposure and converted to bring out most of the texture.<br/>Additional thoughts: I see how the clouds could be considered a major element to visualizing wind, but I also like this cropped to just above the tree line. The power of the picture is the imagined rustle sound made by the grass. Cropping makes the picture more intimate and forces the viewer to listen even more carefully to that imagined sound.</td>', 'first impression: Serene. I like the pp and the dark corners. Technicals: Good exposure and converted to bring out most of the texture.Additional thoughts: I see how the clouds could be considered a major element to visualizing wind, but I also like this cropped to just above the tree line. The power of the picture is the imagined rustle sound made by the grass. Cropping makes the picture more intimate and forces the viewer to listen even more carefully to that imagined sound.', '2006-08-01 19:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
