(2685907, 372237, 41337, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the teapot helps here. Placing it on the shelf especially suddenly makes the shelf just a shelf and also makes the window blinds, window blinds. Without the teapot, the image becomes something totally different, which for me would have been more zen-like. Anyway, just my opinion.</td>', 'I don''t think the teapot helps here. Placing it on the shelf especially suddenly makes the shelf just a shelf and also makes the window blinds, window blinds. Without the teapot, the image becomes something totally different, which for me would have been more zen-like. Anyway, just my opinion.', '2006-08-02 00:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
