(2687249, 372247, 57229, '<td valign="top">The tree is a koan. I suppose it should ideally be silhouetted against the sky, but I wouldn''t have gone swimming with all that camera gear either...</td>', 'The tree is a koan. I suppose it should ideally be silhouetted against the sky, but I wouldn''t have gone swimming with all that camera gear either...', '2006-08-02 06:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687258, 370997, 57229, '<td valign="top">I think the swan''s just a wee bit too central for this image to - wait for it -  dislocate the viewer from routine perception. Has zen simplicity but lacks zen detachment (because of the composition''s geometry, forgive me, I''m struggling to express something here)</td>', 'I think the swan''s just a wee bit too central for this image to - wait for it -  dislocate the viewer from routine perception. Has zen simplicity but lacks zen detachment (because of the composition''s geometry, forgive me, I''m struggling to express something here)', '2006-08-02 06:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687264, 371535, 57229, '<td valign="top">The two curves of gondola and bridge actually cancel out the noise of people. Wish it were less saturated, but there is zen quality. Composition and a half.</td>', 'The two curves of gondola and bridge actually cancel out the noise of people. Wish it were less saturated, but there is zen quality. Composition and a half.', '2006-08-02 06:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687277, 370772, 57229, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - pity you couldn''t get that guy to move out of the way...</td>', 'Nice shot - pity you couldn''t get that guy to move out of the way...', '2006-08-02 06:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687331, 372057, 36470, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! Love it! Good luck!</td>', 'Nice capture! Love it! Good luck!', '2006-08-02 07:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687342, 369178, 36470, '<td valign="top">The shadows are a major distraction for me.  Fits the challenge and is well composed, but better lighting could have made it great</td>', 'The shadows are a major distraction for me.  Fits the challenge and is well composed, but better lighting could have made it great', '2006-08-02 07:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
