(2687429, 372052, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and detail in the feather but would have been tempted to crop the slight curve of the material on the left handside as I find it slightly distracting</td>', 'I like the idea and detail in the feather but would have been tempted to crop the slight curve of the material on the left handside as I find it slightly distracting', '2006-08-02 08:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
