(2687463, 372406, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the rocks and greenery but would have been tempted to have the statue a little more off centre. 7</td>', 'I like the rocks and greenery but would have been tempted to have the statue a little more off centre. 7', '2006-08-02 08:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
