(2687490, 372328, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but the image seems over all a little soft to me</td>', 'I like the composition but the image seems over all a little soft to me', '2006-08-02 08:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687491, 372447, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the composition but feel the colours of the flower could do with a boost and a large spot of sensor dust on the right could be removed (if I am being picky!) :o)7</td>', 'I like the composition but feel the colours of the flower could do with a boost and a large spot of sensor dust on the right could be removed (if I am being picky!) :o)7', '2006-08-02 08:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687523, 372222, 24454, '<td valign="top">As little as I know of zen photography, this photo very much depicts peace, harmony, beauty.  I love the still night colors, and the beauty of that massive ocean.  Great job.</td>', 'As little as I know of zen photography, this photo very much depicts peace, harmony, beauty.  I love the still night colors, and the beauty of that massive ocean.  Great job.', '2006-08-02 08:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687527, 371778, 16004, '<td valign="top">i like this very much; the bamboo is a natural link to the zen thing being very far eastern in feel and mood.  the softness around the border is a nice touch, and it works exceedingly well conveying an almost dreamlike mental-journey-feeling ambience.  the only thing i''m not too sure about is the B&amp;W - kind of makes it look a bit like one of those 10000x microscopic picture of bacteria, which isn''t very zen-like.  still, it has that BAM! in instant appeal, and deserves to do well.  9.</td>', 'i like this very much; the bamboo is a natural link to the zen thing being very far eastern in feel and mood.  the softness around the border is a nice touch, and it works exceedingly well conveying an almost dreamlike mental-journey-feeling ambience.  the only thing i''m not too sure about is the B&W - kind of makes it look a bit like one of those 10000x microscopic picture of bacteria, which isn''t very zen-like.  still, it has that BAM! in instant appeal, and deserves to do well.  9.', '2006-08-02 09:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687530, 370790, 16004, '<td valign="top">the whole concept of zen is naturally open to a very wide sort of interpretation, but for me this doesn''t really do it or strike a very zen like chord for me.  visually, it''s very attractive, especially with the choice of background.  there does seem to be a very noticeable difference in focus on the plants though, and it is a bit distracting.  6.</td>', 'the whole concept of zen is naturally open to a very wide sort of interpretation, but for me this doesn''t really do it or strike a very zen like chord for me.  visually, it''s very attractive, especially with the choice of background.  there does seem to be a very noticeable difference in focus on the plants though, and it is a bit distracting.  6.', '2006-08-02 09:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687533, 371870, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good simplicity, and presentation.....</td>', 'Good simplicity, and presentation.....', '2006-08-02 09:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687536, 372237, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good simplicity and Zen image,</td>', 'Good simplicity and Zen image,', '2006-08-02 09:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687538, 370106, 33352, '<td valign="top">Vertical lines would have created a stronger Zen image in this case....5</td>', 'Vertical lines would have created a stronger Zen image in this case....5', '2006-08-02 09:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687540, 369705, 33352, '<td valign="top">A little busy for the simplicity of Zen... and a stronger Dof....5</td>', 'A little busy for the simplicity of Zen... and a stronger Dof....5', '2006-08-02 09:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687546, 370151, 33352, '<td valign="top">This is good Zen, IMO the surfer should be in line with the headland in the back ground,like the colors,and story....8</td>', 'This is good Zen, IMO the surfer should be in line with the headland in the back ground,like the colors,and story....8', '2006-08-02 09:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687552, 371993, 33352, '<td valign="top">Strong simplicity, and colors,the grass to the right is distracting...7</td>', 'Strong simplicity, and colors,the grass to the right is distracting...7', '2006-08-02 09:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687556, 372244, 33352, '<td valign="top">The simplicity of the one soul seems to be lost in the busy of the image, but the Zen is good....8</td>', 'The simplicity of the one soul seems to be lost in the busy of the image, but the Zen is good....8', '2006-08-02 09:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687558, 372497, 33352, '<td valign="top">Really like the Zen created here, the lighting is strong,as well as the image being crisp...9</td>', 'Really like the Zen created here, the lighting is strong,as well as the image being crisp...9', '2006-08-02 09:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687566, 372034, 33352, '<td valign="top">Top Shelf Zen, and use of color,seems like reality photography.....10</td>', 'Top Shelf Zen, and use of color,seems like reality photography.....10', '2006-08-02 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687571, 372451, 44453, '<td valign="top">If it was really an invisible grasshopper then it would be a very boring photo....  But I really like this - 9</td>', 'If it was really an invisible grasshopper then it would be a very boring photo....  But I really like this - 9', '2006-08-02 09:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687572, 370375, 33352, '<td valign="top">Although busy, has a lot of Zen going on in this image,the reflections in the water are great,and the color of the trees softens the overall effect....10</td>', 'Although busy, has a lot of Zen going on in this image,the reflections in the water are great,and the color of the trees softens the overall effect....10', '2006-08-02 09:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687574, 372548, 16004, '<td valign="top">nice!  very visual piece of art here.  having it floating is very clever, as it increases it''s zenness ten fold.  it is reminiscent of something, but not sure what...  8.</td>', 'nice!  very visual piece of art here.  having it floating is very clever, as it increases it''s zenness ten fold.  it is reminiscent of something, but not sure what...  8.', '2006-08-02 09:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687575, 372547, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good simplicity,and Zen quality...8</td>', 'Good simplicity,and Zen quality...8', '2006-08-02 09:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687586, 372428, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good story, levels need not have been lowered as much, reducing the amount of shadow...7</td>', 'Good story, levels need not have been lowered as much, reducing the amount of shadow...7', '2006-08-02 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687590, 369178, 33352, '<td valign="top">Clever Zen,</td>', 'Clever Zen,', '2006-08-02 09:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687599, 370693, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very Zen, and top image...10</td>', 'Very Zen, and top image...10', '2006-08-02 09:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687603, 372309, 16004, '<td valign="top">i love the precise little details in this; what lessens the impact somewhat are the far eastern characters in the background.  they''re neither centred nor balanced on the side in some rule of third mannerism.  they''re also too blurry - it looks like a pair of crane flys landed on the lens!  they''re also totally redundant because the hands and single flower conveys much zen; a wide crop just below the tips of the index fingers gives a more pleasing balanced picture, i feel.  i like the flower and hand elements a lot, so overall 7.</td>', 'i love the precise little details in this; what lessens the impact somewhat are the far eastern characters in the background.  they''re neither centred nor balanced on the side in some rule of third mannerism.  they''re also too blurry - it looks like a pair of crane flys landed on the lens!  they''re also totally redundant because the hands and single flower conveys much zen; a wide crop just below the tips of the index fingers gives a more pleasing balanced picture, i feel.  i like the flower and hand elements a lot, so overall 7.', '2006-08-02 09:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687605, 370409, 33352, '<td valign="top">Very good image, a lot of Zen...8</td>', 'Very good image, a lot of Zen...8', '2006-08-02 09:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687610, 372538, 33352, '<td valign="top">Zen is the winner in this image...9</td>', 'Zen is the winner in this image...9', '2006-08-02 09:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687616, 370667, 33352, '<td valign="top">like the way the shadow creates simplicity...8</td>', 'like the way the shadow creates simplicity...8', '2006-08-02 09:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687623, 372550, 33352, '<td valign="top">Good black and white photography,</td>', 'Good black and white photography,', '2006-08-02 09:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687782, 372391, 11800, '<td valign="top">The colors are dynamic and the smoke was captured with the right type of light. The sticks look as if there is movement so they don''t look sharp. It looks as if a large radius usm was used to try to make up for the movement. I''m not saying this is the actual case, just what it looks like to me.<br/>To get a higher score, arrange the sticks in an orderly pattern and use a tripod to get them tack sharp. The smoke movement is good as is the background and lighting.</td>', 'The colors are dynamic and the smoke was captured with the right type of light. The sticks look as if there is movement so they don''t look sharp. It looks as if a large radius usm was used to try to make up for the movement. I''m not saying this is the actual case, just what it looks like to me.To get a higher score, arrange the sticks in an orderly pattern and use a tripod to get them tack sharp. The smoke movement is good as is the background and lighting.', '2006-08-02 10:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687864, 371663, 15358, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a place in Buffalo, NY.  Interesting processing.</td>', 'This reminds me of a place in Buffalo, NY.  Interesting processing.', '2006-08-02 10:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687895, 372549, 11800, '<td valign="top">First impression: The colors are not right. The water is to blue. Most of the frame is filled with the sky but the title is about the water.<br/>Things that would improve the score: Rethink the composition and the pov. I''m thinking that a lower pov would make the pier more dominant in the picture. Maybe a more subtle color enhancement in post processing. What really throws me off is the difference in the color cast of the pier and the water. If the sky and water was that blue, the pier would also carry a blue tint. It looks greenish to me. I think that''s why the water looks to blue.</td>', 'First impression: The colors are not right. The water is to blue. Most of the frame is filled with the sky but the title is about the water.Things that would improve the score: Rethink the composition and the pov. I''m thinking that a lower pov would make the pier more dominant in the picture. Maybe a more subtle color enhancement in post processing. What really throws me off is the difference in the color cast of the pier and the water. If the sky and water was that blue, the pier would also carry a blue tint. It looks greenish to me. I think that''s why the water looks to blue.', '2006-08-02 10:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687926, 372121, 11800, '<td valign="top">First impression: There is color banding that makes the photo look as if it has water stains on it. Interesting choice of subject.<br/>This isn''t something that would traditionally score well on dpc. So I''ll read your comments after the challenge ends.</td>', 'First impression: There is color banding that makes the photo look as if it has water stains on it. Interesting choice of subject.This isn''t something that would traditionally score well on dpc. So I''ll read your comments after the challenge ends.', '2006-08-02 10:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2687990, 372131, 11800, '<td valign="top">First impression: The red is fuzzy. Nice tension of between the position of the pearl and the wave of red. The colors are more exciting than calm.<br/>Even though the subject(pearl) is in focus, the lack of focus on the long line between the red and blue will cause a lot of people to say this isn''t in focus and score accordingly.</td>', 'First impression: The red is fuzzy. Nice tension of between the position of the pearl and the wave of red. The colors are more exciting than calm.Even though the subject(pearl) is in focus, the lack of focus on the long line between the red and blue will cause a lot of people to say this isn''t in focus and score accordingly.', '2006-08-02 11:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
