(2689192, 372505, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lighting looks good and I can''t tell if the focus is purposefully soft or not but I like the effect.  I think there is zen to be found in this image and how the subject works in relation to all the negative space.  I''m not sure I like the stark white background though, it feels a little clinical to me, but I have no suggestions for a different color.  I also think a slight shift in the lighting would give the petal a little more depth and that might help improve the image too - as it is now its starting to almost have a 2D feel too it, though there are hints of shadow and bumps on the petal.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Lighting looks good and I can''t tell if the focus is purposefully soft or not but I like the effect.  I think there is zen to be found in this image and how the subject works in relation to all the negative space.  I''m not sure I like the stark white background though, it feels a little clinical to me, but I have no suggestions for a different color.  I also think a slight shift in the lighting would give the petal a little more depth and that might help improve the image too - as it is now its starting to almost have a 2D feel too it, though there are hints of shadow and bumps on the petal.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-02 16:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2689193, 372193, 50695, '<td valign="top">the sentinel who does not sleep<br/>will sleep standing up. 5</td>', 'the sentinel who does not sleepwill sleep standing up. 5', '2006-08-02 16:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
