(2689200, 370544, 11923, '<td valign="top">Lovely pale colors.  The focus looks decent though I wish it was better on the bird.  I like how the sky and sea seem to meld together but at the same time I wish there was more feeling of distance so the relationship between the small bird and the great unknown was even more emphasized.  I also think I''d crop out the bottom few rocks so you just have a slim line of rocks beneath the bird and then the horizon expanding outward.  I suggest this only because the surf is somewhat busy and that breaks up the feeling of tranquility in the scene for me.  I gave a 5</td>', 'Lovely pale colors.  The focus looks decent though I wish it was better on the bird.  I like how the sky and sea seem to meld together but at the same time I wish there was more feeling of distance so the relationship between the small bird and the great unknown was even more emphasized.  I also think I''d crop out the bottom few rocks so you just have a slim line of rocks beneath the bird and then the horizon expanding outward.  I suggest this only because the surf is somewhat busy and that breaks up the feeling of tranquility in the scene for me.  I gave a 5', '2006-08-02 16:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
