(2689425, 372126, 42495, '<td valign="top">This is exactly what I tried to do in mine, but I couldn''t get it right so did something different.  Not only did you do it, but you did it well.  Great job.</td>', 'This is exactly what I tried to do in mine, but I couldn''t get it right so did something different.  Not only did you do it, but you did it well.  Great job.', '2006-08-02 18:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
