(2693409, 372421, 60379, '<td valign="top">Not feeling too much zen on this one.  Although I do feel it''s a lofty attempt.  Beautiful photo, I just think it''s a bit busy.  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...</td>', 'Not feeling too much zen on this one.  Although I do feel it''s a lofty attempt.  Beautiful photo, I just think it''s a bit busy.  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...', '2006-08-03 20:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
