(2693414, 372551, 48389, '<td valign="top">I like the colours of the sun on the water but would have been tempted to crop to the horizon and just have the water and nice colour in the frame (MHO)</td>', 'I like the colours of the sun on the water but would have been tempted to crop to the horizon and just have the water and nice colour in the frame (MHO)', '2006-08-03 20:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
