(2693531, 372531, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation of zen, but the white things in the background and the towel are distracting. Also the rocks don''t seem quite sharp. And last but not least, the skin color looks very unnatural.</td>', 'Great interpretation of zen, but the white things in the background and the towel are distracting. Also the rocks don''t seem quite sharp. And last but not least, the skin color looks very unnatural.', '2006-08-03 21:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693540, 372522, 7485, '<td valign="top">Exquisite lighting and texture!</td>', 'Exquisite lighting and texture!', '2006-08-03 21:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693552, 371565, 7485, '<td valign="top">Definitely my favorite so far. Love the sweeping curve of the trees and the textures of the clouds and the trees. Too bad about the compression artifacts (giving the sky a mottled look and adding a noise halo around the trees). You realize your image file is 36KB, far smaller than the maximum 150KB? - 8</td>', 'Definitely my favorite so far. Love the sweeping curve of the trees and the textures of the clouds and the trees. Too bad about the compression artifacts (giving the sky a mottled look and adding a noise halo around the trees). You realize your image file is 36KB, far smaller than the maximum 150KB? - 8', '2006-08-03 21:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693557, 372466, 35947, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Love it!  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Love it!  Good luck in the challenge!', '2006-08-03 21:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693562, 369602, 7485, '<td valign="top">Colors are excellent, but the super-bright glow around the mountains doesn''t help at all</td>', 'Colors are excellent, but the super-bright glow around the mountains doesn''t help at all', '2006-08-03 21:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693569, 372144, 7485, '<td valign="top">I think we have a winner here...</td>', 'I think we have a winner here...', '2006-08-03 21:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693692, 372311, 63267, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the black and white conversion here.  The object you photographed has vibrant colors and dulling those with black and white doesn''t help.</td>', 'I don''t like the black and white conversion here.  The object you photographed has vibrant colors and dulling those with black and white doesn''t help.', '2006-08-03 22:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693698, 372285, 63267, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  there is good color in the sky and the fog coming off the water is nicely captured.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  there is good color in the sky and the fog coming off the water is nicely captured.', '2006-08-03 22:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693700, 372408, 63267, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color and detail on the pettles.</td>', 'Beautiful color and detail on the pettles.', '2006-08-03 22:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693703, 372095, 63267, '<td valign="top">I would like this photo a lot more if the blown out sky did not clip the edges of the myramid.</td>', 'I would like this photo a lot more if the blown out sky did not clip the edges of the myramid.', '2006-08-03 22:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693712, 372172, 63267, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot here.  the compostion leads you from the lower corner to the back of the photo and the colors are great.  A definite winner!</td>', 'Excellent shot here.  the compostion leads you from the lower corner to the back of the photo and the colors are great.  A definite winner!', '2006-08-03 22:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693717, 372274, 63267, '<td valign="top">Excellent exposure here.  The clouds and sky are beautiful while keeping the detail in the wheat.  The border really ties the color together, nice choice.</td>', 'Excellent exposure here.  The clouds and sky are beautiful while keeping the detail in the wheat.  The border really ties the color together, nice choice.', '2006-08-03 22:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693720, 372126, 30982, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is perfect, with the gradation from upper left to lower right.  Very zen indeed.</td>', 'The lighting on this is perfect, with the gradation from upper left to lower right.  Very zen indeed.', '2006-08-03 22:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693721, 371899, 63267, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the serenity of the image, but I feel like some of the left should have been cropped off.  The highlights in the sky on the left are distracting to the dock leading you into the image.  Almost as if they are overpowering in a darker photo.</td>', 'I love the colors and the serenity of the image, but I feel like some of the left should have been cropped off.  The highlights in the sky on the left are distracting to the dock leading you into the image.  Almost as if they are overpowering in a darker photo.', '2006-08-03 22:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2693725, 370151, 63267, '<td valign="top">reminds me of my childhood in San Diego.  Never wanting to leave the beach until there was no light left to navigate the waters by.  Excellent photo!</td>', 'reminds me of my childhood in San Diego.  Never wanting to leave the beach until there was no light left to navigate the waters by.  Excellent photo!', '2006-08-03 22:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
