(2693760, 372219, 43714, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful, and I love the way the front leaves go opposite to the back leaves. They remind me of fans that open and close. Great focus!!</td>', 'This is so beautiful, and I love the way the front leaves go opposite to the back leaves. They remind me of fans that open and close. Great focus!!', '2006-08-03 22:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
