(2693950, 372550, 23680, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2006-08-04 00:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694048, 372096, 37430, '<td valign="top">The perfect reflections give good idea of calm waters. A simple and well executed photo. The muted colors in reflection and concrete hard rock seems to be like reality sorrounded by dreams. Goodluck.8.</td>', 'The perfect reflections give good idea of calm waters. A simple and well executed photo. The muted colors in reflection and concrete hard rock seems to be like reality sorrounded by dreams. Goodluck.8.', '2006-08-04 00:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694049, 371778, 37430, '<td valign="top">Whats the Zen without bamboo...??? :) This one really works. I love the b/w treatment and lighting. The play of light and shadow is well captured over a simple subject. On negative side- I think you used something called "selective focus" and did not used DoF control for blur effect. I would have liked more natural looking blur effect on this one which could have been easily achieved using shallow DoF. Still a wonderful picture.8.</td>', 'Whats the Zen without bamboo...??? :) This one really works. I love the b/w treatment and lighting. The play of light and shadow is well captured over a simple subject. On negative side- I think you used something called "selective focus" and did not used DoF control for blur effect. I would have liked more natural looking blur effect on this one which could have been easily achieved using shallow DoF. Still a wonderful picture.8.', '2006-08-04 00:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694050, 369560, 37430, '<td valign="top">Simple, Abstract and Zen. I like it though I wish for little more contrast (or is it just my monitor?). Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Simple, Abstract and Zen. I like it though I wish for little more contrast (or is it just my monitor?). Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-04 00:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694059, 372478, 50680, '<td valign="top">sorry didn''t capture my interest</td>', 'sorry didn''t capture my interest', '2006-08-04 00:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694060, 372106, 37430, '<td valign="top">Love the photo. The lighting works very well here. I like the strong contrast between the subject and background. Personally I would have liked a little more of background. Goodluck.8.</td>', 'Love the photo. The lighting works very well here. I like the strong contrast between the subject and background. Personally I would have liked a little more of background. Goodluck.8.', '2006-08-04 00:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694061, 372502, 37430, '<td valign="top">Love the dash of red on mostly bland background.8.</td>', 'Love the dash of red on mostly bland background.8.', '2006-08-04 00:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694070, 371991, 37430, '<td valign="top">All is surely calm. A dash of ripples actually makes to see the stillness in contrast. Very well executed and the size of subject is just in line Zen paintings. I feel there was no need to horizon on this photo. Simple reflects in water would also have just worked fine (or maybe even better IMO.) Goodluck.8.</td>', 'All is surely calm. A dash of ripples actually makes to see the stillness in contrast. Very well executed and the size of subject is just in line Zen paintings. I feel there was no need to horizon on this photo. Simple reflects in water would also have just worked fine (or maybe even better IMO.) Goodluck.8.', '2006-08-04 00:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694072, 372037, 37430, '<td valign="top">Zen is all about seeing beauty in simple things. This photo is perfect example of it. It is not easy for everyone to see and appreciate the "basic". Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Zen is all about seeing beauty in simple things. This photo is perfect example of it. It is not easy for everyone to see and appreciate the "basic". Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-04 00:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694073, 372429, 37430, '<td valign="top">Simple and Zen. Love the play of light and shadows.8.</td>', 'Simple and Zen. Love the play of light and shadows.8.', '2006-08-04 00:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694078, 372106, 50680, '<td valign="top">great mood nice job</td>', 'great mood nice job', '2006-08-04 00:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694106, 371413, 50680, '<td valign="top">very earthy I feel the zen</td>', 'very earthy I feel the zen', '2006-08-04 01:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694108, 372034, 50680, '<td valign="top">wow that really pops -10</td>', 'wow that really pops -10', '2006-08-04 01:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694110, 372495, 50680, '<td valign="top">very very nice</td>', 'very very nice', '2006-08-04 01:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694126, 372215, 50680, '<td valign="top">unique and I love it</td>', 'unique and I love it', '2006-08-04 01:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694127, 372497, 37430, '<td valign="top">It is not for everyone to be able to see beauty in simple things ..forget about capturing it in camera. This is simply beautiful. I love the highlights due to backlighting without losing any details on the subject. It is truly zen to see the darkness in background getting more visible due to dash of light in foreground. Goodluck.8.</td>', 'It is not for everyone to be able to see beauty in simple things ..forget about capturing it in camera. This is simply beautiful. I love the highlights due to backlighting without losing any details on the subject. It is truly zen to see the darkness in background getting more visible due to dash of light in foreground. Goodluck.8.', '2006-08-04 01:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694128, 372187, 37430, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at its best. I love the lighting and choice of solid background. The placement is just prefect. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Simplicity at its best. I love the lighting and choice of solid background. The placement is just prefect. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-04 01:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694129, 371663, 63343, '<td valign="top">awesome lighting and exposure</td>', 'awesome lighting and exposure', '2006-08-04 01:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694139, 372023, 37430, '<td valign="top">I like the way "far end" is missing from the photo. The dash of concrete subject (ship) actually helps in highlighting the vastness of the environment. On the second look I actully find it scary to see the profound "nothingness" communicated by the photo. Bumping from 7(first pass) to 9(during comments). Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'I like the way "far end" is missing from the photo. The dash of concrete subject (ship) actually helps in highlighting the vastness of the environment. On the second look I actully find it scary to see the profound "nothingness" communicated by the photo. Bumping from 7(first pass) to 9(during comments). Hope this does well for you.', '2006-08-04 01:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694141, 372194, 37430, '<td valign="top">Now this is Zen without stones, smoke, water or garden. I love the simplicity of this. The shadows and texture of wall adds to drama.  Good choice of keeping the subject small compared to background. I feel a little left or right (basically not in the middle) placement of cycle would have been even better. Hope this does well for you.9.</td>', 'Now this is Zen without stones, smoke, water or garden. I love the simplicity of this. The shadows and texture of wall adds to drama.  Good choice of keeping the subject small compared to background. I feel a little left or right (basically not in the middle) placement of cycle would have been even better. Hope this does well for you.9.', '2006-08-04 01:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694145, 372537, 37430, '<td valign="top">Love the play of light and shadows. The beauty of "simplicity" is well captured. Good choice of b/w. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Love the play of light and shadows. The beauty of "simplicity" is well captured. Good choice of b/w. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-04 01:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694146, 372189, 37430, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture. I know the mind needs to be at rest to see such a beauty around us. This is surely Zen. Hope it does well for you.9.</td>', 'Lovely capture. I know the mind needs to be at rest to see such a beauty around us. This is surely Zen. Hope it does well for you.9.', '2006-08-04 01:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694147, 371566, 37430, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful. Love the contrast of colors and placement of the subject. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful. Love the contrast of colors and placement of the subject. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-04 01:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694149, 371593, 37430, '<td valign="top">I really dont know what I''m looking at but it still communicates "harmony". Everything seems to be at place where it is meant to be. The "minor" subject really enhances the presence of the background. Very Zen.8.</td>', 'I really dont know what I''m looking at but it still communicates "harmony". Everything seems to be at place where it is meant to be. The "minor" subject really enhances the presence of the background. Very Zen.8.', '2006-08-04 01:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694151, 372272, 37430, '<td valign="top">Cliche...and still it works :) Goodluck.8.</td>', 'Cliche...and still it works :) Goodluck.8.', '2006-08-04 01:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694154, 372427, 37430, '<td valign="top">Simple and Serene. I like the subject and the placement. The smooth flow of smoke communicates calmness and the dash of red adds a bit of drama. On improvement side- I''d have liked to see a little better lighting on smoke and a little better focus. Goodluck.7.</td>', 'Simple and Serene. I like the subject and the placement. The smooth flow of smoke communicates calmness and the dash of red adds a bit of drama. On improvement side- I''d have liked to see a little better lighting on smoke and a little better focus. Goodluck.7.', '2006-08-04 01:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694157, 371338, 50680, '<td valign="top">great light,color,and mood</td>', 'great light,color,and mood', '2006-08-04 01:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694163, 372194, 50680, '<td valign="top">Love it</td>', 'Love it', '2006-08-04 01:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694165, 372168, 37430, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see this photo as "strict" example of zen "style" of photography but it communicates the "feel" of zen very well :). The contrast between peace and cluttered (mind) is very well communicated. Technically this is very well executed and I like the b/w treatment. Bumping from 7 (initial pass) to 9 (during comments). Hope this does well for you.</td>', 'I don''t really see this photo as "strict" example of zen "style" of photography but it communicates the "feel" of zen very well :). The contrast between peace and cluttered (mind) is very well communicated. Technically this is very well executed and I like the b/w treatment. Bumping from 7 (initial pass) to 9 (during comments). Hope this does well for you.', '2006-08-04 01:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694169, 372217, 37430, '<td valign="top">I feel very tempted to recrop this photo and keep only the bottom half of it starting from the stone to all the way down. I simply loved the colors and reflections. Presence of real and reflection, with equal weightage, kind of make my focus switch between two. The "extreme" processing works well on this one. The technical execution is perfect. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'I feel very tempted to recrop this photo and keep only the bottom half of it starting from the stone to all the way down. I simply loved the colors and reflections. Presence of real and reflection, with equal weightage, kind of make my focus switch between two. The "extreme" processing works well on this one. The technical execution is perfect. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-04 01:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694173, 372166, 37430, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you see not many things being captured in this photo. I like the idea but would have preferred to see non-centered placement of subject and a little more of background. Selective desat works well on this one. Goodluck.7.</td>', 'I''m glad you see not many things being captured in this photo. I like the idea but would have preferred to see non-centered placement of subject and a little more of background. Selective desat works well on this one. Goodluck.7.', '2006-08-04 01:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694174, 372168, 51793, '<td valign="top">A little dark but that makes you really look into the image. The sun shinning through the clouds is great but there needs to be a tad more light on the cars and road. Over all this is a very good picture. Gave you a 8</td>', 'A little dark but that makes you really look into the image. The sun shinning through the clouds is great but there needs to be a tad more light on the cars and road. Over all this is a very good picture. Gave you a 8', '2006-08-04 01:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694178, 372188, 51793, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, I will keep this idea in mind when I get remarried. 10</td>', 'I really like this picture, I will keep this idea in mind when I get remarried. 10', '2006-08-04 01:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694180, 372034, 37430, '<td valign="top">My general comment would have been  - Capturing Zen Garden is not an example of Zen photography. But this one is different and is very well executed. The dash of man-made-structure actually helps in highlighting the natural background. FOr my taste, I''d have liked to keep the subject (Tea house?) a little more smaller compared to background. Infrared treatment is well done. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'My general comment would have been  - Capturing Zen Garden is not an example of Zen photography. But this one is different and is very well executed. The dash of man-made-structure actually helps in highlighting the natural background. FOr my taste, I''d have liked to keep the subject (Tea house?) a little more smaller compared to background. Infrared treatment is well done. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-04 01:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694182, 372393, 37430, '<td valign="top">Cliche... and yet it works :) I don''t think there are rocks (dough?) but it still looks nice. Good choice of blue color as it makes it little different from other such shots.7.</td>', 'Cliche... and yet it works :) I don''t think there are rocks (dough?) but it still looks nice. Good choice of blue color as it makes it little different from other such shots.7.', '2006-08-04 01:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
