(2694185, 369795, 50680, '<td valign="top">not sure why but, your shot looks really pixelated on my screen where as most everyone elses shots don''t. could be the way you reduced the size</td>', 'not sure why but, your shot looks really pixelated on my screen where as most everyone elses shots don''t. could be the way you reduced the size', '2006-08-04 01:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
