(2694350, 372523, 47487, '<td valign="top">gorgeous. It draws the eye in beautifully; I want to just keep looking at it.</td>', 'gorgeous. It draws the eye in beautifully; I want to just keep looking at it.', '2006-08-04 04:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694358, 369659, 47487, '<td valign="top">This looks like a nice, inviting place, but maybe a different angle or the inclusion of a focal point would have made for a more soothing and interesting shot.</td>', 'This looks like a nice, inviting place, but maybe a different angle or the inclusion of a focal point would have made for a more soothing and interesting shot.', '2006-08-04 04:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694360, 372188, 16004, '<td valign="top">not sure it really conveys the idea of zen to me, but it''s still a sensual classy shot...  though it does almost look like the girl on the left is about to dig in her nails to the other ones throat...  very elegant shot nonetheless; 7</td>', 'not sure it really conveys the idea of zen to me, but it''s still a sensual classy shot...  though it does almost look like the girl on the left is about to dig in her nails to the other ones throat...  very elegant shot nonetheless; 7', '2006-08-04 04:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694365, 371981, 16004, '<td valign="top">on a personal level, this doesn''t feel particularly zenlike to me...  the water feels wrong for this sort of harmonious themed challenge. it''s hard to put in words, really...  the colours feel a bit washed out too; could do with a levels and contrast adjustment possibly.  it''s nice, but just lacks that special something - 5</td>', 'on a personal level, this doesn''t feel particularly zenlike to me...  the water feels wrong for this sort of harmonious themed challenge. it''s hard to put in words, really...  the colours feel a bit washed out too; could do with a levels and contrast adjustment possibly.  it''s nice, but just lacks that special something - 5', '2006-08-04 04:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694366, 371590, 16004, '<td valign="top">i think you''ve definitely captured some element of the whole zen thing; the lad appears deeply relaxed in an almost medatitive sort of way.  the high view point and angle also adds a higher degree of interest, and makes it feel different. the lovely hotel-brochure blueness of the pool just adds to a sense of tranquility; and technically i can''t fault any element of the shot, from composition to focus to everything.  i like it :) 9</td>', 'i think you''ve definitely captured some element of the whole zen thing; the lad appears deeply relaxed in an almost medatitive sort of way.  the high view point and angle also adds a higher degree of interest, and makes it feel different. the lovely hotel-brochure blueness of the pool just adds to a sense of tranquility; and technically i can''t fault any element of the shot, from composition to focus to everything.  i like it :) 9', '2006-08-04 04:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694368, 369560, 60379, '<td valign="top">great job!  This has a very lofty feeling to it, I can feel the air moving, while yet still.  The minimal use of color and lighting keep this photo very silent in movement and distraction, creating a great sense of zen for me.  At least, my idea of zen.  Great job from the ''great job baggie''....</td>', 'great job!  This has a very lofty feeling to it, I can feel the air moving, while yet still.  The minimal use of color and lighting keep this photo very silent in movement and distraction, creating a great sense of zen for me.  At least, my idea of zen.  Great job from the ''great job baggie''....', '2006-08-04 04:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694369, 372126, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  It is tonally very quiet, and just a bit of movement in the ripple, which is why I didn''t score it a tad higher. <br/> <br/>Update:  I went back in and looked again, and feel that this does deserve a higher mark.  <br/> <br/>This has a very lofty feeling to it, I can feel the water moving, while yet still.  The minimal use of color and lighting keep this photo very silent in movement and distraction, creating a great sense of zen for me.  At least, my idea of zen.  Gave you a 10.  Great job from the ''great job baggie''....</td>', 'Very pretty.  It is tonally very quiet, and just a bit of movement in the ripple, which is why I didn''t score it a tad higher.  Update:  I went back in and looked again, and feel that this does deserve a higher mark.   This has a very lofty feeling to it, I can feel the water moving, while yet still.  The minimal use of color and lighting keep this photo very silent in movement and distraction, creating a great sense of zen for me.  At least, my idea of zen.  Gave you a 10.  Great job from the ''great job baggie''....', '2006-08-04 04:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694370, 372548, 60379, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Great use of color (minimal) and light (minimal).  The overall feeling of this photo is simplicity.  My idea of a zen photo is one that my eye is not so drawn into the details of the photo, making it busy.  Yours does not do that, my focus is on one thing only, my eye is at rest.  The position of the marble is perfect for this shot, and whatever you used as the background works perfectly as well.  I thought the shot before this one was my fave, but now yours is!  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''...</td>', 'I love this!  Great use of color (minimal) and light (minimal).  The overall feeling of this photo is simplicity.  My idea of a zen photo is one that my eye is not so drawn into the details of the photo, making it busy.  Yours does not do that, my focus is on one thing only, my eye is at rest.  The position of the marble is perfect for this shot, and whatever you used as the background works perfectly as well.  I thought the shot before this one was my fave, but now yours is!  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''...', '2006-08-04 04:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694371, 372478, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of minimal/tonal color in this one, the best that I''ve seen so far.  Very simple subjects.  So far, my favorite.</td>', 'Very nice use of minimal/tonal color in this one, the best that I''ve seen so far.  Very simple subjects.  So far, my favorite.', '2006-08-04 04:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694372, 372189, 60379, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo, minimal subject, no movement, minimal lighting, great tonal qualities.  My fave so far.</td>', 'Awesome photo, minimal subject, no movement, minimal lighting, great tonal qualities.  My fave so far.', '2006-08-04 04:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694373, 370494, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous shot, great use of minimal color and tone.  It blends, it works in harmony, one ridge to the next.  One of my favorites so far in this challenge.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous shot, great use of minimal color and tone.  It blends, it works in harmony, one ridge to the next.  One of my favorites so far in this challenge.', '2006-08-04 04:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694374, 372489, 60379, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous display of zen.  I love the background color, it sets the single, minimal subject apart quite beautifully.  There were a couple of other shots like this in the challenge, but the smoke that they showed, in my opinion, put motion into the shot when it was meant to create an air of stillness, breaking their zen.  But this one does not get interrupted by any other details.  Quite beautiful, quite zenny.  Great job!</td>', 'Gorgeous display of zen.  I love the background color, it sets the single, minimal subject apart quite beautifully.  There were a couple of other shots like this in the challenge, but the smoke that they showed, in my opinion, put motion into the shot when it was meant to create an air of stillness, breaking their zen.  But this one does not get interrupted by any other details.  Quite beautiful, quite zenny.  Great job!', '2006-08-04 04:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694375, 370167, 60379, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot.  Besides being a great portrait, the softness of the colors and lighting makes this work for me.  The background is NOT distracting, which is a plus for me in this challenge.  The subject is interesting, but has a sense of softness about her as well, which works in harmony with the total shot. She seems at peace, and that peace is carried over to the whole photo, and then to me, the viewer.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'A very nice shot.  Besides being a great portrait, the softness of the colors and lighting makes this work for me.  The background is NOT distracting, which is a plus for me in this challenge.  The subject is interesting, but has a sense of softness about her as well, which works in harmony with the total shot. She seems at peace, and that peace is carried over to the whole photo, and then to me, the viewer.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694376, 372280, 60379, '<td valign="top">Yes, I feel the sense of zen in this one.  The bird seems to be one with the environment around him, and he seems to be in tune with his surroundings.  The little bit of movement in the water just may be his dinner.  Very minimal subject matter, I LOVE how he''s beautifully perched on the rock.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Yes, I feel the sense of zen in this one.  The bird seems to be one with the environment around him, and he seems to be in tune with his surroundings.  The little bit of movement in the water just may be his dinner.  Very minimal subject matter, I LOVE how he''s beautifully perched on the rock.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694377, 369385, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of minimal tone and color.  I like the hint of being in water, but something seems grainy around the bamboo itself.  Other than that, this photo is near perfect!  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very nice use of minimal tone and color.  I like the hint of being in water, but something seems grainy around the bamboo itself.  Other than that, this photo is near perfect!  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694379, 372144, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!  Gave you an 8.  You enlightened me.</td>', 'Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!  Gave you an 8.  You enlightened me.', '2006-08-04 04:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694380, 371812, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!  Nice use of minimal color and light, and creating a great stillness.</td>', 'Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!  Nice use of minimal color and light, and creating a great stillness.', '2006-08-04 04:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694383, 368951, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s very likeable; i love the glass-smooth, slightly diffused glow appearance of the water, the lush greens on the banks and the slightly decrepit look of the boat...  what might harm your score a bit is the blown out sky and the fringing colour distortion thing happening to the lines of the trees in the background; cropping below the horizon might have helped a bit.  it''s also missing something; possibly someone pretending to be asleep in the boat, or something similarly cliched (which is what the voters go for, i think).  6.</td>', 'it''s very likeable; i love the glass-smooth, slightly diffused glow appearance of the water, the lush greens on the banks and the slightly decrepit look of the boat...  what might harm your score a bit is the blown out sky and the fringing colour distortion thing happening to the lines of the trees in the background; cropping below the horizon might have helped a bit.  it''s also missing something; possibly someone pretending to be asleep in the boat, or something similarly cliched (which is what the voters go for, i think).  6.', '2006-08-04 04:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694384, 372026, 60379, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and simple placement of the subject in the area of the deepest color, and how it fades to nothingness.  Great creation of zen.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Love the colors and simple placement of the subject in the area of the deepest color, and how it fades to nothingness.  Great creation of zen.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694386, 372391, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I love the tonal qualities of the background, and minimal color in the subjects of this photo.  There was another photo like this that the smoke, to me, was to prominent and busy, yours is MUCH better in that regard.  I think I''d like this one better if there were less sticks of incense (less busy), but it is definatley pretty.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very nice.  I love the tonal qualities of the background, and minimal color in the subjects of this photo.  There was another photo like this that the smoke, to me, was to prominent and busy, yours is MUCH better in that regard.  I think I''d like this one better if there were less sticks of incense (less busy), but it is definatley pretty.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694387, 370997, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, and good job at creating a very still, serene photo.  nGreat job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very pretty, and good job at creating a very still, serene photo.  nGreat job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694390, 372550, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very minimal, very zen.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very minimal, very zen.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694391, 372183, 60379, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Good job with the stillness in this shot. The sky and the water, the trees and the water, they are at one.  I know that sounds cliche, but in your photo, it''s true.  I find the golf-course green lawn a little distracting, but not enough to knock you anything for it.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Wow.  Good job with the stillness in this shot. The sky and the water, the trees and the water, they are at one.  I know that sounds cliche, but in your photo, it''s true.  I find the golf-course green lawn a little distracting, but not enough to knock you anything for it.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694392, 371613, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is the first shot that I''ve seen in this challenge that has any humor to it.  How can one NOT smile when seeing these Buddhas.  Although I love this shot, and in another challenge, I''d vote it an 8 or 9, the buddhas in this are distracting to the calmness of the candle, which should be the only subject matter.  The glass of the blue dish blends in harmony with the black background.  As does the candle itself, which hints at an inner glow, and the light from the candle is superb in creating a sense of stillness.  I''m giving you a 7, only because of the buddhas'' distraction to the overall zen.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'This is the first shot that I''ve seen in this challenge that has any humor to it.  How can one NOT smile when seeing these Buddhas.  Although I love this shot, and in another challenge, I''d vote it an 8 or 9, the buddhas in this are distracting to the calmness of the candle, which should be the only subject matter.  The glass of the blue dish blends in harmony with the black background.  As does the candle itself, which hints at an inner glow, and the light from the candle is superb in creating a sense of stillness.  I''m giving you a 7, only because of the buddhas'' distraction to the overall zen.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694393, 371898, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job meeting the challenge.  Very minimal, very serene.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Great job meeting the challenge.  Very minimal, very serene.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694394, 370708, 60379, '<td valign="top">A gorgeous use of minimal color in this one!  Perfectly meets the challenge, one of my faves.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'A gorgeous use of minimal color in this one!  Perfectly meets the challenge, one of my faves.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694395, 372397, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The contrast of the green against the black background makes this really stand out, and I can almost feel a small breeze when I look at it, so great job in conveying that to the viewer.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very nice!  The contrast of the green against the black background makes this really stand out, and I can almost feel a small breeze when I look at it, so great job in conveying that to the viewer.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694397, 370523, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is an immensly beautiful photo, would be gorgeous on a dining room or kitchen wall.  However, I think there is just too much here for it to be totally at peace.  I think that you''ve just place a few too many elements in this, or the pattern is too busy on the black and white plate.  Not really sure which is making it too busy to create that air of peace and serenity, but my eye is not sensing it.  Voting it higher than I want to for a zen shot, because it is so beautiful.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'This is an immensly beautiful photo, would be gorgeous on a dining room or kitchen wall.  However, I think there is just too much here for it to be totally at peace.  I think that you''ve just place a few too many elements in this, or the pattern is too busy on the black and white plate.  Not really sure which is making it too busy to create that air of peace and serenity, but my eye is not sensing it.  Voting it higher than I want to for a zen shot, because it is so beautiful.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694398, 372404, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice job meeting the challenge.  The colors and subject matter are minimal, as is the use of light.  Not too much happening here to make the eye work when searching the photo for details. Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very nice job meeting the challenge.  The colors and subject matter are minimal, as is the use of light.  Not too much happening here to make the eye work when searching the photo for details. Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
