(2694400, 372445, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although some photos that try for zen using an asian theme don''t always pull it off well, this one does.  The very minimal use of color (or lack thereof), the minimal subject matter and blank background definately work here. Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Although some photos that try for zen using an asian theme don''t always pull it off well, this one does.  The very minimal use of color (or lack thereof), the minimal subject matter and blank background definately work here. Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694401, 371942, 60379, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... how to vote this one.  Difficult.  Although I don''t feel too much of a sense of quiet or peacefullness, it seems as though it is broken up by the splash look of the water.  It is a work of duality, the hardness of the surface, and the softer, melting ice.  The color is gorgeous.  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...</td>', 'Hmmm... how to vote this one.  Difficult.  Although I don''t feel too much of a sense of quiet or peacefullness, it seems as though it is broken up by the splash look of the water.  It is a work of duality, the hardness of the surface, and the softer, melting ice.  The color is gorgeous.  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...', '2006-08-04 04:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694402, 370709, 60379, '<td valign="top">Yes, you have reached zen my child.  Great minimal photo in every aspect.  Subject and slope of the ground maintains interest without too many details to break up the overall sense of zen.  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...</td>', 'Yes, you have reached zen my child.  Great minimal photo in every aspect.  Subject and slope of the ground maintains interest without too many details to break up the overall sense of zen.  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...', '2006-08-04 04:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694404, 371991, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  Usually, I find something with so much background to be a bit distracting to the eye, making the eye search the photo for all of the interesting detail.  However, I think that the distance of the treeline, and the softness in the clouds being reflected do not harm the overall sense of quietness in this photo, as they might in other photos of this type.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'This is very nice.  Usually, I find something with so much background to be a bit distracting to the eye, making the eye search the photo for all of the interesting detail.  However, I think that the distance of the treeline, and the softness in the clouds being reflected do not harm the overall sense of quietness in this photo, as they might in other photos of this type.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694409, 372175, 16004, '<td valign="top">appreciate that you wanted to get some motion on the water, but the shot feels overall a tad too bright and overexposed.  this could have been reduced post processing (just by going mad with the burn tool, and maybe the sponge on the greens to bring them out a bit more).  i do think it meets the challenge (feels like elements of a japanese garden) though getting in closer to the rocks and slates might have made it a bit more zenny.  4.</td>', 'appreciate that you wanted to get some motion on the water, but the shot feels overall a tad too bright and overexposed.  this could have been reduced post processing (just by going mad with the burn tool, and maybe the sponge on the greens to bring them out a bit more).  i do think it meets the challenge (feels like elements of a japanese garden) though getting in closer to the rocks and slates might have made it a bit more zenny.  4.', '2006-08-04 04:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694412, 372526, 60379, '<td valign="top">Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!  I went back in and adjusted my vote higher for this after taking a second look.  Started you with a 7, gonna up it to a 9, this really is a gorgeous shot, very lofty and minimal use of color is beautiful.</td>', 'Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!  I went back in and adjusted my vote higher for this after taking a second look.  Started you with a 7, gonna up it to a 9, this really is a gorgeous shot, very lofty and minimal use of color is beautiful.', '2006-08-04 04:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
