(2694432, 372000, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice concept.  You have ascended to zen my child.  Nice background, very soft colors against a harsher foreground.  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...</td>', 'Very nice concept.  You have ascended to zen my child.  Nice background, very soft colors against a harsher foreground.  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...', '2006-08-04 04:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
