(2694436, 372522, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although there have been many entries like this, so far, this is my favorite of them.  The stones are very natural looking, there is interest in the various sizes of the stones and the way they are stacked.  I love the darkness and use of light in this one, which is what sets it above the others of this type.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Although there have been many entries like this, so far, this is my favorite of them.  The stones are very natural looking, there is interest in the various sizes of the stones and the way they are stacked.  I love the darkness and use of light in this one, which is what sets it above the others of this type.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694437, 371593, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is very nice.  Great use of minimal color, and great simple subject.  The subject, although simple, is one of interest.  The only thing that distracts from the quietness, in my opinion, is the amount of shadowing, which is very busy.  Still, I loved it, and it meets the challenge head on.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'This is very nice.  Great use of minimal color, and great simple subject.  The subject, although simple, is one of interest.  The only thing that distracts from the quietness, in my opinion, is the amount of shadowing, which is very busy.  Still, I loved it, and it meets the challenge head on.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694438, 372406, 60379, '<td valign="top">You have been enlightened my child.  Enter nirvana.  And take my ''8'' with ya!  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...</td>', 'You have been enlightened my child.  Enter nirvana.  And take my ''8'' with ya!  Great job from the "Great job Baggie"...', '2006-08-04 04:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
