(2694445, 371711, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The tonal quality of this is very nice, the subject is very simple, and the mood is not interrupted by anything.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very nice.  The tonal quality of this is very nice, the subject is very simple, and the mood is not interrupted by anything.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694446, 372256, 60379, '<td valign="top">I dunno if I''m feeling much zen in this one.  This photo to me, is not still or peaceful, although I love the colors.  There is just too much distraction in the movement in the sky, and the complexity in the barn siding.  I really love the rolling green hill, and the lighting in this, though.  In another challenge, I''d have voted this higher.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'I dunno if I''m feeling much zen in this one.  This photo to me, is not still or peaceful, although I love the colors.  There is just too much distraction in the movement in the sky, and the complexity in the barn siding.  I really love the rolling green hill, and the lighting in this, though.  In another challenge, I''d have voted this higher.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694447, 372045, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very zen.  Very minimal, very quiet.  Gorgeous colors.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very zen.  Very minimal, very quiet.  Gorgeous colors.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694448, 371844, 60379, '<td valign="top">I wanna be there!  Great colors, the woman''s dress and baby''s dress both blend into the background so nicely.  Good choice of colors for the clothes, it really adds to this.  With that being said, I don''t feel alot of zen in this, although the colors are soft (and in my opinion, one of the things that makes this such a nice photo), and in that softness there is zen, I can just hear the ocean surf interrupting that silence.  Anyway, pretty shot tho!  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'I wanna be there!  Great colors, the woman''s dress and baby''s dress both blend into the background so nicely.  Good choice of colors for the clothes, it really adds to this.  With that being said, I don''t feel alot of zen in this, although the colors are soft (and in my opinion, one of the things that makes this such a nice photo), and in that softness there is zen, I can just hear the ocean surf interrupting that silence.  Anyway, pretty shot tho!  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694449, 372172, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very calm atmosphere.  Just a few too many colors that distracts it''s calmness. Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very nice, very calm atmosphere.  Just a few too many colors that distracts it''s calmness. Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
