(2694500, 371587, 60379, '<td valign="top">Although the water in this one is very calm, and the stick is a great subject that does not interrupt the calmness of the water, what I found to be distracting to the overall calmness here were the trees and their reflections.  It just drew the eyes into it too much, distracting from the overall serenity.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Although the water in this one is very calm, and the stick is a great subject that does not interrupt the calmness of the water, what I found to be distracting to the overall calmness here were the trees and their reflections.  It just drew the eyes into it too much, distracting from the overall serenity.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694501, 372500, 60379, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is definately minimal.  And serene.  Just a tad bit too small to keep my interest.  A busy photo makes my eyes work too hard, disrupting the overall attempt at serenity.  Yours, although the opposite, seems to do the same thing, it forces my eye to look for what I''m missing.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Wow, this is definately minimal.  And serene.  Just a tad bit too small to keep my interest.  A busy photo makes my eyes work too hard, disrupting the overall attempt at serenity.  Yours, although the opposite, seems to do the same thing, it forces my eye to look for what I''m missing.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694502, 372222, 60379, '<td valign="top">Nice use of minimal color and tone, very calm.  The only thing distracting from it being totally ''zen'' is the amount of interest in the foreground.  Other than that, it''s very on target.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Nice use of minimal color and tone, very calm.  The only thing distracting from it being totally ''zen'' is the amount of interest in the foreground.  Other than that, it''s very on target.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694504, 370288, 60379, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty photo, I like it alot.  I just find it a bit busier than I''d like to.  I love the reflection in the water, but the business comes from the pattern on the ball, and the pattern that comes through from the pool liner.  One of my favorites, just not so zenny.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'This is a very pretty photo, I like it alot.  I just find it a bit busier than I''d like to.  I love the reflection in the water, but the business comes from the pattern on the ball, and the pattern that comes through from the pool liner.  One of my favorites, just not so zenny.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694506, 372538, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of color and good tonal qualities in this, as well as minimal subject matter.  The individual colors of the grains of sand makes it a bit distracting, but not enough to knock it down in my voting.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very nice use of color and good tonal qualities in this, as well as minimal subject matter.  The individual colors of the grains of sand makes it a bit distracting, but not enough to knock it down in my voting.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694514, 372269, 60379, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this 100% more without the bee.  It is distracting, and it''s movement disrupts the serenity of the photo.  I love the flower and tones of this photo otherwise.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'I would have liked this 100% more without the bee.  It is distracting, and it''s movement disrupts the serenity of the photo.  I love the flower and tones of this photo otherwise.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694523, 372266, 60379, '<td valign="top">Very lovely, she seems at peace.  A very different subject matter from the rest of this challenge, which is refreshing.  As a mother, I see the beauty in this shot.  My original vote wasn''t as high as it should be, so I''m giving you a little boost.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'Very lovely, she seems at peace.  A very different subject matter from the rest of this challenge, which is refreshing.  As a mother, I see the beauty in this shot.  My original vote wasn''t as high as it should be, so I''m giving you a little boost.  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694532, 372151, 60379, '<td valign="top">I love the foreground (water) in this shot, definately the most quiet of the water shots that I''ve seen so far.  And the building is also very nice.  But my eye is drawn to the details of the background trees, too much happening in this photo for it to truly be quiet.  Pretty though!  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!</td>', 'I love the foreground (water) in this shot, definately the most quiet of the water shots that I''ve seen so far.  And the building is also very nice.  But my eye is drawn to the details of the background trees, too much happening in this photo for it to truly be quiet.  Pretty though!  Great job from the ''Great Job Baggie''!', '2006-08-04 04:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694534, 370998, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is so elegant, i really like it.  i love that there is no horizon, that it almost looks like the water is merging with the sky.  my only reservation is that i kind of wish the blues were less cyan, and more blue.  a bit of liberal burning might have reduced this...  otherwise, super, and it''s very tranquil and zen-like.  8.</td>', 'this is so elegant, i really like it.  i love that there is no horizon, that it almost looks like the water is merging with the sky.  my only reservation is that i kind of wish the blues were less cyan, and more blue.  a bit of liberal burning might have reduced this...  otherwise, super, and it''s very tranquil and zen-like.  8.', '2006-08-04 05:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694536, 371955, 16004, '<td valign="top">you''re having a laugh obviously; no one seriously thinks blasting cute furry animals with a big massive gun comes close to even a wild approximation of the concept of zen.  harmony?  technically i feel the picture is a little claustrophobic, and the lighting feels harsh... 3.</td>', 'you''re having a laugh obviously; no one seriously thinks blasting cute furry animals with a big massive gun comes close to even a wild approximation of the concept of zen.  harmony?  technically i feel the picture is a little claustrophobic, and the lighting feels harsh... 3.', '2006-08-04 05:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694548, 370708, 16004, '<td valign="top">there are many elements i love about this; the bold red colours are the first obvious attraction, and then so is the geometry and composition of the shot.  it does feel a bit zen to me too; the slightly oriental feel is apparent (maybe it''s the communist red and the abstractedness of lines?).  i can''t decide if the biord actually improves or detracts from the shot, though.  still, a grand picture. 9.</td>', 'there are many elements i love about this; the bold red colours are the first obvious attraction, and then so is the geometry and composition of the shot.  it does feel a bit zen to me too; the slightly oriental feel is apparent (maybe it''s the communist red and the abstractedness of lines?).  i can''t decide if the biord actually improves or detracts from the shot, though.  still, a grand picture. 9.', '2006-08-04 05:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694574, 370772, 37430, '<td valign="top">A really "Insignificant" subject and a wonderful background makes of a great Zen photo. I like everything about this photo but for the title. The man does not seem to meditating. This picture is perfect example of Zen "style" of art and it did not needed any title to communicate this. I feel a little more of saturation of subject''s cloths and using more appropriate title would make this even better. Goodluck.8.</td>', 'A really "Insignificant" subject and a wonderful background makes of a great Zen photo. I like everything about this photo but for the title. The man does not seem to meditating. This picture is perfect example of Zen "style" of art and it did not needed any title to communicate this. I feel a little more of saturation of subject''s cloths and using more appropriate title would make this even better. Goodluck.8.', '2006-08-04 06:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694576, 372505, 37430, '<td valign="top">Simple and Zen. I really like the heart shaped petal. Hope this does well for you.7.</td>', 'Simple and Zen. I really like the heart shaped petal. Hope this does well for you.7.', '2006-08-04 06:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694577, 371110, 37430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The presence of subject actually highlights the enormity of the environment. The title is apt. Hope this does well for you.8.</td>', 'Beautiful. The presence of subject actually highlights the enormity of the environment. The title is apt. Hope this does well for you.8.', '2006-08-04 06:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694583, 372106, 58029, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lighting, highlighting the central subject. I liked this one</td>', 'Nice use of lighting, highlighting the central subject. I liked this one', '2006-08-04 06:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694584, 371714, 58029, '<td valign="top">Simple, but good use of contrasting colors</td>', 'Simple, but good use of contrasting colors', '2006-08-04 06:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694585, 372309, 58029, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Nicely done!</td>', 'Very cool. Nicely done!', '2006-08-04 06:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694586, 369705, 58029, '<td valign="top">Colors are a bir washed out, but a nice photo anyway</td>', 'Colors are a bir washed out, but a nice photo anyway', '2006-08-04 06:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694587, 370375, 58029, '<td valign="top">LOvely photo, very nicely done</td>', 'LOvely photo, very nicely done', '2006-08-04 06:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694589, 372548, 58029, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, effective use of color and light</td>', 'Very nice capture, effective use of color and light', '2006-08-04 06:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694599, 370997, 16004, '<td valign="top">this has serenity coming out of its ears.  it''s very gorgeous and lovely.  i love the deep blues, the calmness of the water, and the hazy blurry background.  there is a slight halo effect around the back and the neck of the swan which is a bit off putting, but that aside a stunning piece of visual art.  though, from the ripple in the water it looks like he is reversing....  still, great, moody, tranquil, very zenny.  9.</td>', 'this has serenity coming out of its ears.  it''s very gorgeous and lovely.  i love the deep blues, the calmness of the water, and the hazy blurry background.  there is a slight halo effect around the back and the neck of the swan which is a bit off putting, but that aside a stunning piece of visual art.  though, from the ripple in the water it looks like he is reversing....  still, great, moody, tranquil, very zenny.  9.', '2006-08-04 07:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694600, 372285, 16004, '<td valign="top">this has been taken from a very good viewpoint.  composition is great.  the greens on most of the trees is visually appealing, though there are some (well, three) odd not quite green greyish patches which look smokey.  a slight burn or sponge might have got rid of those.  i like how it looks there''s a haze over the water.  very pretty - 8</td>', 'this has been taken from a very good viewpoint.  composition is great.  the greens on most of the trees is visually appealing, though there are some (well, three) odd not quite green greyish patches which look smokey.  a slight burn or sponge might have got rid of those.  i like how it looks there''s a haze over the water.  very pretty - 8', '2006-08-04 07:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694608, 372063, 48228, '<td valign="top">"WOW"..... I love this, as the colors are just so clear and sharp.<br/>What a beautiful butterfly, so still, and so perfect, in every way.....<br/>A balance of nature at ir very best and suits the challenge so well.....</td>', '"WOW"..... I love this, as the colors are just so clear and sharp.What a beautiful butterfly, so still, and so perfect, in every way.....A balance of nature at ir very best and suits the challenge so well.....', '2006-08-04 07:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694609, 371695, 48228, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the light/white shades of color are very similar, and feel a little lost and washed out, against the darker shades...</td>', 'The contrast of the light/white shades of color are very similar, and feel a little lost and washed out, against the darker shades...', '2006-08-04 07:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694630, 372500, 58330, '<td valign="top">I enjoy your sense of humour, but this might be too minimalistic for most.</td>', 'I enjoy your sense of humour, but this might be too minimalistic for most.', '2006-08-04 08:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694631, 372550, 58330, '<td valign="top">Beautifully pure</td>', 'Beautifully pure', '2006-08-04 08:12:25.000000', NULL, 1);
