(2694638, 371303, 58330, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity</td>', 'I like the simplicity', '2006-08-04 08:17:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694680, 371942, 48228, '<td valign="top">The color seems to be a little to strong for "Zen"...</td>', 'The color seems to be a little to strong for "Zen"...', '2006-08-04 08:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694683, 371469, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is so peaceful, so serene and so "Zen"... Well done, and I like this very much.....</td>', 'This is so peaceful, so serene and so "Zen"... Well done, and I like this very much.....', '2006-08-04 09:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694684, 370909, 16004, '<td valign="top">very lovely infrared shot...  i love the reflections in and smoothness of the water, and the bridge looks great.  the tower block is a bit of an eyesore, but it doesn''t detract from the impact overtly.  there does also appear to be a highish level of noise in the blues, but overall it''s a nice effectively done example of IR photography.  and a bit zen-ish too.  7.</td>', 'very lovely infrared shot...  i love the reflections in and smoothness of the water, and the bridge looks great.  the tower block is a bit of an eyesore, but it doesn''t detract from the impact overtly.  there does also appear to be a highish level of noise in the blues, but overall it''s a nice effectively done example of IR photography.  and a bit zen-ish too.  7.', '2006-08-04 09:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694686, 369317, 48228, '<td valign="top">I quietness is very evident in this image...<br/>I really like the background with the green colortones...</td>', 'I quietness is very evident in this image...I really like the background with the green colortones...', '2006-08-04 09:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694687, 371367, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed..... The sharpness and contrast are really good.....</td>', 'Very nice indeed..... The sharpness and contrast are really good.....', '2006-08-04 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694688, 372322, 48228, '<td valign="top">The composition works so well here, well done...</td>', 'The composition works so well here, well done...', '2006-08-04 09:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694689, 372391, 48228, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is "Zen" and done really well.....</td>', 'Yes, this is "Zen" and done really well.....', '2006-08-04 09:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694690, 372479, 48228, '<td valign="top">What a clever shot, and you were in the right place at the right time.....</td>', 'What a clever shot, and you were in the right place at the right time.....', '2006-08-04 09:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694693, 371618, 48228, '<td valign="top">Vert tranquil and "zen", thats for sure.....</td>', 'Vert tranquil and "zen", thats for sure.....', '2006-08-04 09:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694695, 372168, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a marvellously evocative picture.  it''s only significant problem worth noting is that to me, it doesn''t really fit in with my preconceived idea of what zen is.  but as a photo, i love it.  the B&amp;W is great, the high contrast and dark mood genius, brilliantly countered by the light breaking through the clouds.  the vanishing point and angle of shot works very well.  and the solitary vehicle coming towards us is the proverbial cherry.  smashing stuff (if bordering on not quite suiting the challenge) 8.</td>', 'this is a marvellously evocative picture.  it''s only significant problem worth noting is that to me, it doesn''t really fit in with my preconceived idea of what zen is.  but as a photo, i love it.  the B&W is great, the high contrast and dark mood genius, brilliantly countered by the light breaking through the clouds.  the vanishing point and angle of shot works very well.  and the solitary vehicle coming towards us is the proverbial cherry.  smashing stuff (if bordering on not quite suiting the challenge) 8.', '2006-08-04 09:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694696, 371797, 48228, '<td valign="top">Composition suits this image well.....</td>', 'Composition suits this image well.....', '2006-08-04 09:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694698, 371974, 48228, '<td valign="top">Delicate and also pretty. I like this, as it is just so simple...</td>', 'Delicate and also pretty. I like this, as it is just so simple...', '2006-08-04 09:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694700, 372478, 48228, '<td valign="top">Now this is very "Zen", in every way.....</td>', 'Now this is very "Zen", in every way.....', '2006-08-04 09:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694704, 372551, 48228, '<td valign="top">Clever idea here, but would have like to see you use the rule of thirds, re the top and the bottom, which is so much stronger, and a little overpowering..... A little more of the top section, would nave given this more balance.</td>', 'Clever idea here, but would have like to see you use the rule of thirds, re the top and the bottom, which is so much stronger, and a little overpowering..... A little more of the top section, would nave given this more balance.', '2006-08-04 09:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694705, 372126, 48228, '<td valign="top">Very "Zen" and just about perfect.....</td>', 'Very "Zen" and just about perfect.....', '2006-08-04 09:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694707, 372037, 48228, '<td valign="top">Nice idea here, but just lacks something, and not sure what.</td>', 'Nice idea here, but just lacks something, and not sure what.', '2006-08-04 09:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694711, 370408, 48228, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t give me the sence of peace, that I would like re the "Zen challenge. I think it may be just a tad to busy...</td>', 'This doesn''t give me the sence of peace, that I would like re the "Zen challenge. I think it may be just a tad to busy...', '2006-08-04 09:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
