(2694760, 372013, 58330, '<td valign="top">I like the scene and would have scored it higher if you did not have the various bits of debris on the water.</td>', 'I like the scene and would have scored it higher if you did not have the various bits of debris on the water.', '2006-08-04 09:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694765, 371844, 16004, '<td valign="top">the lighting and colours in this is really lovely.  it feels contemplative, but happy; there is a peaceful joy here which i think is a lovely intepretation of zen.  it also feels so completely professional; a choice shot for any tourist agent.  superb - 10.</td>', 'the lighting and colours in this is really lovely.  it feels contemplative, but happy; there is a peaceful joy here which i think is a lovely intepretation of zen.  it also feels so completely professional; a choice shot for any tourist agent.  superb - 10.', '2006-08-04 09:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694773, 371535, 16004, '<td valign="top">it''s nice, but the number of people kind of ruins the harmonious qualities of being pushes around in a gondola.  also the shadow on half the bridge is a little unfortunate, though the picture is nicely sharp with clear details on the parapet.  it''s not an unattractive picture, and it has plenty of bits to keep the viewer interested, but it just doesn''t have that wow factor. 6.</td>', 'it''s nice, but the number of people kind of ruins the harmonious qualities of being pushes around in a gondola.  also the shadow on half the bridge is a little unfortunate, though the picture is nicely sharp with clear details on the parapet.  it''s not an unattractive picture, and it has plenty of bits to keep the viewer interested, but it just doesn''t have that wow factor. 6.', '2006-08-04 09:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694799, 370948, 16004, '<td valign="top">i love the building, and i love the overall feel of this image.  my only wish is that the rocking horse wasn''t in it as it''s tips it into the category of being a tad too cluttered.  I think the slightly discoloured aspect of the ground, the greenery and the pale slide works tremendously well.  only other slight thing is that the horizon looks a bit wonky.  other than that, very nice.  8.</td>', 'i love the building, and i love the overall feel of this image.  my only wish is that the rocking horse wasn''t in it as it''s tips it into the category of being a tad too cluttered.  I think the slightly discoloured aspect of the ground, the greenery and the pale slide works tremendously well.  only other slight thing is that the horizon looks a bit wonky.  other than that, very nice.  8.', '2006-08-04 09:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694804, 370409, 16004, '<td valign="top">superb, beautiful, gorgeous, lovely. stunning.  not sure if it is very zen (have to dock a point for that), but i do like this a lot.  the sky!  it''s wonderful.  9.</td>', 'superb, beautiful, gorgeous, lovely. stunning.  not sure if it is very zen (have to dock a point for that), but i do like this a lot.  the sky!  it''s wonderful.  9.', '2006-08-04 09:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694822, 372256, 16004, '<td valign="top">first the meeting challenge bit; apart from the title there really isn''t very much that conveys a sense of zen.  harmony was one word i think used in the description, and a near derelict tin shed in the middle of a field doesn''t really give that impression.  HOWEVER, it''s a great picture still - the sky has a great sense of foreboding drama (which also isn''t very zen), the greens nicely oversaturated to great effect, and the shed itself been treated well (albeit seems a little on the excessively noisy side). really good stuff, though 7.</td>', 'first the meeting challenge bit; apart from the title there really isn''t very much that conveys a sense of zen.  harmony was one word i think used in the description, and a near derelict tin shed in the middle of a field doesn''t really give that impression.  HOWEVER, it''s a great picture still - the sky has a great sense of foreboding drama (which also isn''t very zen), the greens nicely oversaturated to great effect, and the shed itself been treated well (albeit seems a little on the excessively noisy side). really good stuff, though 7.', '2006-08-04 10:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694865, 371505, 31443, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, love this setup..</td>', 'Very sweet, love this setup..', '2006-08-04 10:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2694923, 370998, 15358, '<td valign="top">a lovely image, a bit too blue perhaps</td>', 'a lovely image, a bit too blue perhaps', '2006-08-04 10:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
