(2695007, 369967, 37252, '<td valign="top">I had no idea this was really Tony Curtis! I had thought perhaps this was a hot by Sherpet as it resembled a man in one of her other shots.<br/> <br/>I like the colors and composition - but it really doesn''t say zen to me.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-08-07 08:58:43.</i></td>', 'I had no idea this was really Tony Curtis! I had thought perhaps this was a hot by Sherpet as it resembled a man in one of her other shots. I like the colors and composition - but it really doesn''t say zen to me.', '2006-08-04 11:25:10.000000', '2006-08-07 09:58:43.000000', 1),
