(2695825, 372007, 42495, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on the lighting and color - it''s relaxing.  The flower looks a bit rotated to the right.  I''m not sure if it was done on purpose or not, but I would have preferred it to be straight.</td>', 'Excellent job on the lighting and color - it''s relaxing.  The flower looks a bit rotated to the right.  I''m not sure if it was done on purpose or not, but I would have preferred it to be straight.', '2006-08-04 17:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
