(2695839, 372489, 24454, '<td valign="top">I like this!  It''s simple, but the glow seems to pop off the page.  From what I know about zen (very little). . .yes. . .it does in fact seem zenlike :)</td>', 'I like this!  It''s simple, but the glow seems to pop off the page.  From what I know about zen (very little). . .yes. . .it does in fact seem zenlike :)', '2006-08-04 17:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
