(2696350, 372155, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully seen and captured!</td>', 'Wonderfully seen and captured!', '2006-08-04 22:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696367, 371533, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good idea for the challenge when combined with the title; like the background a lot, focus is excellent.  The dead petal, though, is pretty much unrecognizable as a petal.  I think it would be nice with just the single red rose petal against your background.</td>', 'A good idea for the challenge when combined with the title; like the background a lot, focus is excellent.  The dead petal, though, is pretty much unrecognizable as a petal.  I think it would be nice with just the single red rose petal against your background.', '2006-08-04 22:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696370, 372052, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good focus on the feather and like the placement in the frame.  Not thrilled with the foreground fabric, though.  I think the texture detracts for me.</td>', 'Good focus on the feather and like the placement in the frame.  Not thrilled with the foreground fabric, though.  I think the texture detracts for me.', '2006-08-04 22:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696374, 370184, 30982, '<td valign="top">A well captured scene and I like the desat.  Doesn''t whisper zen to me, and I''m not sure about the border treatment.  I do, however, like the weeds.</td>', 'A well captured scene and I like the desat.  Doesn''t whisper zen to me, and I''m not sure about the border treatment.  I do, however, like the weeds.', '2006-08-04 22:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696376, 371469, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely exposed.  There''s a shadow of something on the right side that keeps drawing my eye away.  For composition, I think I''d have preferred the feather a bit less on the centerline horizontally.</td>', 'Nicely exposed.  There''s a shadow of something on the right side that keeps drawing my eye away.  For composition, I think I''d have preferred the feather a bit less on the centerline horizontally.', '2006-08-04 22:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696378, 370167, 30982, '<td valign="top">She looks very calm and peaceful.  The colors of the trees and water seem just a bit off to me.</td>', 'She looks very calm and peaceful.  The colors of the trees and water seem just a bit off to me.', '2006-08-04 22:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696383, 371273, 30982, '<td valign="top">To me, this is too busy for "zen", though I do understand zen can be a personal thing.</td>', 'To me, this is too busy for "zen", though I do understand zen can be a personal thing.', '2006-08-04 22:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696386, 371960, 30982, '<td valign="top">In a way, it''s interesting that the horizon disappears, but it also bothers me for some reason.  The ice flow looks like it''s sloping off to the left a little.</td>', 'In a way, it''s interesting that the horizon disappears, but it also bothers me for some reason.  The ice flow looks like it''s sloping off to the left a little.', '2006-08-04 22:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696387, 372168, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting interpretation of zen but a bit busy for "zen" to me.</td>', 'An interesting interpretation of zen but a bit busy for "zen" to me.', '2006-08-04 22:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696391, 372417, 30982, '<td valign="top">A quiet, peaceful place, but a bit bland as a picture.  I wonder if a closer shot of the bench/swing and the dark shadows to the right of it might have worked a bit better.</td>', 'A quiet, peaceful place, but a bit bland as a picture.  I wonder if a closer shot of the bench/swing and the dark shadows to the right of it might have worked a bit better.', '2006-08-04 22:43:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696393, 372500, 30982, '<td valign="top">Calm, yes, but unremarkable to me as a photograph - a bit too much empty space.</td>', 'Calm, yes, but unremarkable to me as a photograph - a bit too much empty space.', '2006-08-04 22:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696394, 370408, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like what you''re depicting here and how you''ve isolated her, but the person on the left foreground keeps drawing my eye.  As a photograph, it''s a bit busy to elicit a "zen" response.</td>', 'I like what you''re depicting here and how you''ve isolated her, but the person on the left foreground keeps drawing my eye.  As a photograph, it''s a bit busy to elicit a "zen" response.', '2006-08-04 22:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696398, 372226, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good depiction of relaxation, but not a particularly "zen" photograph to me.</td>', 'A good depiction of relaxation, but not a particularly "zen" photograph to me.', '2006-08-04 22:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696401, 371278, 30982, '<td valign="top">The focal point of your picture, if it is the gentleman, gets a bit lost here.  This may, of course, be exactly what you were aiming for.  But to me, it''s not conducive of depicting "zen".</td>', 'The focal point of your picture, if it is the gentleman, gets a bit lost here.  This may, of course, be exactly what you were aiming for.  But to me, it''s not conducive of depicting "zen".', '2006-08-04 22:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696403, 371714, 30982, '<td valign="top">The composition here is very good and I like the contrasts of the greens and the red.  The foreground green, however, appears a bit overexposed/too bright.</td>', 'The composition here is very good and I like the contrasts of the greens and the red.  The foreground green, however, appears a bit overexposed/too bright.', '2006-08-04 22:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696406, 371266, 30982, '<td valign="top">I suspect you were going for simplicity, but this feels busy to me.  The plant/flower almost looks out of place from it''s background, like the light is wrong somehow.  That''s just my perception.</td>', 'I suspect you were going for simplicity, but this feels busy to me.  The plant/flower almost looks out of place from it''s background, like the light is wrong somehow.  That''s just my perception.', '2006-08-04 22:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696407, 372447, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple and calm, but a bit off as far as color to me with the dull gray background.</td>', 'Simple and calm, but a bit off as far as color to me with the dull gray background.', '2006-08-04 22:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696408, 372479, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very minimalistic and works well in that respect.  Have to admit that though it was probably done to compliment the starkness of the photograph, I don''t like the border - to me it detracts from the subject.</td>', 'Very minimalistic and works well in that respect.  Have to admit that though it was probably done to compliment the starkness of the photograph, I don''t like the border - to me it detracts from the subject.', '2006-08-04 22:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696418, 369795, 30982, '<td valign="top">Simple, elegant composition.  It''s a bit bright for me - I''d like to see the grasses just a bit richer.</td>', 'Simple, elegant composition.  It''s a bit bright for me - I''d like to see the grasses just a bit richer.', '2006-08-04 22:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696419, 371069, 30982, '<td valign="top">The cool tones are very nice, but I don''t care for the vignetting - sort of closes down the picture which takes away from it''s "zen".</td>', 'The cool tones are very nice, but I don''t care for the vignetting - sort of closes down the picture which takes away from it''s "zen".', '2006-08-04 23:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696422, 372311, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit soft and the composition doesn''t seem balanced to me, though I can''t offer an idea of how else to compose it.</td>', 'A bit soft and the composition doesn''t seem balanced to me, though I can''t offer an idea of how else to compose it.', '2006-08-04 23:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696423, 371663, 58452, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Wish the high contrast rectangle could have been toned down some.</td>', 'Very nice.  Wish the high contrast rectangle could have been toned down some.', '2006-08-04 23:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696424, 372118, 30982, '<td valign="top">A peaceful view but in my opinion the dark heavy border detracts from that.</td>', 'A peaceful view but in my opinion the dark heavy border detracts from that.', '2006-08-04 23:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696425, 369988, 30982, '<td valign="top">The colors and the tree are very nice, but the white blobs on the horizon on the right of the picture cause a disturbance in the zen.</td>', 'The colors and the tree are very nice, but the white blobs on the horizon on the right of the picture cause a disturbance in the zen.', '2006-08-04 23:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696426, 372037, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the dead bush thing and the flowers leading up to it.  The sky appears kinda blotchy - not sure if this might have worked better in either pure B&amp;W or color.</td>', 'I like the dead bush thing and the flowers leading up to it.  The sky appears kinda blotchy - not sure if this might have worked better in either pure B&W or color.', '2006-08-04 23:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696427, 372536, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice catch - she seems to be quite content to let you take her picture.  As a "zen" picture, it''s a bit busy, and the first thing that grabs my eye is the green plant in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice catch - she seems to be quite content to let you take her picture.  As a "zen" picture, it''s a bit busy, and the first thing that grabs my eye is the green plant in the foreground.', '2006-08-04 23:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696428, 372023, 58452, '<td valign="top">Wonder if the bouy was cloned......<br/>Peaceful.</td>', 'Wonder if the bouy was cloned......Peaceful.', '2006-08-04 23:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
