(2696433, 372144, 58452, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and background.</td>', 'Lovely composition and background.', '2006-08-04 23:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696435, 371464, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the colorful background.  The bird isn''t quite sharp - possibly camera movement? - and the top part of his beak is overexposed and blends in with the background.</td>', 'I like the composition and the colorful background.  The bird isn''t quite sharp - possibly camera movement? - and the top part of his beak is overexposed and blends in with the background.', '2006-08-04 23:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696436, 371618, 30982, '<td valign="top">Though it does appear to be a peaceful setting, the composition doesn''t speak of zen to me.  The rock in the center seems to be the focal point and it doesn''t hold much appeal.  A shot focused more on the little statue to the right and it''s reflection might be a better choice.</td>', 'Though it does appear to be a peaceful setting, the composition doesn''t speak of zen to me.  The rock in the center seems to be the focal point and it doesn''t hold much appeal.  A shot focused more on the little statue to the right and it''s reflection might be a better choice.', '2006-08-04 23:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696437, 370995, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.  I love the opposition between the boat and the moon.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.  I love the opposition between the boat and the moon.', '2006-08-04 23:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696439, 372399, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the top half of the picture quite well - very good exposure on her hair and just the peek of the eyelash and nose.  Below that, though, I don''t like the change in tone/texture/color of her skin and the lip ring (?) looks like she has a split lip, probably due to the reflection.</td>', 'I like the top half of the picture quite well - very good exposure on her hair and just the peek of the eyelash and nose.  Below that, though, I don''t like the change in tone/texture/color of her skin and the lip ring (?) looks like she has a split lip, probably due to the reflection.', '2006-08-04 23:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696446, 372219, 58452, '<td valign="top">Maybe drift the center of the background plant down and to the left a little.  Very nice.</td>', 'Maybe drift the center of the background plant down and to the left a little.  Very nice.', '2006-08-04 23:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
