(2696513, 371797, 30982, '<td valign="top">The long horizontal sizing works for this image, but it does appear a bit tilted and a bit soft.  Colors are soothing.</td>', 'The long horizontal sizing works for this image, but it does appear a bit tilted and a bit soft.  Colors are soothing.', '2006-08-05 00:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
