(2696545, 372423, 30982, '<td valign="top">Does look peaceful.  Follows the rule of thirds pretty well but isn''t particularly engaging.  This may be an instance where breaking the rules would create more interest - limit the foreground to just a small bit of the rock, give her more room to the left and the top (if there''s more to be had in either direction.)</td>', 'Does look peaceful.  Follows the rule of thirds pretty well but isn''t particularly engaging.  This may be an instance where breaking the rules would create more interest - limit the foreground to just a small bit of the rock, give her more room to the left and the top (if there''s more to be had in either direction.)', '2006-08-05 00:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2696549, 371625, 30982, '<td valign="top">A bit too crowded to the left for my taste.  The lighting is nice but the dark to the right starts to draw the attention.</td>', 'A bit too crowded to the left for my taste.  The lighting is nice but the dark to the right starts to draw the attention.', '2006-08-05 00:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
