(2697298, 371097, 48890, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  The warm colours and the shadows speak of the golden hour, during which this shot, was, without a doubt, photographed.  The lonely tree on the left is balanced by the long shadow, that leads the eye out of the frame.  For a more minimalistic feel, I would also have tried to compose this shot without the sky in it at all: just the tree against the yellow field.  An off-topic thought: without the tree this photograph makes a Ukrainian flag. :)</td>', 'Lovely shot.  The warm colours and the shadows speak of the golden hour, during which this shot, was, without a doubt, photographed.  The lonely tree on the left is balanced by the long shadow, that leads the eye out of the frame.  For a more minimalistic feel, I would also have tried to compose this shot without the sky in it at all: just the tree against the yellow field.  An off-topic thought: without the tree this photograph makes a Ukrainian flag. :)', '2006-08-05 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
