(2697639, 372532, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like that the one ankle is wrapped. It shows how balance can lift a person above the pain. The blue mat makes it look like he is on a tightrope but when I look at his foot, it''s not on one of the lines. Sort of disorienting, good thing the white line is there to ground everything.</td>', 'I like that the one ankle is wrapped. It shows how balance can lift a person above the pain. The blue mat makes it look like he is on a tightrope but when I look at his foot, it''s not on one of the lines. Sort of disorienting, good thing the white line is there to ground everything.', '2006-08-05 18:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697643, 372410, 11800, '<td valign="top">good portrait. I don''t get a feeling like what is mentioned in the title. Looks like he is intensly concentrating on something that is out of view.</td>', 'good portrait. I don''t get a feeling like what is mentioned in the title. Looks like he is intensly concentrating on something that is out of view.', '2006-08-05 18:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697654, 372026, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the pp somewhat. The blue and white make a good statement about enlightment. Most times I like the original photo more than a negative. gl <br/>After looking a both, I like this one better.</td>', 'I like the pp somewhat. The blue and white make a good statement about enlightment. Most times I like the original photo more than a negative. gl After looking a both, I like this one better.', '2006-08-05 18:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697685, 372106, 11800, '<td valign="top">First impression. Serene, perfect dof and good composition even though I''d like the tree more in the lower right quadrant.<br/>Thoughts: Then I looked at the title and, forgive me, busted out laughing. I don''t use spelling when deciding a score. Are gentile waters different from heathen waters or buddist waters? The name of the challenge as opposed to the word in the title just creates such a vivid picture in my mind!</td>', 'First impression. Serene, perfect dof and good composition even though I''d like the tree more in the lower right quadrant.Thoughts: Then I looked at the title and, forgive me, busted out laughing. I don''t use spelling when deciding a score. Are gentile waters different from heathen waters or buddist waters? The name of the challenge as opposed to the word in the title just creates such a vivid picture in my mind!', '2006-08-05 18:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2697688, 372049, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like the overexposure. Works well in this picture.</td>', 'I like the overexposure. Works well in this picture.', '2006-08-05 18:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
