(2698573, 369385, 36141, '<td valign="top">I like the ''ingredients'' you used, but not too much the way you''ve arranged them. The stones, beautiful as they are individually, would''ve been the focuspoint if they had been put together in one of the three dark spaces. Now they''re somewhat shattered all over and my eye has to hop from one to the other.<br/>Hope I make sense, because English is not my native language and sometimes it''s hard to explain exactly what I have in mind. 5.</td>', 'I like the ''ingredients'' you used, but not too much the way you''ve arranged them. The stones, beautiful as they are individually, would''ve been the focuspoint if they had been put together in one of the three dark spaces. Now they''re somewhat shattered all over and my eye has to hop from one to the other.Hope I make sense, because English is not my native language and sometimes it''s hard to explain exactly what I have in mind. 5.', '2006-08-06 02:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
