(2699376, 372389, 47816, '<td valign="top">This is good, but the background it distracting because even though it is out of focus, you can still see what it is.  For macro, set up the shot and the lens to blur the background completely or keep it all in focus.  This would have been a 9 with all grass in the background slowly going out of focus.</td>', 'This is good, but the background it distracting because even though it is out of focus, you can still see what it is.  For macro, set up the shot and the lens to blur the background completely or keep it all in focus.  This would have been a 9 with all grass in the background slowly going out of focus.', '2006-08-06 13:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
