(2699854, 372497, 26633, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and an excellent composition. Only the noise lets it down for me. It''s still an 8.</td>', 'Beautiful light and an excellent composition. Only the noise lets it down for me. It''s still an 8.', '2006-08-06 18:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699857, 371438, 26633, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, very nicely executed.</td>', 'Clever idea, very nicely executed.', '2006-08-06 18:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699859, 371899, 26633, '<td valign="top">That is a scene I would have troble tearing myself away from....so thank you for showing it!</td>', 'That is a scene I would have troble tearing myself away from....so thank you for showing it!', '2006-08-06 18:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699860, 371565, 26633, '<td valign="top">The subtle toning works so well with this simple scene. I could almost believe this is film ;)</td>', 'The subtle toning works so well with this simple scene. I could almost believe this is film ;)', '2006-08-06 18:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699865, 370138, 26633, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous, Cornwall never looks like that when I visit. It''s still an 8 though ;)<br/> <br/>I like the subtlety of the light on the water and the beach as it contrasts with the blue of the sky.</td>', 'I''m jealous, Cornwall never looks like that when I visit. It''s still an 8 though ;) I like the subtlety of the light on the water and the beach as it contrasts with the blue of the sky.', '2006-08-06 18:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699867, 369777, 26633, '<td valign="top">A classic form and so very well handled. The strong but not impenetrable shadow, the hard-ish light revealing the texture of the wood and the softness of the water/mud all hold together to make this an excellent composition.</td>', 'A classic form and so very well handled. The strong but not impenetrable shadow, the hard-ish light revealing the texture of the wood and the softness of the water/mud all hold together to make this an excellent composition.', '2006-08-06 18:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699876, 371973, 47816, '<td valign="top">I like the flow and colors...the sky is perfect</td>', 'I like the flow and colors...the sky is perfect', '2006-08-06 18:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699880, 372508, 47816, '<td valign="top">I like the negative feel...the stem at the bottom is a bit distracting.  Perhaps better lit up or completed eliminated?</td>', 'I like the negative feel...the stem at the bottom is a bit distracting.  Perhaps better lit up or completed eliminated?', '2006-08-06 18:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699881, 372322, 47816, '<td valign="top">Very cool, I like it!</td>', 'Very cool, I like it!', '2006-08-06 18:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699892, 372057, 40570, '<td valign="top">Nice lines..excellent close up!</td>', 'Nice lines..excellent close up!', '2006-08-06 19:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699898, 372099, 63466, '<td valign="top">almost human...  This must have been one lucky find.  Its eery and odly contemplative.  It would be intiresting to see what this looked like at different angels.</td>', 'almost human...  This must have been one lucky find.  Its eery and odly contemplative.  It would be intiresting to see what this looked like at different angels.', '2006-08-06 19:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2699901, 370909, 63466, '<td valign="top">this is gorgious!!!!!  I love the colour and depth, how the river leads your eye.  I have the immediate fantasy of clomping over the bridge in a horse drawn carrage with a big fir coat on and the top down.</td>', 'this is gorgious!!!!!  I love the colour and depth, how the river leads your eye.  I have the immediate fantasy of clomping over the bridge in a horse drawn carrage with a big fir coat on and the top down.', '2006-08-06 19:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
