(2700929, 370997, 53147, '<td valign="top">Just a quick glimpse through the thumbnails and this one sticks out strong. I love everything about this shot - lighting, reflection, colors, the mist and ripples. Very strong image that suits this challenge just fine. Giving an 8 right now - will be back to bump later. Oh and what the heck - you get a fav right off the bat as well. Very nice work. Back to bump up - but I might be back one more time.<br/> <br/>Last minute bump - you get my ten for the challenge!</td>', 'Just a quick glimpse through the thumbnails and this one sticks out strong. I love everything about this shot - lighting, reflection, colors, the mist and ripples. Very strong image that suits this challenge just fine. Giving an 8 right now - will be back to bump later. Oh and what the heck - you get a fav right off the bat as well. Very nice work. Back to bump up - but I might be back one more time. Last minute bump - you get my ten for the challenge!', '2006-08-07 00:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700931, 372399, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and nice color tones. For some reason the ring is a distraction. I think I would have preferred her lips free of jewelry. Not that I am against piercings (I have several myself) just think it would have been a bit cleaner. Nice work though and bumping up one.</td>', 'Nice shot and nice color tones. For some reason the ring is a distraction. I think I would have preferred her lips free of jewelry. Not that I am against piercings (I have several myself) just think it would have been a bit cleaner. Nice work though and bumping up one.', '2006-08-07 00:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700933, 372034, 53147, '<td valign="top">Easily best of the IR shots in this challenge. The colors are  awesome! Bringing in browns and yellows to the house is brilliant and the soft glow to the whole picture just works really well. Giving you an 8 right now but I plan on coming back to bump. Great work! Last minute bump - I am giving you a 9!</td>', 'Easily best of the IR shots in this challenge. The colors are  awesome! Bringing in browns and yellows to the house is brilliant and the soft glow to the whole picture just works really well. Giving you an 8 right now but I plan on coming back to bump. Great work! Last minute bump - I am giving you a 9!', '2006-08-07 00:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700935, 370998, 53147, '<td valign="top">Very very nice. Great reflection and the blue tones are brilliant and different from what would be expected from the sky. Tweaked enough to be impressive but not enough to seem artificial. Great work and bumping up. Last minute bump. I am giving you a 9!</td>', 'Very very nice. Great reflection and the blue tones are brilliant and different from what would be expected from the sky. Tweaked enough to be impressive but not enough to seem artificial. Great work and bumping up. Last minute bump. I am giving you a 9!', '2006-08-07 00:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700936, 372274, 53147, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Nice transition of colors and the softness works well. Bumping up.</td>', 'Great shot. Nice transition of colors and the softness works well. Bumping up.', '2006-08-07 00:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700939, 369777, 29011, '<td valign="top">Super. This works great in a toned version. Good lighting and contrast. Captures those textures quite nicely.</td>', 'Super. This works great in a toned version. Good lighting and contrast. Captures those textures quite nicely.', '2006-08-07 00:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700945, 372057, 53147, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Excellent composition and his placement is perfect. Well done and bumpin gup.<br/> <br/>Last minute bump. I am going to give you a nine and add this to my favorites. Great shot!</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Excellent composition and his placement is perfect. Well done and bumpin gup. Last minute bump. I am going to give you a nine and add this to my favorites. Great shot!', '2006-08-07 00:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2700948, 372217, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is a fave for sure. Great work with the composition and exposure. The colors look awesome, were they very much close to the real thing or were filters being used and/or adjusted much in post processing? eta: edited for spelling ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-12-21 12:37:26.</i></td>', 'This is a fave for sure. Great work with the composition and exposure. The colors look awesome, were they very much close to the real thing or were filters being used and/or adjusted much in post processing? eta: edited for spelling ;)', '2006-08-07 00:58:35.000000', '2014-12-21 12:37:26.000000', 1),
(2700952, 372522, 29011, '<td valign="top">Great job with the composition and lighting. The textures work great here. This should do very well. Good luck :)</td>', 'Great job with the composition and lighting. The textures work great here. This should do very well. Good luck :)', '2006-08-07 00:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
