(2702526, 371870, 25678, '<td valign="top">This is one of those pictures that shuold have done better than it did.  As beautiful and simple as it is, it''s lacking the DPC ''look.''  The contrasting textures appeal to me in this picture.  The roughness of the background, the smoothness of the petal, and the delicate sense that water drops give.  Well done shot!</td>', 'This is one of those pictures that shuold have done better than it did.  As beautiful and simple as it is, it''s lacking the DPC ''look.''  The contrasting textures appeal to me in this picture.  The roughness of the background, the smoothness of the petal, and the delicate sense that water drops give.  Well done shot!', '2006-08-07 11:51:10.000000', NULL, 0),
