(2702611, 372103, 53147, '<td valign="top">I really expected this one to place much higher than it did. I saw your score in the thread and was surprised in challenge as I knew which was yours. Your outtake is excellent as well but the hand placement in your entry has the overall better feel. Very nice work and I believe the most underrated of the challenge.</td>', 'I really expected this one to place much higher than it did. I saw your score in the thread and was surprised in challenge as I knew which was yours. Your outtake is excellent as well but the hand placement in your entry has the overall better feel. Very nice work and I believe the most underrated of the challenge.', '2006-08-07 12:23:45.000000', NULL, 0),
