(2702961, 371367, 14603, '<td valign="top">From what I can glean from the comments, it appears that you`ve been penalised by some voters for the internal border.<br/>That`s a great pity as this is a real work of art and worth a full point more than it got IMO.<br/>I can never quite understand why people let the frame or border distract them.  <br/>For what it`s worth, I thought your border was quite subtle and fitted in well with the image but I`m obviously in the minority.<br/> <br/>Seriously good stuff..well done.<br/> <br/></td>', 'From what I can glean from the comments, it appears that you`ve been penalised by some voters for the internal border.That`s a great pity as this is a real work of art and worth a full point more than it got IMO.I can never quite understand why people let the frame or border distract them.  For what it`s worth, I thought your border was quite subtle and fitted in well with the image but I`m obviously in the minority. Seriously good stuff..well done. ', '2006-08-07 14:26:44.000000', NULL, 0),
