(2703066, 372280, 24454, '<td valign="top">So incredibly underrated!!!  To me, that bird looks as if he was literally posing for a zen photo.  The balance on one foot.  The perch on that particular spot with the beautiful soft greens as a backdrop.<br/> <br/>Where he <i>should</i> be perched is on the first or 2nd page minimum!!!!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'So incredibly underrated!!!  To me, that bird looks as if he was literally posing for a zen photo.  The balance on one foot.  The perch on that particular spot with the beautiful soft greens as a backdrop. Where he should be perched is on the first or 2nd page minimum!!!!!! ', '2006-08-07 14:46:28.000000', NULL, 0),
