(2703505, 372155, 18552, '<td valign="top">Laurie, I think your picture is nice and quite Zen. I gave it a 6. If it would have been in color I think it might have scored much higher. Not bright, blazing, high contrast color but subtle color. While it is very zen to have the cloud and bird in the same shape and angle the B&amp;W makes it seem a bit dull.<br/> <br/>Since Zen is so subtle it sometimes just doesn''t come across well in B&amp;W (at least to me) - if you had just desaturated this around 75% and left that slight hint of color in it I think it would have been fantastic. I''d love to see a version like that!</td>', 'Laurie, I think your picture is nice and quite Zen. I gave it a 6. If it would have been in color I think it might have scored much higher. Not bright, blazing, high contrast color but subtle color. While it is very zen to have the cloud and bird in the same shape and angle the B&W makes it seem a bit dull. Since Zen is so subtle it sometimes just doesn''t come across well in B&W (at least to me) - if you had just desaturated this around 75% and left that slight hint of color in it I think it would have been fantastic. I''d love to see a version like that!', '2006-08-07 16:23:24.000000', NULL, 0),
