(2703604, 369178, 48890, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JRalston:</b></div><hr/><i> The shadows are a major distraction for me.  Fits the challenge and is well composed, but better lighting could have made it great </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I don''t understand.  You are saying that you don''t like the shadows here, but that the shot is well composed.  Take away the shadows, and what''s left of the image?  What is well composed, then?</td>', 'Originally posted by JRalston: The shadows are a major distraction for me.  Fits the challenge and is well composed, but better lighting could have made it great  I don''t understand.  You are saying that you don''t like the shadows here, but that the shot is well composed.  Take away the shadows, and what''s left of the image?  What is well composed, then?', '2006-08-07 16:55:15.000000', NULL, 0),
