(2703688, 372049, 53964, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''ve looked at this over and over, and I''ve finally realised just what is...."off?"...  It''s my perspective!  Seeing it in thumbnail again triggered the lightbulb.  This is one of those shots that need to be viewed from a bit farther back to allow all the elements to blend perfectly.  We''re noticing small details which, alone, may not seem quite right somehow, but fit perfectly into the totality. <br/> When I move back from my screen it works wonderfully and I can totally picture it as a large print in a simple frame. :)</td>', 'Okay, I''ve looked at this over and over, and I''ve finally realised just what is...."off?"...  It''s my perspective!  Seeing it in thumbnail again triggered the lightbulb.  This is one of those shots that need to be viewed from a bit farther back to allow all the elements to blend perfectly.  We''re noticing small details which, alone, may not seem quite right somehow, but fit perfectly into the totality.  When I move back from my screen it works wonderfully and I can totally picture it as a large print in a simple frame. :)', '2006-08-07 17:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2703694, 372189, 47541, '<td valign="top">This was one of my higher rated shots in this challenge as I love the simplicity and the colours.  As noted during the challenge I find the clouds a bit too distracting.</td>', 'This was one of my higher rated shots in this challenge as I love the simplicity and the colours.  As noted during the challenge I find the clouds a bit too distracting.', '2006-08-07 17:35:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(2703703, 371587, 47541, '<td valign="top">I didnt get to this one in my voting but I would have given a 7 or 8 for this.  The blues are great and the clouds are nicely reflected in the water.  The lights on the shore add to the feeling of zen as they seem to imply a sparseness and simplicity of the people living on the shore.  If I had to be picky I''d say remove the "log'' in the water.</td>', 'I didnt get to this one in my voting but I would have given a 7 or 8 for this.  The blues are great and the clouds are nicely reflected in the water.  The lights on the shore add to the feeling of zen as they seem to imply a sparseness and simplicity of the people living on the shore.  If I had to be picky I''d say remove the "log'' in the water.', '2006-08-07 17:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
