(2717039, 372034, 3724, '<td valign="top">beautiful...  <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.hoashi.com/teahouse/graphics/teahouse-simplecover.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.hoashi.com/teahouse/graphics/teahouse-simplecover.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.hoashi.com/teahouse/graphics/teahouse-simplecover.jpg"/> <br/></td>', 'beautiful...    ', '2006-08-11 08:38:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2718629, 372166, 32321, '<td valign="top">Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>First Impression:<br/>Nice shot. Eye drawn to the dark hair then up to the sun glow, the shore and then back to the person. <br/> <br/>Composition:<br/>Centered composition works for this shot. Wide works, but I find the shallow height raising questions. Given the light &amp; shadows, it makes me think you cropped out a bridge. Not very Zen like. I would have liked to have seen a bit more shore between the person and the bottom. They look crowded. <br/>I like the feeling of space.<br/> <br/>Subject:<br/>Meets challenge<br/> <br/>Technical:<br/>Given the Zen topic, I like what you did technically.<br/> <br/>Suggestions:<br/>I like the attempt at space but more height would have been effective<br/> <br/>Summary:<br/>Nice shot and post processing. I think the cropping and the aggressive aspect ratio may have worked against you.<br/></td>', 'Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club. First Impression:Nice shot. Eye drawn to the dark hair then up to the sun glow, the shore and then back to the person.  Composition:Centered composition works for this shot. Wide works, but I find the shallow height raising questions. Given the light & shadows, it makes me think you cropped out a bridge. Not very Zen like. I would have liked to have seen a bit more shore between the person and the bottom. They look crowded. I like the feeling of space. Subject:Meets challenge Technical:Given the Zen topic, I like what you did technically. Suggestions:I like the attempt at space but more height would have been effective Summary:Nice shot and post processing. I think the cropping and the aggressive aspect ratio may have worked against you.', '2006-08-11 17:49:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2718840, 371069, 52945, '<td valign="top">Needs to be sharper and have more drama ;)<br/> <br/>I really like the tranquility that the cool colours give to this image, this is further reinforced by the low contrast and softness of the mountains. Very Zen.<br/> <br/>The vignette doesn''t really do it for me. Maybe if it was more subtle.</td>', 'Needs to be sharper and have more drama ;) I really like the tranquility that the cool colours give to this image, this is further reinforced by the low contrast and softness of the mountains. Very Zen. The vignette doesn''t really do it for me. Maybe if it was more subtle.', '2006-08-11 18:24:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(2718869, 371840, 26464, '<td valign="top">i gave this a 6 during challenge.. i would have liked it better if she was facing away from the viewer and looking at the sky/tree... i think the problem is that there''s too much to look at in the photo. but a nice effort indeed.<br/> <br/>friends of mine keep bugging me to get to california.. one day.<br/></td>', 'i gave this a 6 during challenge.. i would have liked it better if she was facing away from the viewer and looking at the sky/tree... i think the problem is that there''s too much to look at in the photo. but a nice effort indeed. friends of mine keep bugging me to get to california.. one day.', '2006-08-11 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2719071, 372193, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   Excellent zen! I love the colors and the composition. The softness kind of gives it a peaceful, almost surreal feel to it. The gradient in the sky is gorgeous as well. Beautiful job all around as usual. So sad to hear it might go to the bulldozers.</td>', 'Trading post...   Excellent zen! I love the colors and the composition. The softness kind of gives it a peaceful, almost surreal feel to it. The gradient in the sky is gorgeous as well. Beautiful job all around as usual. So sad to hear it might go to the bulldozers.', '2006-08-11 19:51:34.000000', NULL, 0),
