(2748797, 370032, 58281, '<td valign="top">This is one of the most beautiful landscape images Ive seen, rich in blue and green tones with a great foreground in a lovely composition. Without being too critical I find the pottery a little imposing amidst all the beautiful surroundings, so I probably would have cropped it out. None the less a magnificant image. Cheers. Robert Woolrich.</td>', 'This is one of the most beautiful landscape images Ive seen, rich in blue and green tones with a great foreground in a lovely composition. Without being too critical I find the pottery a little imposing amidst all the beautiful surroundings, so I probably would have cropped it out. None the less a magnificant image. Cheers. Robert Woolrich.', '2006-08-22 13:01:20.000000', NULL, 0),
