(2768329, 371453, 5885, '<td valign="top">Actually the technicals are pretty good, but I''m not sure I understand the photo at all... LOL.<br/> <br/>Think composition though. The comp here. Move the candle to a more interesting point. Have the knife run one of the thirds lines of the photo. Centered rarely does well.<br/> <br/>Also. having 2 subjects comes across as contirved in a person''s mind. It is often more powerful to have three subjects.</td>', 'Actually the technicals are pretty good, but I''m not sure I understand the photo at all... LOL. Think composition though. The comp here. Move the candle to a more interesting point. Have the knife run one of the thirds lines of the photo. Centered rarely does well. Also. having 2 subjects comes across as contirved in a person''s mind. It is often more powerful to have three subjects.', '2006-08-28 16:18:36.000000', NULL, 0),
