(2822549, 372500, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nemesise1977:</b></div><hr/><i> I am sorry I missed on voting in this challange. you gaught the essence of Zen in this shot, minimal detail to tell a story </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>you are wonderful....... yes. I tried to get that lonely and still existing feel.. I would call ya a genius but you have prolly already been told.</td>', 'Originally posted by nemesise1977: I am sorry I missed on voting in this challange. you gaught the essence of Zen in this shot, minimal detail to tell a story   you are wonderful....... yes. I tried to get that lonely and still existing feel.. I would call ya a genius but you have prolly already been told.', '2006-09-11 05:41:05.000000', NULL, 0),
