(2858519, 369967, 8891, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by posthumous:</b></div><hr/><i> The painting is not zen<br/>the painter is not zen<br/>the space between painter and painting<br/>the leg disappearing<br/>zen<br/> <br/>7 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The painting in the water is surreal, Tony Curtis is surreal (especially his acting) the whole image is surreal....and what is more zen than surreal (probably a lot, but I love the capture....should have scored higher just because TC was in it...out of the limelight far too long, I guess....get someone from ''24'' or ''Lost'' and you''d have been in the top ten!)</td>', 'Originally posted by posthumous: The painting is not zenthe painter is not zenthe space between painter and paintingthe leg disappearingzen 7   The painting in the water is surreal, Tony Curtis is surreal (especially his acting) the whole image is surreal....and what is more zen than surreal (probably a lot, but I love the capture....should have scored higher just because TC was in it...out of the limelight far too long, I guess....get someone from ''24'' or ''Lost'' and you''d have been in the top ten!)', '2006-09-23 08:52:33.000000', NULL, 0),
