(6377699, 372121, 52549, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you noticed that comment (which really bothered me at the time) because I hadn''t seen anything similar to the image I did at any time beforehand. I only thought about using the plastic bag because the cleaning lady at work left a roll of them by mistake in my office ;-)<br/> <br/>Maybe I rained on that guys parade... ;-))<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fotomann_forever:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kgeary:</b></div><hr/><i> get your own style! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''m trying to figure out what exactly this means....<br/> <br/>Irene is definitely one photographer here that has her own style. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Interesting that you noticed that comment (which really bothered me at the time) because I hadn''t seen anything similar to the image I did at any time beforehand. I only thought about using the plastic bag because the cleaning lady at work left a roll of them by mistake in my office ;-) Maybe I rained on that guys parade... ;-)) Originally posted by fotomann_forever: Originally posted by kgeary: get your own style!   I''m trying to figure out what exactly this means.... Irene is definitely one photographer here that has her own style. ', '2011-04-07 13:03:05.000000', NULL, 0),
